window.FWN_MESMERIZING_GHOST_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_MESMERIZING_GHOST_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4501,"title":"Chapter 4501: Means","paragraphs":["Chapter 4501: Means","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Although this had completely subverted his outlook in life, and he quickly stabilised his mind and looking at the messy hall, his eyes fell on Hao’er, but his words were asking Pan Ning: ” Pan Ning, what the hell is going on here? What is this thing? And how did those ... appear?”","Those Yin Souls that were floating in the corner, some were wearing a white dress, covered with long hair, face pale and lifeless, some had their heads hanging down, whose faces couldn’t even be seen. They were just floating about, making some scary ‘oooooh’ and ghostly voices. Seeing such a scene, even for him who never ever did believe in the likes of ghosts and evil things, could not help but make his heart jump.","In this world, there are actually real ghosts!","“Still not going to disperse? Do you want me to beat your souls until it scatters!” Hao’er shouted with a cold voice, his spirit energy breath accompanied by the pressure came out, and those ghosts that were still floating and unwilling to leave immediately let out a miserable scream, and disappeared the very next moment.","With the dispersal of those Yin souls, the cold atmosphere in the hall also eased for a few points.","When Pan Ning and the others saw this, they couldn’t help but secretly heave a sigh of relief, and after a moment’s reprieve, Pan Ning simply explained, “Marquis, the so-called Immortal that the Emperor had invited into the palace was a demon, and it was only because he attached himself to the Emperor that the previous events occurred.”","“I didn’t expect that there really is a demon in this world, or a golden toad demon.” Marquis Qibo vaguely also guessed something, his eyes looked at the huge golden toad on the ground that was bound by the silver net, his eyes couldn’t help but move slightly.","That silver net seems to be a treasure, and to be able to subdue this demon, this ten years old or so Xuanyuan Hao is indeed not simple ah!","“Young Immortal Master, the Emperor is possessed by that demon, will anything happen to him?” The old man had been unable to wake up the Emperor and couldn’t help but ask with worry.","“It’s just a few mouthfuls of essence being sucked, it won’t kill him.” Hao’er said, and was about to go up and ask this golden toad, where it came from, when he was summoned by Pan Ning.","“Hao’er, can we save the Emperor from waking up first? If he doesn’t wake up, I’m afraid that this matter will not be able to be settled later.”","Upon hearing this, Hao’er’s feet stopped in midair as he looked towards Muchen and said, “Chen’er, go wake him up.”","“Alright.”","Muchen answered, his taut little face was calm, he walked up to the front of the throne, his hand condensed a little spirit energy into the Emperor’s brow, not a moment later, the Emperor was seen to wake up.","“Emperor!” Seeing this, the old man was relieved and gratefully saluted towards Muchen, “Many thanks to little Immortal Elder.”","“What was ... just now,” the Emperor was stunned, somewhat not remembering what happened just now, only feeling very weak, and speaking with some lack of strength.","Only then did the old man whisper by his side about what happened earlier.","“Young Benefactor, how should this demonic creature be dealt with?” Abbot asked as he looked towards Hao’er, worried that if he let it escape, it would go around causing chaos.","Hao’er did not say anything, but just came to that golden toad and asked in a cold voice, “Where did you come from and how did you enter this mortal realm?”","However, the golden toad did not say a word and only stared at him with hatred.","Seeing this, Hao’er turned his hand, and with a swoosh, a sharp sword pierced into the golden toad’s leg that had not been cut off: “Speak!” As the sharp sword pierced in, a stream of green blood seeped out, and a miserable scream spilled out from the golden toad’s mouth.","“Arghhhhh!”","“Hmph, are you going to say it or not!” Hao’er drew his sword and prepared to stab down again, that indifferent look, cold eyes, even Marquis Qibo who was on the side could not help but be stunned when he saw it.","“Say! I’ll say, I’ll say!”"]},{"number":4502,"title":"Chapter 4502: Floating Edge Immortal Island","paragraphs":["Chapter 4502: Floating Edge Immortal Island","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Seeing that the sharp sword was about to stab down again, that Golden Toad Demon was so shocked that he hurriedly opened his mouth and asked tentatively again, “If I say it, can you spare my life? I promise that I will leave this place and will not appear in this mortal realm again.”","If it had known that there was such a small pervert in this inconspicuous mortal realm, how would it have dared to come here to run wild? Right now, it was feeling trepidation and fear from the bottom of its heart towards this tiny teenager in front of it.","Hao’er’s eyes flashed as he stared at the golden toad demon and said, “Then it depends on whether I am satisfied with what you say.” As the words fell, he glanced out of the corner of his eye and saw that the people in the hall were all staring at this place, and his heart moved as he called out.","“Chen’er, Yue’er, come here.”","Hearing this, the two little ones trotted to his side, and seeing that, with a wave of his hand, their Big Brother laid down a boundary, isolating sight as well as sound, so that the people outside the boundary couldn’t see or hear what they were saying.","“Big Brother, can’t we let them hear?” Yue’er asked with some doubt.","“They are only mortals after all, knowing too much about Immortal Cultivation won’t do them any good.” Hao’er said, looking towards that Golden Toad Demon and said, “You can speak now.”","Upon hearing this, the golden toad demon was delighted, thinking that it had gained a ray of hope, and immediately said, “I am a golden toad demon that has been cultivated and formed for five hundred years, and I stole out from that Floating Edge Immortal Island.”","“Floating Edge Immortal Island? Where is it? How far is it from here?” Hao’er asked in a hurry.","“That is a place isolated from the mortal realm, a place for Immortal Cultivators, and I am not a flying type of demon, so it took me more than two months to come here from there.” That Golden Toad Demon said, and then hastened to say, “But if you guys have flying machines or swords, it would only take about a month to go to the Floating Edge Immortal Island from here, moreover, I drew a map after I came out from the Floating Edge Immortal Island, so you guys will be able to go to that Floating Edge Immortal Island by yourselves if you look for it along with the map.”","It looked at Hao’er and begged for mercy, “I have told you everything I know, please spare my life!”","“Where is the map?” Hao’er asked.","The golden toad demon paused, its mouth opened, and a cosmos sack was spat out from its mouth, “The map is inside.”","Hao’er took it and opened it, there was definitely a map inside, he took a look at it and then put it away, he then asked, “What kind of place is that Floating Edge Immortal Island? Tell me clearly and carefully, the more you tell me, the more likely I will spare your life and let you go.”","Hearing these words, that golden toad was delighted, and at that moment did not dare to hide anything anymore, and carefully told them everything it knew about the Floating Edge Immortal Island.","While outside the boundary, the Emperor and Pan Ning and the others who watched that demonic creature and those three children simply vanish into thin air, were stunned, not knowing what had happened.","“They have gone?” The Emperor frowned and asked, looking at the figures that suddenly vanished before him. His heart was feeling a little anxious, he had yet to ask those three children on how to live forever, how could they leave?","“They should still be around.”","Marquis Qibo said, reaching out his hand to probe forward. He was a person who practiced martial arts, and he was also more sensitive to the fluctuation of airflow, at this time, even if he couldn’t see it, he could feel that there seemed to be something not far in front of him, so he stretched out his hand to explore it, but after touching the airflow it was bounced away, and his whole body stepped back a few metres.","“It’s good that they’ve not gone! DidThat’s good!” The Emperor heaved a sigh of relief as his pair of eyes with expectation and excitement looked at that empty spot which they had vanished from sight."]},{"number":4503,"title":"Chapter 4503: Conditions","paragraphs":["Chapter 4503: Conditions","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Seeing that he couldn’t see or hear, Marquis Qibo then said, “Emperor, the Imperial Guards outside are still guarding, I’ll go out and take care of it, so let them retreat first.”","“Good, go!”","The Emperor sat against the throne, his gaze then on the empty hall, waiting for those three children to appear, while speculating in his mind, why did they use this Immortal technique as a cover? Is there something they don’t want them to know?","As the time passed, the Emperor waited and got a little restless, he stood up and walked around for a few moments, and sat down again, when suddenly, an extremely unpleasant odour filled the air, causing him to cover his mouth and nose.","“What is that smell?”","He asked with a deep voice, and then he saw, that the three children who had originally disappeared appeared in sight, and in front of them, the Golden Toad Demon that was bound by the silver net had already turned into a puddle of greenish blood, and that foul odour was emanating from that blood.","“You killed it?” The Emperor was surprised, looking at the cold face of Xuanyuan Hao. Earlier, listening to that meaning, it seemed that they would not kill it if that demon spoke out information that was useful to them.","Hao’er led his brother and sister to move away, lest their boots get covered in that foul-smelling stuff, and when he heard the Emperor’s words, his cold gaze looked towards the Emperor and said, “From the time it had set its evil ideas on my brother and sister, it was doomed to die!”","The implication was that he had never thought of sparing its life at all!","The Emperor listened to these words and looked at the tiny teenager, his heart could not help but be shaken. This little teenager was warning him.","“Amitabha, it’s good that that demon is dead, if not for the little benefactor today, I’m afraid that no one here would be able to deal with it.” The Abbot went up and said, looking at that demon had finally died, this matter was also resolved. Right now those three children Immortal’s identity can’t be hidden, the Emperor will not do anything to them, so he opened his mouth to take his leave.","Seeing this, the Emperor asked Marquis Qibo to also retire first.","With the departure of the two monks and Marquis Qibo, only the Emperor and the old man as well as Pan Ning and the three children were left in the side hall, looking at the atmosphere in the hall which was a bit weird, Hao’er then looked at the Emperor and asked, “Can we go now?”","“You still want to go back to the Pan family?” The Emperor glanced at the three of them, then glanced at Pan Ning on the side and said, “How about, you just stay in the palace!”","“No need.” Hao’er refused completely, not giving half a face at all.","Seeing this, the Emperor narrowed his eyes and stared at him, saying, “It’s fine if you don’t live here, but did that demon tell you where it came from? Also, there are Immortals and demons in this world, so, do you people who cultivate Immortals also have the art of living forever?”","Hao’er’s heart moved slightly, looking at the Emperor, he said, “It came from the other side of the heavenly realm just like us, it just came from a different place, even if it is a person who cultivates Immortality, there is no such thing as longevity, the lifespan of a person who cultivates Immortality is just longer than you mortals.”","“So the Immortal pills and elixirs, aren’t they able to increase longevity? Can’t they make one rise from the dead?” The Emperor stared at Hao’er and said, “Since you were able to save Pan Hong back then, you naturally have an Immortal Pill in your possession, right? You can say what you want, This Emperor only wants to request a few Immortal Pills.”","Hao’er was silent and did not know what he was thinking about, after a long time, he glanced at Pan Ning before looking at the Emperor and said, “I can give you two medicinal pills, but there are conditions.”"]},{"number":4504,"title":"Chapter 4504: Sheltering Three Generations","paragraphs":["Chapter 4504: Sheltering Three Generations","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Two medicinal pills?” The Emperor glanced at him, the implication being that he felt two were too few.","“That’s right, two. One is an antidote pill that can cure a hundred poisons, as well as a medicinal pill that can keep you alive in times of danger.”","Hao’er looked at him and said, “For you mortals, no matter which one you take, in addition to resolving the crisis of the moment, it is also extremely beneficial to the body, even if you cannot use it to increase your lifespan by a hundred years, but more than a dozen or so years of lifespan is possible.”","At these words, the Emperor’s eyes flickered, his heart moved slightly, so he said, “Alright! Tell us about the conditions you mentioned, and what are they?”","Hao’er glanced towards Pan Ning before saying to the Emperor, “Their Pan family has helped us, the condition for giving you those two medicinal pills is that you shelter their Pan family and I want them to be free of worries for three generations.”","Hearing that it was such a condition, the Emperor was a bit surprised and couldn’t help but look towards Pan Ning.","When Pan Ning heard this, his heart shook, he didn’t think that Hao’er would ask for three generations for them to be free from worries, this sentiment can be considered extremely heavy.","“No problem.” The Emperor looked at Hao’er and said, “Their Pan family was originally valued by This Emperor, to protect them for three generations, This Emperor can do it.”","However, when Hao’er heard this, he shook his head, “That’s not right, there should be an imperial decree or something to back it up, after all, you are you, your son is your son, he won’t necessarily follow what you say.”","“You!”","The Emperor glared at him, thinking that this kid was also too uneducated, however, for such a condition, he felt nothing, so he said, “Alright, I agree. I will give a secret decree, let Pan Ning bring it back to his home, in the future, as long as their Pan family doesn’t do anything rebellious, This Emperor’s imperial dynasty, no matter which prince will be on the throne in the future, will ensure that they will be free of worries for three generations. ”","He waved his hand and signalled for the old man at the side to prepare, and within a short time, he put pen to paper and wrote down a secret decree, stamped it with a large seal, and finally had the old man hand it over to Pan Ning, while at the same time saying to Hao’er, “This is fine, isn’t it?”","Pan Ning held the secret decree in both hands, the whole person stood dumbfounded, so shocked that he somewhat failed to react, until, Hao’er walked up and took the decree from his hands and looked at it before placing it back in his hands, only then did he come to his senses, and hastily knelt down.","“I, on behalf of the three generations of the Pan family, thank the Emperor for his grand grace and greatness!” His hand holding that secret decree was trembling, how could he not expect that this trip to the palace had resulted in such a precious treasure.","The Emperor, on the other hand, after seeing Hao’er’s action of checking the decree, he gritted his teeth and thought: what kind of parents would teach such a son? It’s really infuriating!","He is the head of a country, is it possible that he would still swindle him? He actually went to check the authenticity of the imperial decree? Really annoying!","“Alright, alright, get up and stand aside.” The Emperor brushed it off, while his gaze went to that brat.","Only then did Hao’er take out two bottles from his space and hand them forward, saying, “These two medicinal pills are very precious, even in the Immortal Cultivation World, they are priceless.”","After receiving the medicinal pills, the Emperor looked at the name of the medicine written on the top of the bottles before noticing that there were two words at the bottom of the bottles, so he softly murmured, “Ghost Doctor?”","He looked at Hao’er and asked, “Who is this Ghost Doctor?”","Hao’er didn’t answer him, but just said, “We’re going back to the Pan family, and you shouldn’t look for us to come into the palace again; we’ll leave here soon.”"]},{"number":4505,"title":"Chapter 4505: Great Grace","paragraphs":["Chapter 4505: Great Grace","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","From the moment he spoke those words, the Emperor also knew that they must have wanted to leave, and hearing him say that, he wasn’t surprised and just nodded: “This Emperor knows.”","He looked towards Pan Ning and said, “You take them back!”","“Yes.” Pan Ning responded and performed a salute before leaving with the three Hao’er.","After watching them leave and disappear from sight, the Emperor looked at the two bottles in his hands and sighed, “I didn’t expect that on this day, This Emperor would not only meet a demon, but also an Immortal, and even obtain two precious medicinal pills.”","The old man quietly stood aside and did not say anything, because he knew that the Emperor did not need him to say anything either.","Pan Ning put that secret decree away in his arms, walking all the way he only felt his pace light under his feet, until he was out of the palace gates and on their Pan family’s carriage heading back, only then did he in the carriage let out a light breath.","He looked towards the three children and got up to give them a big salute, a thousand words that ultimately only turned into one sentence, “Many thanks.”","Hao’er held him up and said, “There’s no need for that, we’re just returning the favour.”","The carriage went all the way to the Pan family, Pan Ning sent the three children back to the southern courtyard first, and then hurriedly ran to find his grandfather, as well as his father and Big Brother, and told them about the matter.","In the Pan family’s study, listening to what Pan Ning said, as well as looking at the holy decree that was spread out in front of them, the several Masters of the Pan family were each too shocked to speak.","“They actually begged for such an imperial decree for them, this, this ... ” The Old Predecessor of the Pan Family looked at that imperial decree in shock, his heart filled with indescribable gratitude as well as incredulity.","“I didn’t think that they were actually Immortals, our Pan Family is greatly blessed!” Pan father also spoke excitedly.","Sparing the always calm Pan Hong, at this moment, looking at that holy decree, his heart was also shaken. This holy decree for their Pan family, that is really a precious treasure that can’t be more precious, three generations of no worries, this is not an ordinary Emperor’s grace.","“You’d all better listen.”","The Pan Family Old Predecessor put away his shocked expression, took a deep breath and looked at them, saying, “Today’s matter, apart from us, no one can say anything, even your wives and sons, you can’t say anything to them. Lest any trouble be born for no reason, this imperial decree, it has to be carefully put away, and passed down from generation to generation in the future.”","“Yes, we know.”","Several people responded, also knowing that this matter was grave. The Emperor’s grace for three generations, they do not need to use this imperial decree, but after a hundred years of the Emperor’s next Emperor, do not see that they will also tolerate the Pan family, if it comes to that time, this kind of imperial decree is to protect their Pan family up and down. Such a thing, naturally, the fewer people who knows about it, the better.","“Keep the imperial decree into the secret compartment, let us go and pay our respects to them.” The Pan Family’s Old Predecessor spoke.","After putting the imperial decree away, they headed to the Southern Courtyard together.","At this moment, in the Southern Courtyard, the three children were counting treasures in their room with the door closed.","That Golden Toad Demon had died, and those treasures that the Golden Toad Demon had hidden naturally fell into their hands.","“Big Brother, what can this Golden Toad Demon’s inner core do?” Yue’er asked as she held a bead with a faint golden glow in her hand.","“This Golden Toad Demon’s inner core has the power to detoxify, if you take a bowl of clear water and put this bead inside the clear water and soak it, the water will detoxify the poison.” Hao’er said as he was busy sorting those treasures.","Muchen looked at the pile of treasures in front of him, thought for a moment, and said, “Big Brother, give this Golden Toad Demon’s inner core to the Pan Family! Pick a few more things to give to Boqing and the few of them.”"]},{"number":4506,"title":"Chapter 4506: Farewell","paragraphs":["Chapter 4506: Farewell","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Upon hearing this, Hao’er’s face revealed a smirk as he said, “Well, I have this intention as well, apart from this inner core, you guys can pick out a few more things from these and give them to them!”","“Good.” The two of them responded and carefully picked them out.","They were no better than those of them who cultivated Immortals, some of the magic treasures and other things that required spirit energy to catalyse them could not be used by them, and even if they were given, they would be useless, so the things to be given to them would still have to be carefully picked out.","“Young Master Hao, Old Patriarch and the others are here.” Seventeen reported from outside the courtyard.","Hearing this, the three people in the room looked at each other and after covering their things with the quilt, they shouted for Seventeen to invite them in while walking outside to open the door to the room.","The Pan family father and son several people entered the room, and after handing over to seventeen to guard outside the courtyard, they closed the door of the room, and as soon as they turned around, several people made a big salute towards Hao’er and the others.","“There’s no need to do this.” The three of them said in a hurry, stepping forward to help them.","“You deserve it, you have done great favours to our Pan family, this bow, is proper, otherwise, we will be uneasy in our hearts.” The Old Patriarch said, insisting on bowing again.","Seeing this, the three children looked at each other and didn’t stop them any further, and only after they had made the big bow did he ask them to sit down.","“I heard Pan Ning say that you guys are preparing to leave?” Old Patriarch asked, looking at the three children. From the first day he saw them, he knew that they were not simple, and then later on, when he personally taught them how to practice writing and reading, he even realised that these three children were extraordinary, but he never thought that these three children, who were so extraordinary, were actually Immortals.","“Well, let’s get ready, we’ll be leaving in a few days.” Hao’er said.","“Where are you guys heading to? Just the three of you? Why don’t I send someone to send you guys! It’s safer than the three of you children going on the road.” Old Patriarch said, after all, in his opinion, these were still three children.","“No need, Great Grandfather~ Yue’er and brother are both very good now.” Yue’er said with a smile, looking towards her Big Brother, crisply saying, “Moreover, Big Brother is also very powerful, Big Brother will protect us.”","Hao’er looked at Yue’er, and the look on his face softened a few points as he said to the few of them, “At first, my strength had not recovered, but now that my strength has recovered, there won’t be any problems protecting them.”","With that, he looked towards Pan Hong and said, “Uncle Hong, I can’t cure your leg, however, if there is an opportunity in the future, we will ask her to come and cure your leg.”","Pan Hong didn’t think that he still remembered this leg of his, at that moment, he said, “It’s alright, I’m fine the way I am now, but it’s just a pair of legs, it’s already good enough to be alive.”","They were not from the same world as them, his pair of legs was just a pair of legs, how could he dare to labour them to come from an extremely far place to treat him.","They chatted in the room for a while before getting up and leaving, and because they said that they would not allow anyone to disturb them in their closed-door cultivation, the Pan family then also gave orders for no one to disturb them.","In the following days, Marquis Qibo did visit the door a few times wanting to see them, but, time and time again, he returned without success.","Until the morning of half a month later, the three children walked out of the courtyard. Yue’er said, “Big Brother, let’s go find Sister Xue’er and the others to say goodbye!”","Big Brother said that they were leaving today, and they had all the gifts prepared, and still wanted to see the little ones again before they left.","“Alright.” Hao’er touched her head and led her and Muchen out of the courtyard."]},{"number":4507,"title":"Chapter 4507: Farewell Gift","paragraphs":["Chapter 4507: Farewell Gift","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The three of them went directly to the front courtyard, and after sitting in the hall for a while, the Old Patriarch of the Pan Family several people came in a hurry, followed by the three of them, Bowen Boqing and Xue’er.","“Yue’er sister, Brother Muchen, I haven’t seen you guys for a long time! I’ve missed you all!” As soon as the Boqing saw them, he dashed towards them with excitement.","“Why don’t you all come out to play? Staying in the courtyard every day will make you stupid, look, my Father made me a wooden sword, it’s so much fun.” With an excited face, he took out the small wooden sword attached to his waist and showed it to them, while saying, “In the future, I will be able to practise with you guys, these days I have followed my Father to learn the sword!”","Looking at the excited and happy Boqing, Yue’er’s face was also overflowing with smile, a pair of big beautiful eyes blinking as she looked at him, reaching out her hand as she said, “Brother Boqing, you’ve grown taller again!”","“That’s for sure, I eat a bowl of rice a meal!” Boqing straightened his small chest and said, while saying, “Sister Yue’er, are you playing with us today?”","“We are here to say goodbye to you today, we are leaving.” Yue’er said, looking at him whose expression had crumbled immediately as he grabbed her hand with a nervous face.","“What? You guys are leaving? Why are you guys leaving? Where are you guys going?”","“Are you guys really leaving? Aren’t you guys going to stay for some more days?” Bowen also stepped forward and looked at them with reluctance in his eyes.","“I don’t want you guys to go either.” Upon hearing this, Xue’er also grabbed Yue’er’s hand, her eyes reddening.","“Alright.” The Old Patriarch snapped, glancing at his own family’s several children, saying, “Sit aside.”","Once the three children heard this, they obediently stood aside.","“We’re leaving today, Big Brother brought us here to say goodbye to you.” Muchen looked at the three of them, his small face still taut, and walked forward, taking out three jade pendants and handing them to the three of them, saying, “This is a gift from the three of us to give you a remembrance.”","When the several adults saw this, they could not help but be slightly stunned, and quickly said, “How can this be done, this thing is too expensive ... ” The things they sent out, that must be the treasure of the Immortal family, how could the three children accept that kind of expensive treasure.","Yue’er smiled and said, “Big Brother asked us to pick out three gifts to give to Big Brother Bowen and Big Brother Boqing as well as Sister Xue’er, so Big Brother and I picked out these three pendants.”","“Take it! It’s not anything expensive.” Hao’er said and looked at the Old Patriarch, saying, “We still have some things to tell you.”","Upon hearing this, the Pan family’s father and son looked at each other before standing the three children to accept the gift, and then letting them go out and wait outside before closing the door.","Hao’er handed a box forward and said, “This is the inner core of that Golden Toad Demon, soak this inner core in clean water for a while, it can cure a hundred poisons, this inner core is for you to keep, don’t let anyone know.”","After telling them the instructions on using it, he added: “As for those things that we gave to the children, it is best to also let them know not to say anything to others, so as not to attract unnecessary trouble.”","“This ...” The several people did not expect that they would actually still give them these treasures, for a moment, did not know whether to take it or not.","“There’s no use for us to keep this, so you guys just take it!” Hao’er said, putting the box into the Old Patriarch’s hands."]},{"number":4508,"title":"Chapter 4508: Leaving","paragraphs":["Chapter 4508: Leaving","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Alright, then we will accept it. We will keep this treasure carefully, thank you.” Old Patriarch solemnly said, putting that small box into his arms, thought for a moment, said, “For three children to travel alone on the road, even if you are skilled, you should still be careful against those people with bad intentions who will set their sights on you. How can you not have an adult with you?”","His voice paused for a moment, and after some thought, he said, “Seventeen has been with you for more than a year, so why not, let him follow you! If there is something along the way, he can also be entrusted to take care of it, if you arrive at a safe place and don’t want to keep him, you can also let him come back, if you want to keep him, you can keep him around to take care of you.”","Hao’er thought for a moment, then nodded: “Alright, then let Seventeen follow us!”","When the several members of the Pan family saw this, they revealed a smile, and Pan Ning said, “I’ll help you prepare the carriage!”","“Mm.” Hao’er responded and watched him go out before the Boqing few ran in again.","“Are you guys really leaving? Will you come back later?” Bowen couldn’t help but ask. The little friends who had been together for more than a year thought that they would always be here to grow up with them, but they didn’t expect that they suddenly had to leave.","“I’ll come back in the future if I have the chance.” Hao’er said.","“Mmmmm, when I become very powerful in the future and don’t need to be followed, I will come back to see you guys~” Yue’er said with a smile.","“You practice martial arts and sword training well, don’t be too weak.” Muchen on the other hand looked at Boqing and said, he wouldn’t say anything if he didn’t want to part with him, however, for the little companion who had been together for so long, once he had to leave, his heart would still be reluctant to part with him.","As soon as Boqing was told this by him, his eyes couldn’t help but redden and tears fell: “Oooo, don’t worry, I will definitely practice martial arts and sword training, when we meet in the future, I will be able to beat you.”","Muchen tensed his face, glanced at his face that was crying like a fancy cat, and said arrogantly, “You don’t need to think about beating me, you won’t be able to.”","Several children were talking in the hall, and as the housekeeper came to pass the word that the carriage was ready, so Hao’er’s trio once again said goodbye to them.","“Have a safe journey.”","The Pan family members said, sending them out, and after watching them get on the carriage, Pan Ning then said, “We’ve prepared some food for you in the carriage, so you can eat on the way.”","Afterwards, he also uneasily confided, “Seventeen, you have to take care of them on the road, in the future, they will be your Masters.”","“Yes.” Seventeen responded, looking at the Pan family, saying, “Seventeen will protect the three Masters.”","Under the reluctant gazes of the crowd, Seventeen drove the carriage slowly away. As he watched the carriage move away until it disappeared into the streets, Boqing took his father’s hand and tilted his head, asking, “Father, will they come back? In the future, will we still be able to see them?”","Pan Ning sighed softly in his heart, picked his son up, looked into the distance, and said, “They, are not the same as us.” Immortals and mortals were different, to be able to get along for so long and make such a good karmic connection was already something unimaginable.","The carriage took the three children away from the Pan family, almost at the same time, Marquis Qibo and the Emperor in the palace also knew about the three children leaving, only, they only sighed softly after getting the news."]},{"number":4509,"title":"Chapter 4509: It’s Not Easy","paragraphs":["Chapter 4509: It’s Not Easy","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","It is good that they had left as well. Rumours have ran amok in the city, since they have left, all it would take would be for time and they will be forgotten ...","In another realm, Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu were resting on the seashore, looking at the endless sea in front of them connected to the sky, Feng Jiu held her cheek with one hand and said, “This realm has almost been completely searched by us, it seems that we have to change another location again, just, where are we going to pick and search this time?”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze pondered and said, “Even though Chen’er and Yue’er failed to awaken their contracted beasts due to the blood curse, but Hao’er has a silver wolf in his body, and his own talent is high, perhaps, he has already broken through the blood curse and recovered, but there is no news from them for such a long time, could it be that they are located in a place where they are not able to connect with us? Otherwise, with Hao’er’s intelligence, he would have found a way to let us know where they are.”","“You mean, could they be in the mortal realm?” Feng Jiu was stunned and looked at him in surprise.","“This possibility cannot be ruled out.”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze nodded his head and said, “The place Old Man Tianji pointed out to find for the lower realm, this nearly two years, we are looking for only the cultivation realm, but rarely go to the mortal realm to check, if they are really in the mortal realm? With the strength of the three children, if they arrived at a place like that and without a teleportation shaft in their possession, they would not be able to cross the border to return to the Immortal Cultivation Realm at all.”","Hearing this, Feng Jiu hurriedly took out the map to check it out, and excluded some places, and finally circled a territory, saying, “This territory’s are all mortal realms, only, this place’s spirit energy aura is extremely weak, and there will hardly be any Immortal Cultivators dabbling in it, but the terrain is wider, and even if they were to look for the past one by one, I’m afraid that the fastest time would take two or three years.”","“Since there is a direction, no matter what, we have to try, however, don’t be too anxious, at least we know that the three children are safe now.” Xuanyuan Mo Ze held her hand and said.","“Well, I know, don’t worry! It’s been so long, my mind has also adjusted, Old Man Tianji also said that one day, we will still see them.” Feng Jiu smiled, exhaled lightly and said, “Yesterday, I sent a message back to my Father and the others so that they wouldn’t worry too much, and my brother even asked where we are now.”","She paused for a moment before continueing, “I also sent a message for Du Fan and the others to all go back, so that they don’t have to go looking around anymore, but they said that there wasn’t much to do when they went back, and asked me for information about it, so I told them what Old Man Tianji said, and presumably, they will go looking in that direction as well.”","“Since that’s the case, then let them look towards the mortal realm!” Xuanyuan Mo Ze looked at her and said, “With more people looking for them, they might be able to find them earlier.”","“Although this journey all we’ve been doing is just running around, however, I see that your cultivation seems to be fluctuating a bit, is it about to advance again?” Feng Jiu inquired, inexplicably thinking of what Old Man Tianji said that day again, there was always some worry in her heart.","“With so many Immortal Cultivators in this world, I’ve never heard of anyone stepping into the Supreme level.” Xuanyuan Mo Ze laughed and said, “What’s more, you and I have advanced at a divine speed, now even though we are at the peak of Divine King, it’s not an easy task to step into the Supreme level.”","Feng Jiu frowned and said uneasily, “Supreme level lightning tribulation is not trivial, I have to find time to refine a few medicinal pills for you to prepare.”"]},{"number":4510,"title":"Chapter 4510: Reaching","paragraphs":["Chapter 4510: Reaching","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Upon hearing this, Xuanyuan Mo Ze’s lips hooked up slightly and said, “Don’t worry! I’ll be fine even if I advance, what’s more, we haven’t found a few children yet, so how can we have any time to stop and refine medicinal pills and advance?”","Feng Jiu still wanted to say something, but she saw him holding her and standing up, saying, “Let’s go to the mortal realm to look for them!” As soon as his voice fell, he waved his hand and a vortex appeared around him, and then he led her towards that vortex.","With the two disappeared in that vortex, that vortex also disappeared in the air between, as never appeared ...","Three months later, in the evening.","A carriage clattered along the mountain road. Looking at the empty surroundings, Seventeen driving the carriage raised his alertness, seeing the sky gradually darkening, Seventeen spoke to the three in the carriage, “Young Master Hao, it’s getting dark, should we find a place to rest for the night first? We’ll leave tomorrow?”","In the carriage, Muchen was holding a night pearl in his hand while Yue’er was sitting on the side without making any noise. Hao’er was sitting between the two of them, spreading out a map and looking at it, when he heard Seventeen’s words, Hao’er’s hand was moving along the map, and he said: “No, continue to follow this road until the end and then stop.”","“Yes.” Seventeen responded respectfully and continued to drive the carriage forward.","“Big Brother, is there no more road when we get here?” Muchen asked as he pointed to the place on the map.","“No, it’s that after arriving here, the carriage can’t go any further, we have to walk. Look here, once we go over these mountains, we can reach this sea, and this Floating Edge Immortal Island is on the other side of this sea.” Hao’er looked at it while teaching them to read the map.","In the carriage, Hao’er had put up a soundproof boundary, and carefully explained some things to Muchen and Muyue, until, when the sky outside darkened, and the carriage stopped, he whisked his hand to remove the boundary, and at the same time, opened the curtain.","“Young Master Hao, there is no road ahead.” Seventeen looks at the dark front and looks around with some concern because, as night falls, he faintly hears the sounds of wild beasts roaring in the surroundings.","Hao’er and the three of them got out of the carriage one after another, and after taking a look around, Hao’er went forward, just to be shouted at by Seventeen.","“Young Master Hao, we can’t go any further ahead, there is a cliff in front of us.” Seventeen hastily reminded, worried that he would accidentally fall down. The carriage climbs along the mountain path until there is no more road here, yet it is also on top of a cliff.","“Let’s rest here tonight! We’ll leave again tomorrow.” Hao’er said and said to Muchen and Muyue, “You two go back to the carriage and rest.”","“I’ll go gather some branches to build a fire! It won’t be too cold at night.” Seventeen said, and was about to head towards the woods, but unexpectedly, Hao’er shook his head, “It will be dark soon, and there should be quite a few wild beasts around here, so you shouldn’t go.”","He looked at Seventeen and said, “This journey has taken three months and we are not far from our destination. Do you want to go back, or do you want to follow us?”","“Seventeen came out from the Pan family, the three Masters are already Seventeen’s Masters, Seventeen naturally follows the Masters, how can I go back!” He hurriedly said.","Hao’er paused for a moment and said, “Listen to me finish my words before making a decision.”"]},{"number":4511,"title":"Chapter 4511: Arrival","paragraphs":["Chapter 4511: Arrival","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Seeing this, Seventeen looked at him with unease and nervousness, worried that he would kick him out.","“You have been following us for almost two years, you should also know that we are Immortal Cultivators, while you are just a mortal, the place we are going to is where Immortal Cultivators are. It would be very difficult for mortals to survive if they arrive there, moreover, there are quite a lot of dangers around us, you may die in the hands of any Immortal Cultivator one day, if you follow us. ”","Hao’er looked at him and analysed the pros and cons to him, “If you leave now, I can give you a treasure, if you go back to the Pan family, you’ll have a smooth life. But, if you follow us, I can’t guarantee your safety, after all, I still have my younger siblings to protect, and very often, I may not be able to take care of you, so, you have to think about it. ”","Hearing this, Seventeen thought for a moment and asked, “Young Master Hao, then where the Immortal Cultivators are, is there not a single mortal?”","“Of course there are, not everyone can cultivate. Those without spiritual roots are also mortals, it’s just that, it’s hard for mortals to survive in places where cultivators are.”","“Seventeen wants to follow the three Masters.” He said firmly, saying, “Once there, Young Master Hao doesn’t need to take Seventeen into consideration, Seventeen will definitely not cause Young Master Hao any trouble, Seventeen can take care of Young Master Chen and Miss Yue’er’s living and follow them around to protect them.”","In his opinion, Young Master Hao’s strength is very strong, but Muchen and Muyue are only four year old children, so they still need to have an adult by their side to take care of them.","Yue’er looked at Seventeen and then at her Big Brother, so she said with a smiling face, “Big Brother, let Seventeen follow! With him following, I won’t need Big Brother to accompany me on the streets in the future.”","“Alright!” Hao’er responded, looked at Seventeen and said, “Tonight, I will tell you about some places in the Immortal Cultivation Realm, listen carefully and remember it, when you get there you have to be careful and keep a low profile.”","“Yes!” Seventeen couldn’t help but be delighted, a smile appeared on his face.","This night, Muchen and Muyue slept comfortably in the carriage, while Hao’er talked to Seventeen all night, until the day broke, Hao’er walked up and looked at the distance between the clouds in front of them.","The place where they stood was about seventy to eighty metres away from the opposite side of the cliffs and peaks, and there was a mist in the middle of it, so it was hard to see, or Hao’er probed with his divine sense to find out the distance.","After waking up Muchen and Muyue, a few people ate something, Hao’er took out the flying artifact, and with a throw of his hand, the flying artifact became bigger in front of a few people.","“Come up.” Hao’er shouted, letting them all sit on the flying artifact before flying it towards the opposite cliff.","The first time flying in mid-air on a flying artifact, even for such a grown man as Seventeen, he was scared and turned a little pale, keeping his hands gripping the edge of the flying artifact tightly.","“Hee hee, Seventeen’s face is white with fear~” Yue’er smiled as she looked at him with a nervous face, she herself wasn’t scared, instead she was looking around in a very novel way.","Flying artifacts, she and her brother also had them! Only, Big Brother handed it over, not to be taken out casually.","Abandoning the carriage and using the flying artifact instead, they didn’t walk over the mountain, but directly rode the flying artifact over a few big mountains, until, when they saw a vast expanse of sea, they came down from the flying artifact."]},{"number":4512,"title":"Chapter 4512: Land","paragraphs":["Chapter 4512: Land","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When he stood on the ground, Seventeen’s soft legs gave way and his white face recovered some colour. Never in his wildest dreams would he have ever thought that he would also fly in the sky one day. Such excitement, even though he had undergone special training, he could not help but feel his heart fluttering.","Looking at the three Little Masters again, one more calm than the other, he couldn’t help but feel that he was really a little too useless.","Hao’er looked at the endless sea in front of him and said to them, “Let’s take a rest first, that Floating Edge Immortal Island is on the other side of the sea, only it’s a bit far away.”","“Big Brother, are we still going there by flying artifact?” Yue’er asked.","“Well, we can also only go over by flying artifact.” Hao’er nodded and looked at them, saying, “Let’s take a rest and eat something first!” He turns his head to Seventeen and asked, “Are you alright?”","...","“Don’t worry Young Master Hao, Seventeen is fine.” It’s just his first time flying in the sky and he was a bit unaccustomed to it, but it’ll be fine after a bit of a reprieve, he’ll get used to it.","They rested for a while on the seashore, and when noon passed, Hao’er continued to take them in the flying artifact towards the sea, preparing to cross the seemingly boundless sea.","Even with the flying artifact flying in mid-air, it was only in the early morning of the following day that the few of them could vaguely see the land that appeared in their sight.","“Look! Young Master Hao, the land is ahead!” Seventeen said with some surprise, looking at the land ahead with excitement in his eyes.","It turns out that the place where the Immortal Cultivators live is so far away from the place where the mortals live, if not for this flying artifact, the mortals would not be able to come to such a place, let alone see this land hidden on the other side of the sea.","In the morning sunlight, Hao’er’s flying artifact slowly landed in a forest on the edge of the land, putting the flying artifact away, he looked at the surroundings and said to them, “When we get to this side, we must be vigilant and careful.”","“Yes.” Seventeen answered.","“Mm.” Muchen and Muyue also answered.","Watching him take out the map and check it out, Muchen then asked, “Big Brother, we”re inside the forest now, right? Why don’t we use a flying artifact to fly directly out of here?”","Hao’er looked at the map, frowned, and said, “On this map, there is only the route on how to come to this Floating Edge Immortal Island, as for the route on this side, it is all blank, it is probably because that Golden Toad Demon didn’t even go out there, so it can also not be drawn down.”","He raised his head and looked at Muchen, saying, “Moreover, if the flying artifact is seen by some people whose heart is not right and whose strength is stronger than ours, there is no guarantee that they won’t be greedy, so when we get to this side, we will try not to use it as much as we can.”","Upon hearing this, they nodded, and it dawned on them.","“We came over here mainly to inquire about how to go back, and now that we”ve come here and are in the middle of this forest, it’s also just right to bring you guys to practice inside this forest to improve your combat power.” Hao’er looked at them and said, putting the map away, he led them inside the forest.","This was a forest for training, and at the beginning, the Golden Toad Demon had cultivated here for five hundred years to become a spirit, therefore, there were quite a few fierce beasts and demonic beasts in here.","In the forest in the early morning, the roars of fierce beasts were faintly heard, as well as the chirping of birds on the branches, three children, one adult, travelling through this forest where the weeds were half a person high, it looked very bizarre.","“Roar!”","Suddenly, a huge tusked pig beast roared and fiercely sprang out of the grass, pouncing towards the few of them."]},{"number":4513,"title":"Chapter 4513: Little Devil","paragraphs":["Chapter 4513: Little Devil","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Watch out!” Seventeen exclaimed, shielding the two younger ones behind him and drawing the sword at his waist towards that huge tusked pig.","“Clang!”","However, when his sword slashed out, there was only a resounding ‘clang’ as if it had hit an iron plate. The hand holding the sword was shaken to the point that his joints were raw and painful, just as he was stunned, he only saw Muchen leap up as his small body directly sat on the back of that tusked pig, the dagger held in his hand was imbued with an aura that was visible to the naked eye, as he stabbed the bottom of its neck at a blistering speed.","“Whoosh!”","“Snort!”","...","The sharp blade stabbed in and was violently pulled out, only to see blood splashing out like a fountain as the tusked pig started charging wildly as it squealed in misery, violently flinging the tiny figure riding on its back off.","Watching Muchen being thrown out, Hao’er’s heart was tense and he had to supress every single cell in his body that was screaming to go forward to help, but he held back. This was just a low-grade ordinary fierce beast, if they couldn’t even defeat this ordinary fierce beast, there would be no need to talk about training.","“Brother, be careful!”","Yue’er cried out in a low voice, looking at him being thrown down, and when the fierce beast crashed in the direction he was thrown down, she hurriedly and swiftly stepped forward, pulling out her dagger and swiping it out at the same time. Her small figure even drilled towards the bottom of the fierce beast, stabbing upwards with a knife directly from the bottom.","“Yue’er!”","Hao’er didn’t expect her to be so bold and he was scared out of his wits. Just as he moved forward, he saw her stab into the neck of the fierce beast, splashing blood all over the place. His footsteps stopped in place, only, with his heart in his throat as he looked in trepidation. Only when he saw her drilling out from underneath the fierce beast and retreated, did he relax.","When Muchen was thrown off the back, he quickly did a somersault as his small body landed stably on the ground. However, when he saw his sister attack that beast without any regard of her own safety, he was scared as his face turned white as a sheet. Only when he saw her emerge from under that beast did he heave a sigh of relief.","“Ow!”","That tusked pig’s began howling, because of the two knives stabbed in the vital points, blood gushed straight out. With the loss of blood, four hooves were also a little wobbly as the huge body swayed and slammed into the trees at the side. Seeing this, Muchen immediately climbed onto it and directly dug out the crystal core on its head with a knife. As soon as the crystal core was dug out, that huge fierce beast also collapsed with a rumble.","“Bang!”","A heavy thud rang out, and the ground even shook slightly.","Hao’er looked at this scene, and while he heaved a sigh of relief, his gaze towards his younger siblings was full of satisfaction as well as joy. Although the two of them were only four years old, they had the courage and were agile. With their strength and such a small body, to be able to kill this low-ranked tusked pig was already remarkable.","Compared to Hao’er, Seventeen was dumbfounded. He didn’t expect that the two Little Masters, who didn’t even reach his trousers, would actually combine their efforts to slaughter a gigantic beast with a thousand pounds so simply? Was this really something a three or four year old child could do?","“Big Brother, we are also able to protect ourselves when we encounter danger.”","Yue’er said with a smile as she looked back at her Big Brother with unconcealed pride. Her exquisite little face, innocent gaze and beam on her face, no matter how one looked, one could only conclude that she looked harmless. However, at this moment, her body was stained with the blood of that fierce beast, coupled with the way she stood next to that fierce beast and held a dagger in her hand, at first glance, it was a Little Devil that was alive and well."]},{"number":4514,"title":"Chapter 4514: Dissection Skills","paragraphs":["Chapter 4514: Dissection Skills","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Seventeen looked at them and couldn’t help but gulp, only knowing that the two young Masters in front of him had truly refreshed his three views as well as his perception.","Compared to them, his proud hands and fighting ability were weak compared to theirs!","Thinking that he couldn’t even compare to a four year old child, he couldn’t help but tear up a little. Should he say that he was the one who should be protected? God knows that he has taken the two little Masters as the objects to be protected along the way, and right now ...","Suddenly felt so useless, what should he do?","“Young Miss Yue, Young Master Chen, why are you guys so powerful?” He asked incredulously.","...","“Hehehe, because we were personally taught by Big Brother ah! Big Brother did tell us to attack a fierce beast’s fatal point when dealing with it.” Yue’er smiled and said, looking at Seventeen, saying, “This tusked pig is a low ranked fierce beast, but it is a metallic fierce beast, its pig skin is very hard and sturdy, chopping its skin can’t injure it, you can only attack the underside of its neck, that’s where its fatal point is, and only by attacking its fatal point can you kill it.”","Seventeen’s eyes lit up as he listened, “So, that’s it!”","“Seventeen, cut some meat off this tusked pig and roast it for dinner, the fierce beast’s meat carries a spirit energy aura, eating it can strengthen your body.” Hao’er said, asking him to cut some off that tusked pig first.","“Yes.” Seventeen hurriedly responded.","Hao’er walked forward and came to Yue’er’s side, and with a cold face, he said, “Yue’er, do you know that what you did earlier was a very dangerous thing? If you had not been able to dodge away from underneath that tusked pig, do you know that you would have been trampled to death?”","Yue’er lowered her head and whispered, “But, I can dodge!”","“Then what if you can’t get out in time?” Hao’er’s face was stern, and his voice was also a little bit colder: “You can’t do anything without putting yourself in danger, haven’t I taught you that?”","Hearing this, Yue’er’s head hung even lower, she gripped the dagger in her hand and whispered, “Big Brother, I’m sorry, Yue’er knows, Yue’er will never do it again.”","“Sister, do you know that you scared me just now? What if you were trampled to death? Being trampled to death, that would be ugly.” Muchen also spoke with a cold little face, putting on the aura of an elder brother.","“I’ll be careful in the future, I won’t do this again.” She said in a small whisper.","Seeing this, Hao’er then eased his face and said, “Alright, you’re covered in blood, it will attract other fierce beasts, see if there’s any water around here and wash it off first.”","Turning back, he looked towards the Seventeen who was squatting on the ground with his back to them cutting the meat, he walked up and came next to him to take a look, the corner of his mouth couldn’t help but twitch slightly.","Only to see that the thousands of pounds of tusked pig was actually being picked and skinned by the knife in his hand to split and scrape it apart, that scene, looking at it was really a bit appalling.","“Young Master Hao, we’ll forgo this pig skin, I’ve cut two hind legs, using these two pig hind legs to roast, it should be enough for us to eat for some days.” Seventeen dragged the two pig hind legs to his side.","Hao’er thought for a moment and took out a cosmos sack from his space, storing the two pig hind legs in it before saying, “Let’s find a water source first and clean the blood.”","“Alright.”","Seventeen responded, having a reluctant look at the tusked pork on the ground. Young Master Hao said that eating the meat of these fierce beasts is going to make you stronger, it’s really a pity to waste so much of it!"]},{"number":4515,"title":"Chapter 4515: Surprise","paragraphs":["Chapter 4515: Surprise","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","They continued to walk forward, and after finding a water source, they cleaned the blood on their bodies and changed their clothes, before picking a place to sit down and rest.","“Seventeen, this is the Heart Technique for Immortal Cultivation Initiation, try cultivating it! Let’s see if you can condense spirit energy.” Hao’er handed him a copy of the Heart Technique.","As he did not have spirit energy cultivation, he could not even open his cosmos sack, and it was inconvenient to walk in this forest without even a cosmos sack, so he gave him an introductory skill to try.","At his age, it would be difficult for him to cultivate, but, regardless of whether or not he can cultivate, as long as he can condense spirit energy and sense the presence of spirit energy, then the cosmos sack will be available to him.","“Young Master Hao, is this, is this for me? Can I also cultivate?” Seventeen was a little too excited, unable to believe that he would actually give him something like this.","...","“This is a relatively common introductory method in the Immortal Cultivation World, as long as you can cultivate the spirit energy, you will be able to use the cosmos sack in the future, try it!” Hao’er placed it on his hand while saying, “Also, eat more fierce beast meat, it will be good for you.”","“Yes, thank you Young Master Hao!” Seventeen immediately stood up and knelt down on one knee again.","“By the way, I still want to ask you, earlier I saw that your dissection technique was a bit different, where did you even learn it?” Hao’er looked at him with a slightly odd expression.","Thinking of that earlier scene of flesh to flesh and bone to bone, his heart felt a little weird.","Hearing this, Seventeen grinned and said, “When I was training in the dark guard camp later on, there was a period of time when I was in charge of the food for the dark guards, and I killed not ten thousand but a thousand pigs, so I know how to deal with those beasts.”","Hearing this, Hao’er couldn’t help but purse his lips. Right! It turns out that he did the job of killing pigs in the dark guard camp ...","As they rested in the forest, Seventeen also seized the time to memorise the Heart Technique and cultivate according to Hao’er’s instructions until the evening, when they roasted the meat and found a relatively safe place to rest, preparing to nourish their spirits before leaving tomorrow.","Seventeen was responsible for the night watch, but he also tried to lead the spirit energy into his body, just, one day past, and there was no gain, but after eating barbecue meat, feel the body has a warm stream of heat surging, so he tried again, this night, over and over again, he kept trying ...","One early morning eight days later, Seventeen cried out in a trembling voice, “Young Master Hao, I, I seem to have induced spirit energy into my body!”","Hao’er was a little surprised, glancing at him and nodding, “Not bad, indeed you have induced spirit energy into your body, you are quite fast!” He said with jest as his gaze lingered on him.","To know, the fastest a normal person could draw spirit energy into the body would take ten days to half a month, some even take months, and he only took seven or eight days.","Could it be that this Seventeen was still a good seedling for cultivation? Hao’er guessed in his heart and looked him up and down, and then, handed him a cosmos sack, “This is for you, you can put things in it later.”","“Many thanks Young Master Hao!” Seventeen gladly took it and looked at it carefully, seeing that it was such a small and insignificant bag, but he had seen them take out quite a few things from inside such a bag.","After Hao’er told him how to use it, he looked at the yawning Muchen and Muyue and said, “We’ve been round here for seven or eight days, so let’s look for a way out, and when we get to the town, let’s look for a courtyard to have a good rest!”"]},{"number":4516,"title":"Chapter 4516: Surrounded","paragraphs":["Chapter 4516: Surrounded","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Yeah.” The two of them responded and nodded, packing up before following him forward.","Seventeen was walking ahead, while using the sword in his hand to cut down the weeds that were half a person tall and cleave a path, while using the sword to flatten the weeds around them, in case any poisonous snakes scurried out.","They had been living around this area for seven or eight days, they were quite familiar with the surroundings, and knew that in order to leave this place, they would have to leave the area they were familiar with before they could find a way out.","After walking in the woods for a long time, seeing that it was almost noon, they were just about to find a place to take a rest, when they heard a rustling sound coming from the surroundings.","They looked towards their surroundings with high alert and saw a few figures coming out of the trees, surrounding them.","“Who’s there!”","...","Seventeen shouted sternly, holding his sword in his hand and looking vigilantly at those people who suddenly appeared around them, only, when his eyes saw the powerful aura emanating from those people, as well as the strong smell of blood, his heart couldn’t help but jump slightly, feeling a little nervous, and also a little worried.","As for the people who surrounded them, each and every one of them was physically strong, with a ferocious face, the murderous aura emanating from their bodies was domineering. They had the same breath like him who lived on the knife’s edge and he was not at all unfamiliar with such an aura.","Only, what he was worried about at this moment was that if they were to fight, he was afraid that, even if Young Master Hao was good at fighting, they would not be a match for these people.","“Big Brother, it’s actually a few children and a guard who has only introduced spirit energy into his body.” A man with a scar on his face said with some surprise, his gaze fixed on Hao’er and the others.","A one-eyed man with a long sword hanging diagonally from his waist walked out, his sharp and sinister gaze skimming over Seventeen, directly ignoring him, then landing on Hao’er, Muchen and Muyue’s bodies as he looked at them from head to toe..","“Children?” He narrowed his eyes and stared at them, “Where did you come from? And who did you come with?”","Hao’er looked at the man and used his body to protect Muchen and Muyue behind him, his cold little face indifferent and expressionless as he said, “We got separated from our family and got lost in here.”","“Oh? Is that so?” That one-eyed man stared at him, his gaze suddenly swept towards Seventeen, the pressure came out, enveloping his whole person, his voice was gloomy and with a harsh voice: “Tell me, where did you come from? And why did you appear here? Tell me honestly, otherwise, I’ll kill you!”","“Bang!”","Under the other party’s pressure, Seventeen without the ability to withstand it flopped down on his knees, his entire face instantly became pale, he only felt a powerful force pressing down on his body, making it impossible for him to stand up straight, and it was difficult for him to even gasp for breath.","Fortunately, after that person’s voice fell, the pressure on his body retracted some, allowing him to take a breather.","“Seventeen ... ” Yue’er called out in a small voice, looking at him with some worry.","Hao’er protected both Muchen and Muyue, vigilantly staring at the people around there, in case they suddenly attacked. With his younger siblings’ stature, they could still deal with lower-ranked fierce beasts, but if they were to go up against these people, they would not even have a chance to fight back.","“We got separated from the family, only I am left to follow the three young Masters, seniors, we just got lost before we came here, please can you all be magnanimous.” He spoke with both hands clasping his fists.","At those words, that one-eyed man stared at Seventeen and swept a glance at those three children, seemingly smiling."]},{"number":4517,"title":"Chapter 4517: Can’t Escape","paragraphs":["Chapter 4517: Can’t Escape","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Seeing that you guys have an extraordinary temperament at a young age, I think that you are not children of an ordinary family, since you have lost your way in here, then you should follow us! When we get out of here, we will notify your family and have them come and take you back.”","Seventeen’s heart sank when he heard this. With his experience, he naturally knew what the meaning of these people’s words was. This was clearly an attempt to keep them under control and wait until they were out of this forest, then have their clans come with ransom money to ransom them!","He couldn’t help but look at Hao’er, wanting to know what he meant.","“In that case, thank you.”","Hao’er looked at the one-eyed man and said, “When we return home, we will definitely have our parents thank you all heavily.” He revealed a smile as if he was relieved, as if he was rejoicing at their willingness to escort them out of the city.","...","Yue’er blinked her eyes and asked innocently, “Big Brother, then do we no longer need to be afraid of those fierce beasts? With Uncle and the others protecting us, won’t we be eaten by the fierce beasts?”","“Well, they are very powerful, we won’t be eaten by fierce beasts if we follow them.” Hao’er looked back to the two of them and said.","Seventeen listened to their words and also knew what Hao’er meant, at that moment, he hurriedly arched his hand and spoke to the man, “Many thanks senior, I’ll trouble you all on this journey.”","“It’s good to know.”","That one-eyed man hooked the corners of his mouth, revealing a depraved smile. He glanced at the three children, then raised his hand and waved it, and those big men surrounding them with swords put their swords away, only surrounding them in case they escaped.","Hao’er followed with Muchen and Muyue, Seventeen walked behind them and followed them all the way. Looking at them, they did not seem to want to rest, so Hao’er said to Seventeen, “Seventeen, Yue’er is very tired, you carry her on your back!”","“Yes.” Seventeen answered and squatted down, “Young Miss Yue’er, Seventeen will carry you.”","Yue’er saw her Big Brother watching, so she obediently plopped down, wrapping her arms around Seventeen’s neck and comfortably resting on his back.","“Chen’er, are you tired?” Hao’er looked at Muchen by his side and asked.","Muchen shook his head and followed effortlessly with his short little legs while saying, “I can walk by myself.”","Hearing this, Hao’er revealed a smile and said, “If you can’t walk anymore, just say so, Big Brother will carry you.”","The one-eyed man in front glanced back at them and continued to walk in large strides, and after another distance, he suddenly raised his hand and stopped, “Careful!”","Along with his voice as soon as it fell, the sound of beast roars came out with it.","“Roar!”","“Roar!”","Those were two fierce beasts with notable strength, revealing sharp teeth, half crouching down and roaring at them, the ear-shattering sound was accompanied by the pressure of the fierce beasts, causing the surrounding low-ranked fierce beasts to flee in all directions.","Hao’er was protecting Muchen and Seventeen who was carrying Muyue on her back, her calm gaze swept over the two fierce beasts and looked towards the one-eyed man, while at the same time she retreated backward, retreating to the back of a large tree before stopping to watch.","Against this fierce beast, those people seem to have been very accustomed to, did not show fear and panic, instead, with the leader of the one-eyed man’s order, a dozen people quickly surrounded the front, as they launched a joint attack on the two fierce beasts.","The one-eyed man’s gaze swept over the men fighting with the fierce beasts and landed on Hao’er’s several people, seeing that they didn’t take advantage of the chaos to escape, and only then did he raise the corner of his mouth with satisfaction."]},{"number":4518,"title":"Chapter 4518: Reaction","paragraphs":["Chapter 4518: Reaction","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Taking advantage of the fact that those people were fighting and their attention was not on their side, Seventeen lowered his voice and asked, “Young Master Hao, what are we going to do? Escape now?”","“We can’t escape now.” Hao’er lowered his voice and said, while paying attention to those in front of him, “That one-eyed one has been staring at us, we can’t escape now, if we do, if we escape, they will be angered and they will start to kill, wait for the right time first, and then wait and see.”","He paused for a moment before he lowered his voice again and said, “Before that, what we have to do is to lower their guard, when the time is ripe, then it’s not too late to escape.”","“Mmm.” Muchen and Muyue answered in a low voice.","Those people’s fighting strength was strong, and their co-ordination with each other was perfect, and it didn’t take long for those two fierce beasts to be killed.","...","Hao’er watched as they dug out the beast crystals and handed them over to the one-eyed man, while the others began to deal with the two fierce beasts, cutting down the valuable parts and putting them into their cosmos sacks.","Hao’er had thoughts in her mind, so he was also observing the fighting strength of these people earlier. These dozen people, apart from the one-eyed man with a Golden Core level cultivation, the others were all at the Foundation Establishment level.","He didn’t know what kind of an existence these people had in this place. Nor did he know, in this place, just how strong was this Golden Core strength cultivation?","Knowing that, because they wanted to keep a low profile and try not to cause any trouble or danger, the strength of the three of them was hidden, just in case if they encountered danger, they could use this low profile to save their own lives.","In fact, the current situation, they were not entirely without a way to escape from the control of these people, after all, he also has a strong fighting power of the Silver Wolf in the space. He could call it out, not to mention these people, even if there were a few teams, they were not the silver wolf’s opponent.","Only, the existence of the Silver Wolf, if it wasn’t really a last resort, he couldn’t let other people know about it. What’s more, he wanted to borrow these people to lead the way so that they could leave this forest.","If Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu were here and knew about this, they would be proud of Hao’er’s intelligence and calmness. Even if he was only about ten years old, being able to calmly analyse the pros and cons like this and make the most correct plans was not a waste of what they had taught him.","“You guys, come here.” The one-eyed man shouted, beckoning Hao’er and the others over.","Seeing this, they walked over and came to stand next to him.","“Did you use to follow your elders out to catch fierce beasts?” The one-eyed man’s gaze fell on Hao’er and glanced at the two younger ones.","“No.” Hao’er shook his head and spoke.","“No?” He snorted and looked at the three of them, saying, “Seeing that you are not very old, however, your mouths are full of lies, and you don’t even blink when you lie, if it wasn’t for me, I would have been fooled by you.”","Hao’er looked at him and didn’t say anything, waiting for him to make his words clear on his own.","“Two high-ranking fierce beasts, even if an adult sees them, they will be scared to the point of turning white and panicking, whereas several of you, you didn’t even let out a cry of alarm, and since just now, you’ve been hiding under the tree at the back to avoid them. Just quietly watching, hmph, I don’t see any sliver of fear on your faces.”","His voice paused and he smiled grimly, “This reaction is not something a child who has never seen blood would have.”"]},{"number":4519,"title":"Chapter 4519: Goods","paragraphs":["Chapter 4519: Goods","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","At those words, Hao’er pursed his lips. So it was like this.","Seventeen was also stunned for a moment. They had been spending these seven or eight days in this forest, and apart from him initially exclaiming in shock, he rarely saw Young Master Hao’er and Young Master Chen, Young Miss Yue’er, screaming in fear or anything.","More often than not, Young Master Hao was expressionless, while the two younger ones were more excited. He was already used to those reactions from them, and it was only when he heard this one-eyed man that he was shocked to realise that in the eyes of these people, it was indeed a bit abnormal for them to react like this.","“This ...”","Seventeen’s mind moved, quickly opened his mouth, with a few moments of embarrassment, smiled sardonically, and said, “It’s like this, my family’s Young Master Hao’er has not had much expression on his face since he was a child, he would not have shown it even if he was afraid, and the Young Master and Young Miss are only four years old, so how do they know what it is to be afraid? What’s more, aren’t there seniors here? We are also relieved here because there are seniors here.”","...","This explanation was reasonable.","When that one-eyed man heard this, he glanced at the guard called Seventeen, and then looked at the two little ones, seeing that the little boy had a taut face, his little lips pursed, and was staring at him fearlessly, looking just like a little tiger.","And there was that little girl on Seventeen’s back. At this moment, she was blinking her pair of clear eyes while looking at him innocently. Perhaps because lying on Seventeen’s back was very comfortable, the little girl yawned, rubbed her eyes, and her small face was doused with a hint of drowsiness.","Could it be that he was really being paranoid?","The one-eyed man looked at the expressionless little teenager again, looking at the little face that did not have any fluctuations, it seems that it is really as that guard Seventeen said, he had a face paralysis.","“It better be, if you let me know that you guys are playing any tricks, I won’t spare you lightly!” That one-eyed man warned in a gloomy voice, before he looked at the crowd under his hand and commanded, “Move the place as soon as possible!”","The group set off again, quickly leaving this place stained with the smell of blood, walking through the forest, when suddenly, the sound of voices talking accompanied by footsteps came from the front.","Hao’er and the others looked forward and saw that it was a group of mercenaries, about thirty people, but they stopped when they saw the one-eyed man and his group, and the person at the head of the group stepped forward and greeted them.","“Hahaha, so it’s Old Brother Blackwood, I didn’t expect to run into you guys here.”","That mercenary captain as if he knew him well, stepped forward and smiled in greeting while patting his shoulder with his hand, his eyes swept over and when he saw Hao’er’s few people following behind, he was a bit slightly surprised, “Old Brother Blackwood, how come there are still such small children in your group?”","“Hehe, I came across them on the road, when we get out of here, we will let their family members come to lead them back.” The one-eyed man said, and swept back a glance at Hao’er’s few people.","“These children look really good, and this body temperament is not bad, they should be the children of the great families, congratulations Old Brother Blackwood, this time, can be a big profit ah, ha ha ha ha ha ha!” The man clasped his hands and said with a smile.","That one-eyed man laughed alongside with him, “If we hadn’t looked at the goods that were not bad, we wouldn’t have brought such a few brats with us.” Speaking here, his voice slightly paused, and it was only at this moment that he remembered that it seemed like he hadn’t asked which place and which family those few brats were from?"]},{"number":4520,"title":"Chapter 4520: Sudden Change","paragraphs":["Chapter 4520: Sudden Change","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The two people over there didn’t bother lowering their voices as they chatted on with gusto, perhaps they weren’t afraid of them hearing them at all. After all, in their eyes, they were no threat at all.","After the two chatted for a while, the man then cupped his fists and bowed his hand to say goodbye, taking his team to another direction, this side, the one-eyed man in front of them once again took them forward, until, in the evening, they found a place to rest in the forest.","As the night descended, the air was a few points colder, and these people did not light up a fire, but instead they all leapt into the trees not far apart and rested.","The few of them were also carried up the tree, and a man stared at them and confided, “Don’t move around, if you fall from here, you’ll have to break your arms and legs even if you don’t die.”","Hao’er and Seventeen guarded by Muchen and Muyue’s side, preventing them from falling, as well as from insects and ants biting them.","“We still have some roasted meat left from yesterday, although it’s a bit hard, it’s still fine to eat it.” Seventeen took out dried meat from his cosmos sack and gave it to them.","...","The three of them took it and sat on the tree and ate it, while looking at those people on the few trees around there. Those people looked to randomly find a place to rest, but they were guarding this place to the death.","Living in this for seven or eight days, they naturally know clearly, at night, how this tree will be safer than below, but, not this tree is not dangerous, after all, the occasional coiled between the branches of the poisonous snakes, but at any time is ready to take their lives.","Sitting high up, vaguely, they could see a fire flickering in a more distant place, obviously, there were people resting in that distant place as well.","As the night deepened, two men took the opportunity to relieve themselves and quietly headed that way, wanting to see what kind of people were over there, only, not long after this trip, the one-eyed man in the tree over here as well as the people under his hand heard the clanging of swords and the screams of misery coming from over there.","Almost instinctively, the one-eyed man, who was only a few metres away from Hao’er and his men, quickly leapt up, swept up with a gloomy gaze, and shouted in a stern voice: “Come with me to take a look!”","“Yes!” Those people responded and quickly followed, and in a short while, only Hao’er and Seventeen were left around.","“Those two people earlier should have been killed.” Seventeen said, standing on a tree and looking at the distant fires that had all of a sudden multiplied, and the forest that was still quite peaceful had become entrenched with the sounds of that battle spreading out.","“Big Brother, are we going to take a look?” Yue’er asked in a small voice, also following Seventeen’s example and looking at the distance, only, she was small and short, she couldn’t see anything at all, and only heard the sound of swords clashing accompanied by the sound of stern shouts spreading in the forest.","“Go back soon, lest you be mistakenly injured by the sword energy.” Hao’er said, telling them to wait, while listening carefully to the movements in front of that.","The sounds of engagement continued for quite a while, accompanied by screams from time to time, they couldn’t see it from this side, but listening to those screams, the whole group tensed up.","As time passed, the sounds of engagement weakened, and at this time, someone could be faintly heard drinking, “Catch him! Don’t let him escape!”","Over here, Hao’er violently stood up and gave a low shout, “Go down!” As soon as he spoke, he and Seventeen each hugged a person and leapt towards the tree, just as they landed, the smell of blood accompanied by a brisk wind blade attacked them, at the same time, on the tree they had just been sitting on, the injured one-eyed man was staring at them grimly."]},{"number":4521,"title":"Chapter 4521: Surprise","paragraphs":["Chapter 4521: Surprise","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Blood was dripping from that one-eyed man’s body, and as he got closer, the smell of blood got heavier and heavier, looking at the murderous aura on his body, Hao’er shielded Muchen and Muyue behind him.","“Eighteen brothers, all dead! Little ghosts, you all go to hell as well!” The one-eyed man’s gloomy voice came out, and in the next moment, his body flew down from above like a bat, reaching towards Hao’er’s neck, ready to strangle them all to death here!","The people under his hand were killed by those mercenaries, and it would be troublesome for these few brats to take them out, so it would be better to strangle them to death here, and it would also allow him to vent his resentment!","Seeing the rising murderous aura on his body, Hao’er’s eyes turned cold and he shouted, “Back off!” As soon as his voice fell, his hand moved and a longsword appeared in his hand, and with the surge of his mind, his hidden strength instantly burst out.","“Swoosh!”","...","At the moment when he shot out , the sharp sword in his hand stabbed at the incoming figure’s chest with lightening speed. With precision and ferocity, even that battle-hardened one-eyed man was unable to react to it.","“Arghhhhhhh!”","He missed the opportunity to avoid that sword due to that momentary lapse of concentration, only to see the longsword stab into his chest with a swoosh.","“This, this can’t be!”","His eyes widened in shock, looking in disbelief at the tiny young man in front of him who was only about ten years old, yet his body was bursting with the strength of a Golden Core cultivation! What’s more, he couldn’t believe that he could actually have that fast reaction speed and instantly strike out his sword to stab him in the fatal spot.","The moment Seventeen heard Hao’er’s voice, he led Muchen and Muyue to quickly retreat, while protecting them behind him, just in case.","After Hao’er stabbed down the sword, his palm condensed a spirit energy and violently struck out, and when it landed on the one-eyed man’s body , the sword that stabbed at his chest was also drawn back, at the same time, blood sprayed out.","“Pffttttt!”","The one-eyed man, who was originally injured by those who surrounded him, was thinking of killing these little kids to vent his anger when he was fleeing for his life, but unexpectedly, he met his demise and what’s worse, it was a little kid that he hadn’t even put in his eyes.","Looking at him staggering backward, blood spilling from his mouth, his vitality about to be cut off, Hao’er held a cold face, holding the sword in her hand, condensing his spirit energy, only to see a flash of the sword’s shadow, a ray of cold light slicing out, cutting through the one-eyed man’s neck.","“Swoosh!”","The subtle sound of sword energy dissipated in the air, and the figure that was leaning against the tree trunk, the whole person froze there, his eyes were wide open, with a horrified look in his eyes, a touch of blood seeped out from his throat, a little bit of sliding down until, the last trace of vitality in his body snapped, and the whole person then stood there stiffly, staring dead ahead.","“Young Master Hao, someone is coming over there!” Seventeen shouted in a low voice, looking somewhat worriedly at the several silhouettes that swept towards this direction.","Hao’er glanced in that direction, then he retreated sideways and came in front of Muchen and Muyue, holding a longsword to protect them in a guarding stance, and at the same time, pressed down the strength in his body as well.","A few silhouettes travelled through the woods, the leaves of the trees making a rustling sound as they swept by, and faintly, they could hear one of them shouting, “Hurry up! He’s right in front! Don’t let him escape!”","However, a few breaths later, when the three figures came to Hao’er and their place, and saw the one-eyed man who was already dead, they could not help but stare in dismay, and then looked incredulously at the tiny teenager with the sword in his hand."]},{"number":4522,"title":"Chapter 4522: Mercenary","paragraphs":["Chapter 4522: Mercenary","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“You killed them?” One of the men in his twenties was staggered as he looked at the young boy with a cold face and a guarded look, with incredulity in his eyes.","This kid didn’t look more than ten years old or so, did he? He actually killed that one-eyed dragon?","Hao’er stared at the three people in front of him, a dark glint flashed by his eyes. Of these three, two were mid Foundation Establishment cultivators, and a middle-aged man side was a Golden Core cultivator.","He pondered in his mind for a while, and under the probing and dismayed gazes of those three, he swept over the badges on the mercenary uniforms on their chests and spoke, “You are mercenaries?”","The middle-aged man put away his astonishment as he looked at the several people, his gaze skimming over the Seventeen who was wearing a guard’s outfit, and then looked at the two tiny figures behind him, frowning before finally landing his gaze on the young boy who was around ten years old and said, “As you can see, we are indeed mercenaries.”","...","Upon hearing this, the sword in Hao’er’s hand pointed towards the dead one-eyed man, and her voice said coldly, “I killed this man, and all the valuable things on his body will be given to you guys as payment for me hiring you to escort us out of the forest.”","Hearing this, the middle-aged man raised his eyebrows, staring at the little boy, his heart was curious, what kind of family raised this child? At such a young age, he actually had such a courage to stay calm in a crisis, and he was also able to handle things calmly like this.","“What a shameless child, this person was obviously surrounded by us making him seriously injured, otherwise with your strength how could you have killed him!” A man next to him snorted coldly, feeling that the belongings on this man’s body should have been their mercenary team’s in the first place.","Hao’er’s gaze fell on the man and said, “He died under my sword.”","The young man was annoyed and was about to speak when the middle-aged man raised his hand in a gesture to stop him.","“Even if what you said is true, this person was killed by you, and the property is also counted as yours, but, we could have also killed you guys, then the property would naturally be ours as well, and it would be even more of a crime to go and escort you guys out of the forest, don’t you think so?” The middle-aged man stared at Hao’er with a smile at the corner of his mouth, his meaning unclear.","Hao’er looked at the middle-aged man and spoke in an unhurried manner, “A mercenary team that has been certified by the Mercenary Guild should normally not choose to kill people and cross the border, not to mention, protecting our few children and getting a large amount of belongings from this man, you guys aren’t at a disadvantage.”","Upon hearing this, the middle-aged man smiled, “I can see that you are not a child of an ordinary family, alright! I’ll take the lead and accept this mission of yours.”","“Vice Captain!” A young man beside him shouted with some disapproval.","“No matter, we happen to be going back anyway, what’s more, they’re just a few kids, by the way!” That middle-aged man said, before signalling, “Go, take everything on the Cyclops.”","“Yes.” Those two men answered and went forward, removing everything from the other’s body before standing by his side.","“You guys follow!” The middle-aged man said, turned around and walked back.","Behind him, Hao’er’s few people followed from afar. Muchen lowered his voice and asked, “Big Brother, are these people trustworthy?”","Hao’er walked forward while saying, “The badges on their chests are verified regular mercenary teams, this kind of mercenary is not an outlaw, some of them will have family members and children as well, so bringing along a few of us children and having a reward to get, they usually won’t think further, but even so, we have to be careful.”"]},{"number":4523,"title":"Chapter 4523: Suspicion","paragraphs":["Chapter 4523: Suspicion","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","At those words, they nodded and secretly noted it down.","Walking forwards, after a while, they came to that place with a fire lit in front of them. The smell of blood was still lingering. Although the corpses on the ground had obviously been disposed of, there were no corpses to be seen in the surroundings, only some bloodstains.","Thirty or so mercenaries were standing or sitting around there talking, and amongst these mercenaries, there were several young men and women.","“Old Zheng, how is it? Did you catch up with the people?”","Another middle-aged man saw them come back, so he opened his mouth, and his gaze turned, and somewhat surprisingly landed on Seventeen and a few children who were following behind.","...","“Where are these children from? Still so young?” The middle-aged man frowned, stared at Muchen and Muyue, then looked at Hao’er, and finally spun around Seventeen, but he saw that the man who looked like a guard was actually only a small cultivator who had just induced qi into his body not long ago.","“Hehe, Captain, the matter is like this ...”","That middle-aged man who had brought Hao’er and the others over smiled and glanced back at Hao’er’s several people before walking over to that middle-aged man and briefly telling him about the matter.","“What? You mean that one-eyed dragon escaped but was killed by just the kid?” That Captain pointed at Hao’er with some consternation.","Hao’er frowned, somewhat disliking the fact that someone was pointing at him in this manner, however, he did not say anything, but took the opportunity to take a general look at the thirty or so mercenaries, and then finally glanced at the two men and two women who were sitting by the fire and were staring at them.","Not only was that Captain aghast, it was the mercenaries around them who also had a look of having seen a ghost after hearing the words of their Vice Captain.","“Well, that’s it, that one-eyed dragon was already dead when we arrived, it was this kid who killed him.” That Vice Captain Zheng laughed and looked at the young teenager who had a cold face.","“So when he said something about letting us escort them out of the forest, I thought that we were just about to go back as well, so I took the initiative and agreed.”","“Tsk, this kid picked up a big bargain, if it wasn’t for the fact that we laid a lot of traps around here, that One eyed dragon’s gang wouldn’t have been wiped out so easily by us, he’s good, he picked up a big bargain without doing anything.” A mercenary snorted coldly and swept a glance at Hao’er with a bit of displeasure and contempt on his face.","In their opinion, wasn’t it this kid who had picked up a bargain off them? The person they had surrounded and attacked to kill was injured and fled by their Captain and Vice Captain joining hands, and they were looking at a cooked duck, but it just flew away.","But fortunately, the things on that one-eyed dragon ended up in the hands of their mercenary group, if this kid dared to swallow it, they would have to slaughter him.","“Alright, alright, in that case, let’s do what Old Zheng said! Anyway, our side of the mission has been completed and we’re just about to leave the forest, so there’s no harm in bringing them along.” That Captain said, waving his hand so that they didn’t have to say anything more.","“You guys, come over here and take a break!” Vice Captain Zheng smiled and beckoned, signalling the few children standing at the side to come over and sit by the fire.","Hao’er paused for a moment, and then led Muchen and Muyue towards that side, however, when he was about to sit down by the fire, a young woman next to him frowned unhappily and said, “Sit over there, don’t get me all dirty.”","Saying that, she also half covered her nose and said in disgust, “Ugh, they are all dirty and messy, I don’t know how long it’s been since they took a bath.”"]},{"number":4524,"title":"Chapter 4524: Bad Intentions","paragraphs":["Chapter 4524: Bad Intentions","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Several children have been living in this forest for so many days, naturally it is impossible to keep a clean and dry body, not to mention, they were still so young so they were small in stature. Naturally, the boots on their feet were soaked in mud, the clothes on their bodies were scratched by the leaves and weeds, and due to their height, mud, grass and the like stuck to them.","Not to mention, they were previously following that one-eyed man and his gang who had hurriedly walked almost an entire day without much rest. Their small faces also had some grey stains, but they were definitely not filthy to the extent of the woman’s exaggerated cries of foul smell, so on and so forth. After all, before this, they will still look for a water source to clean at every chance they have.","At this moment, when that woman said so, Hao’er and Muchen’s eyes went cold, while Yue’er blinked her eyes and looked at that woman, as if she didn’t understand what she was saying.","Seventeen glanced angrily at that woman with some anger, his hand secretly twisting into a fist.","When Vice Captain Zheng saw this, he froze for a moment and smiled instead, “Come over and sit on my side!” With that, he added to those young men and women, “Going out is naturally not as good as being at being at home, not to mention that they are just children.”","...","“Hmph!”","That woman snorted coldly and looked at the Captain and the others, saying, “I didn’t know that in between taking our quests, you guys can still take other people’s missions.”","“Liao Wu, there is no conflict between these two things, moreover, the mission of your trip, we are also considered to have completed half of it, as long as we escort you out of this forest, it will also be completed.”","That Captain smiled and looked at those few young men and women, saying, “What’s more, as you can see, they are indeed just a few children, who doesn’t have a few children at home? If one’s own children arrive at such a dangerous place is also uneasy, by the way, just take them out, it’s not that big of a deal.”","Hearing that Captain say that, and seeing the surrounding mercenaries looking at her with a few points of displeasure, that woman bit her lip, and with a cold face, she didn’t speak again.","The young man next to her saw, then tried to ease the situation as he smiled and said: “At first, we looked for your Iron Tiger Mercenary Corps because you guys are a mercenary guild that’s renowned for their justice. Having taken this trip out, this also confirms that, if not for protecting us with your lives several times, I guess we this time will not be able to complete the task so quickly.”","He paused for a moment, smiled and looked at Hao’er’s entourage, saying, “It’s also a blessing for these children to have met you.”","“Ha ha, Young Master Liang is overstating things.” The Captain smiled and replied politely.","This night, Hao’er and the others followed the mercenaries and rested until the next morning, when the crowd woke up and prepared to move, Yue’er woke up as well, only to rub her small stomach and say, “Big Brother, I’m going to relieve myself.”","“I will accompany you.” Hao’er stood up and held her hand and was about to leave when a female voice came.","“I’m also about to go relieve myself, so why don’t you let me take her with me! After all, she’s a little girl, and it’s not too convenient for you to follow even if you’re her brother.” The woman from last night stood up and gathered her hair, looking towards Hao’er and Muyue.","“No need.” Hao’er said coldly.","“Oh my, you little boy, you wouldn’t still be angry about last night’s incident, would you?” The woman laughed softly and looked at him and said, “Although I didn’t do too right last night, but it’s been a night since then, why are you still holding on to it?”","“Little Sister, do you want Big Sister to take you there?”"]},{"number":4525,"title":"Chapter 4525: Bad Things Happen","paragraphs":["Chapter 4525: Bad Things Happen","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The woman half bent down, revealing what she thought was a sweet smile as she looked at Muyue and asked.","Muyue blinked her big innocent eyes and looked at the woman before sweetly saying to Hao’er, “Big Brother, Yue’er will just follow this Big Sister, we’ll be back in a while.”","At these words, Hao’er pursed his lips, paused for a moment, and said, “Well, go! Don’t go too far.”","“Mm hmm~” Yue’er smiled and nodded her head, then tilted her head and looked at the woman, revealing an innocent and harmless smile, “Big Sister, let’s go!”","“Alright.” The woman said a few words to the few people around her before leading Yue’er towards the grass.","...","The others were getting ready, forming up and then preparing to set off, and not long after, a large and a small figure walked back, looking a little surprised at the Captain and Vice Captain Zheng and the others.","That young woman still had a face that had unconcealed disgust for that little girl last night, but today she took that little girl to relieve herself? And also came back with a smile on her face, could it be that women are really so fickle?","Watching them return to the group, the Captain commanded, “Alright, let’s go! From here to the outside of the forest, without any other accidents, it will take three days at the earliest, so let’s hurry up.”","The group set off again, the young men and women were escorted in the middle of the group, and originally, Vice Captain Zheng also told Hao’er and the few of them to join them, but Hao’er politely refused on the grounds that his siblings were still young and not fast, hence, they gradually lagged behind, following the back of the group.","Looking at the several children behind, the woman in front of them had a coldness in her eyes, and an impish smile appeared on her lips, only, that smile appeared and disappeared, so fast that it was impossible for people to notice it.","“Yue’er, you went over there with that woman, she didn’t do anything right?” Hao’er lowered his voice and asked.","Yue’er smiled and looked ahead, as if she had discovered something funny, whispering, “Big Brother, that Big Sister is a bad person, she quietly sprinkled powder on Yue’er, thinking that Yue’er hadn’t discovered it, hee hee, but Yue’er discovered it! Isn’t Yue’er very smart?”","Her little face was all smiles, raising a pleased smile, her pretty eyes curved into a crescent moon due to her smile, looking very cute and pleasing.","However, Hao’er who heard her words, as well as Muchen and Seventeen, the three of them changed their faces, and were about to ask, when they saw her using one finger against her pink mouth, making a silencing gesture, and her pretty eyes sparkled, just like a mischievous little fox. She then said to them in a small voice, “That’s why I took advantage of the fact that while she was relieving herself, I stole her medicine, and sprinkled it on her body when she wasn’t paying attention!”","Hearing these words, all three of them were stunned for a moment, seeming to be a little unconvinced, however, in the moment’s urgency, Hao’er quickly took a step back, his eyes looking back and forth over her body, and moved forward to sniff at her body.","A seeming odour drifted to his nose and his expression turned solemn immediately as he lowered his voice, “Quickly, take off your clothes and change!”","Yue’er knew that it was definitely not something good, but she also didn’t know what exactly that powder was, so she just asked in a low voice, “Big Brother, what kind of medicine is that? What is it used for?”","Seventeen and Muchen both walked forward at the same time and came in front of them, blocking Yue’er’s small figure behind them as well, in fact, it was also mainly to block the gazes of those few men and women in front of them, as for the mercenaries, how would they know why they were changing their clothes halfway through the journey? Even if they saw it, they probably wouldn’t say more than ask a question."]},{"number":4526,"title":"Chapter 4526: Dragged Out","paragraphs":["Chapter 4526: Dragged Out","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Hao’er helped to take off Muyue’s clothes, and changed her coat into another one, and fortunately, the woman only sprinkled medicine on her coat, and after she changed her coat, the smell disappeared.","She still had on a pink dress, only that it had not been washed, so it was still somewhat dirty, but it looked similar to her previous dress, if one did not look carefully, one will not notice the change.","Hao’er held her hand, then he lowered his voice and said, “That is beast powder, the smell is not obvious, but the beasts will go crazy once they catch a whiff of that scent.” He had seen this kind of thing once before, it was just a very low-grade medicinal powder, only people with impure minds would prepare these things to harm people, that woman was indeed not a good person.","Thinking that Yue’er had sprinkled medicine on that woman, he pursed his lips, hmph! He would like to see how she would eat her own fruit!","Near noon, the Captain in front waved his hand and turned back, “Everyone, take a rest here first!”","...","However, as soon as his voice fell, he heard the roar of a beast accompanied by the sound of running coming from a short distance away, and at once, he quickly shouted out, “Alert!”","Hao’er and Seventeen escorted the two small ones to follow those mercenaries, only to feel the ground shaking slightly due to the running beasts, as they looked towards the surroundings, they saw seven or eight fierce beasts of huge size hissing and rushing towards this side.","And on the other side, there were also ten or so dark-bodied canine beasts about half a man tall that let out howls running towards this side, as if they were stimulated by smelling something in the air, and actually didn’t fear that those other few fierce beasts were also in this vicinity, but instead, they fiercely pounced forward and scurried into the middle of the mercenaries.","“Be careful!”","“Damn it! How could there be so many fierce beasts!”","The mercenaries were caught a little off guard by the fierce beasts that suddenly came out, especially since the strength of these fierce beasts was not low and there were quite a few of them, apart from the seven or eight giant fierce beasts, the ten or so speed-type canine beasts baring their fangs were very tricky as well.","After all, they were a mercenary group that had fought hundreds of battles, and after being stunned, they quickly reacted and attacked, protecting the young men and women as they retreated, and also protecting Hao’er and his little entourage as they retreated.","However, Hao’er was protecting his younger siblings and tried his best to distance himself from the young men and women, and as they retreated, he led them to retreat to the back.","At this time, the mercenaries gradually realised that something wasn’t quite right, as the fierce beasts and canine beasts hissed and lunged towards the young men and women, as if they had identified them, and only attacked them.","However, they were protected by the mercenaries in the middle, those fierce beasts and canine beasts could not break through the defence circle of the mercenaries for a while, however, everything is an accident, the chaotic battle scene escalated, the smell of the blood of the slain fierce beasts stimulated those beasts, only to see those beasts more and more launched wildly.","Suddenly, a black canine beast scurried forward, and with its mouth open, it bit the young woman’s calf, and immediately after that, it dragged her towards the back.","“Ahhhhh!”","“No!”","“Quickly save her! Quickly save her!”","For a moment, watching the woman being dragged out with a bite, the several young men and women all cried out in shock, wanting to pounce forward to save her but being scared back by the fierce beast that pounced on them.","Almost instantly, the beasts that had originally surrounded and pounced forward quickly retreated, all scrambling to pounce on that human being that was dragged out."]},{"number":4527,"title":"Chapter 4527: What have you done","paragraphs":["Chapter 4527: What have you done","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Only, in the next moment, when they looked at the canine beast that pounced forward and was about to smack that woman to death with its front paws, its lower body making harmonious movements, each one of them was a little dumbfounded.","What in the world was going on here?","“Ah..! Help! Save me ...”","That woman’s mournful and shrill screams pulled back their dismay, only to see, the canine beast stabbed its sharp claws deep into that woman’s shoulder to press her to the ground, with a frantic look of having eaten a pinch, only, but in the blink of an eye, that canine beast was knocked away by a giant beast, and that giant fierce beast pressed forward, and with a flick of its claws, the outer coat on her body was torn into shreds, leaving only the blood-stained lining inside.","But it was also because her coat was torn apart and flew off to the side, the moment those beasts quickly pounced forward and tore at the piece of clothing, it also gave the mercenaries a chance to save her.","...","Hao’er, Muchen as well as Seventeen and Yue’er were all a little stunned as they watched this scene. Only, compared to the minds of the three in front, Yue’er was more just curious and innocent.","Hao’er retracted his gaze from the front and looked at Yue’er, asking, “Yue’er, did you really just sprinkle her with those medicines?”","“This,..well....”","Yue’er hung her head down, her two index fingers gently poking each other, and finally, raising her head, blinking a pair of big, innocent and pure eyes, she said in a small voice, “In fact, in fact, I also sprinkled her with some other things.”","Upon hearing this, the corners of Hao’er’s mouth twitched, so he knew what she was sprinkling on that woman. To know, in their space, there were not only the medicinal pills and medicines and such given by Mother, there were also some self-defence medicines. Only, there were a few that he had confided not to use indiscriminately, he did not think that Yue’er had used it for that woman, those beasts look like they were going crazy.","“Big Brother, did Yue’er do something wrong?” Yue’er bit her lip and asked in a small voice.","Hao’er touched her head and said, “It is impolite not to reciprocate, Yue’er did well.”","Hearing these words, Yue’er’s eyes lit up at once, and on her little face, a joyful smile emerged.","When Muchen heard these words, he also nodded his head with agreement. It was indeed impolite not to reciprocate, that woman dared to plan against his sister, so how could she get away with it unscathed?","On the other hand, Seventeen’s mouth was slightly twitching, revealing a look of determination. He knew that Young Master Hao would say that although that woman was a bit miserable, who asked her to target Young Miss Yue with such a dirty trick?","You know, Young Miss Yue has two older brothers! Although these two brothers are a bit younger, but, one is more powerful than the other, neither of them was weak!","“Quickly! Retreat!”","The Mercenary Captain shouted, saving the people and then quickly retreating with his men.","When their voices came, Hao’er several people then also looked at each other and quickly followed them to evacuate the area, the group of people hurriedly retreated until they came to a safe place before taking a breather.","At this time, the woman who was rescued had a pale face, the wounds on her body were shocking, and those wounds were still seeping blood, the white inner robe had already been dyed blood red.","Her lips and mouth trembled slightly, seemingly fearful, and seemingly appalled, as if she had not yet recovered her senses, and one hand was still tightly clutching her clothes.","Her companion quickly came forward to stop the bleeding for her to bandage the wound, and at this time, as if she remembered something, her pair of eyes fiercely stared at that little girl who was sitting not far away under the tree, shouting in a crazed manner, gnashing her teeth with hate: “What in the world have you done!”"]},{"number":4528,"title":"Chapter 4528: Kill Them","paragraphs":["Chapter 4528: Kill Them","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Those fierce beasts pounced on her specifically, when her clothes were torn off, it was her clothes that those fierce beasts pounced on, seeing that scene, if she hadn’t reacted then she would really be stupid!","Just that, just that one four year old child, could she really have such a mind?","“Why are you so fierce to my sister!” Hao’er shouted back coldly, his cold little face sinking.","The three young men and women beside her who were helping her with her medicine and bringing her clothes to drape over her saw this and were slightly stunned for a moment, looking towards those children and about to speak, when they heard her voice come through with murderous intent.","“Cousin, kill that little girl for me! Kill her!” The woman said with hatred, her gaze fixated on the innocent Yue’er.","Yue’er blinked her eyes and looked at the woman with an innocent face, her soft and sticky voice carrying a few points of aggression, “Big Sister, why are you being mean to me?”","...","“Why? I’ve become like this, isn’t it your fault!” That woman gasped for air, and when she got agitated, blood seeped out of the wounds on her body again.","Those mercenaries looked at them and couldn’t help but wrinkle their brows as well. The Mercenary Captain glanced at both sides and asked in a deep voice, “What the hell is going on here?” With that, his gaze fell on Yue’er and said, “Little girl, you speak.”","Hao’er and Muchen heard this and did not mean to stop Yue’er from speaking, they just stood quietly by her side.","Yue’er played with her fingertips, taking a pair of big beautiful eyes to glance at the woman who was covered in wounds, her soft and childish voice filled with innocence and naivety: “That Big Sister took me to relieve myself and then sprinkled something on me, so I followed her example and sprinkled something on her as well.”","Hearing these words, the crowd could not help but be stunned, their gazes mixed with complexity glanced at her, and then frowned at the woman who was covered in wounds, “Is what she said true? What kind of medicinal powder did you sprinkle on this little girl?”","“She’s talking nonsense!”","A moment of panic swept through the woman’s eyes, followed by retorting in anger, “If I had really sprinkled something on her, would she be standing there properly? I’m the one being attacked by the fierce beasts right now, not her!”","“That’s because I noticed the smell of beast powder on my sister and made her take off her outer robes and change.” Hao’er spoke coldly, staring at the woman, saying, “There’s a saying that harming others ends up harming oneself, who do you want to blame?”","“What a wicked-minded child!” The young man who hadn’t said anything shouted in a cold voice, his gaze staring at the few of them with a hint of killing intent, saying, “We didn’t count on the mercenaries to give you guys a ride, but you guys had a mind to get my cousin killed! Children like you who are evil-minded are also a scourge to live!”","As soon as his voice fell, his figure violently swept forward, a cold light streaked across, and the biting sword qi with a murderous aura violently attacked out, striking towards the several of them.","“Be careful!”","Vice Captain Zheng shouted as he swept forward swiftly and came in front of them, blocking the strike for them.","“Bang!”","That sword qi struck down on Vice Captain Zheng’s sword, and the airflow clashed with the blade of the sword with a muffled, heavy sound.","No one saw that Hao’er, who was blocking in front of Muchen and Muyue, moved his hand slightly at that moment, and if it wasn’t for that Vice Captain Zheng blocking in front of them, he would have to struck out on his own.","That man’s face was ugly as he looked at Vice Captain Zheng and said in a cold voice: “Why did you save them? These few brats have unknown origins and evil intentions, if we don’t kill them now, who knows who they will harm along the way?”"]},{"number":4529,"title":"Chapter 4529: News","paragraphs":["Chapter 4529: News","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“If it wasn’t Miss Lin who first had bad thoughts about that little girl, how could she have ended up like this?”","Vice Captain Zheng’s expression sank as he glanced at the pale woman, and said, “Miss Lin, that little girl is only three or four years old, so how would she know how to drug or even something like that? If you hadn’t drugged her first, she wouldn’t have learnt from you, speaking of which, in the final analysis, the problem is still with you.”","Saying that, he turned around again, looking at the innocent Yue’er, with a stern face, somewhat helplessly said, “Little girl, you are still young, you need to learn something good, you can’t learn something bad! Like today’s matter, you also did not do the right thing, if you knew that she drugged you, you should have come forward and tell me instead.”","“Oh, Yue’er knows~” She nodded, with an innocent and harmless look.","It was at this point that the Captain glanced at both sides, before he said in a deep voice, “We are still in the middle of the forest, I hope that we won’t see anything like this happen again.”","...","As soon as his voice fell, he spoke to the man surnamed Liang, “Young Master Liang, you guys first help Miss Lin treat and bandage her wounds.” He also had a few mercenaries take out a stretcher, and after they bandaged and treated the wounds, he had the men carry the woman.","The front team was walking quickly, behind them, Vice Captain Zheng slowed down his pace and walked beside Hao’er and his companions, saying, “It’s really unwise for you to do this, they are the children of a clan, backed up by a big clan. If you have a grudge with them here, when you go out, there’s no guarantee that they won’t make things difficult for you next time.”","Hao’er didn’t bother to pick up on this, instead, his gaze flickered slightly and he asked, “Vice Captain Zheng, why is it that the mercenaries are all predominantly of Foundation Establishment strength?”","That Vice Captain Zheng didn’t expect him to ask this question for a moment, and after being stunned for a moment, he laughed and said, “Otherwise, do you think that everyone can be a Golden Core cultivator like the Captain and I?”","Saying this, he let out a low laugh, with a few moments of cheerfulness in his voice, and said, “Do you know why this mercenary team of ours, which is not the largest in number, is one of the best?”","Hao’er shook his head and did not speak.","“That’s because, the two of us, the Captain and I, are both Golden Core cultivators, whereas for other mercenary groups, it can be considered powerful to have even one Golden Core cultivator.” He laughed out, his words tinged with pride, “It is precisely because we have two Golden Core cultivators in our team that others don’t dare to mess with us easily, and the missions we send out have an extremely high completion rate.”","Upon hearing this, Hao’er’s heart stirred slightly as he asked, “Is a Golden Core cultivator strong enough? Aren’t there any stronger ones?”","“Ha ha ha, you are still young, don’t know how many years it takes to cultivate to a Golden Core cultivator? Even for the Captain and myself, we also cultivated for nearly a hundred years before reaching the Golden Core realm. As for those above the Golden Core, there naturally are. Only, that has to be some of the Old Predecessor generation of the big families, or those clans with deep foundations. As for the ordinary people, the most one will reach the Golden Core, it is difficult to be able to make a further breakthrough.”","He sighed lightly, looking at the sky as he walked, saying, “I have heard that in other Heavenly Realm regions there are numerous strong exponents, like clouds. There are some existences that we wouldn’t even dare to think about.”","Inquiring about the information that came to his mind, Hao’er then pursed his lips, becoming clearer in his heart. It seemed that even if this Floating Edge Immortal Island was a separate territory, it was still in the middle of this mortal realm, with weak Spirit Energy and it was unlikely that it would be possible to produce strong cultivators."]},{"number":4530,"title":"Chapter 4530: Worried","paragraphs":["Chapter 4530: Worried","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Thinking about his own strength, as well as the fact that he still had the snow wolf by his side, his heart settled down a bit, at least, even if he did encounter danger, he could still protect his younger siblings.","“Then can’t we go to the other Realms on our side?” He asked once again.","“How could it be that easy? However, that Floating Edge Sect there, I did hear that every three years, people from the Upper Realm would come down to select good seedlings to bring to the Upper Realm sects, only, very few could be picked.”","However, listening to these words, Hao’er’s eyes brightened slightly as he glanced at his younger siblings. If this was the case, then the people in the Floating Edge Sect must know how to go to the Upper Realm or contact the people in the Upper Realm.","Along the way, they chatted as they walked, Hao’er inquired about news intentionally or unintentionally. And that Vice Captain Zheng, listening to what he asked, felt a little strange in his heart, but he didn’t think too much about it, after all, those are the news that can be known by just asking around outside, it’s not much of a secret, just that, he was a little curious as to why this child was so interested in these.","...","At nightfall, the team stopped to rest, the few young men and women stared at Hao’er from time to time, but they did not play any tricks anymore, but some mercenaries surrounded Yue’er and Muyue, teasing the two of them.","“Hey, little girl, your name is Yue’er?” A mercenary grinned, looking at Yue’er who was holding a piece of meat in his hand and biting it.","Yue’er glanced at him and nodded with a smile, “Well, my name is Yue’er, so Uncle can also call me Yue’er~”","“Yue’er, how did you all get here? Where is your family? Do you know what your Father’s name is?” The other mercenary also asked with a grin.","Yue’er bit into the meat and chewed like a little squirrel, her beautiful eyes blinking as she looked at them, waiting for the meat in her mouth to be swallowed before she softly said, “Big Brother said, don’t talk to talk to people when you’re eating.” As soon as her voice fell, she continued to hold the meat wrapped in leaves and continued biting.","When the few mercenaries surrounding her heard this, they froze for a moment, and then laughed, so they did not ask any more questions. It was just that their gazes were still switching around the three children.","Previously, they didn’t know when they didn’t come into contact with them, but after getting along with them, they found that these three children were very clever. Even if they wanted to get something out of them, it seemed that they couldn’t do so.","The next few days were peaceful and uneventful until, on this day, under the leadership of the mercenaries, the group finally got out of the forest and saw the huge path outside.","“We’re finally out.”","Vice Captain Zheng smiled and looked at Hao’er’s people, asking, “What are your plans next? Will you follow us to the city or go home?”","Hao’er thought about it and then said, “We’ll follow you into the city!”","“Good, let’s take you guys along on our swords! We’ll arrive around noon.” Vice Captain Zheng said with a smile, and after saying a few words to the Captain, the entire team rode on their swords, heading towards the city.","Around noon, when they arrived at the city gates, they put away their flying swords and landed on the ground. A few young men and women then bid their farewells first, looking deeply at the few children before quickly leaving.","The mercenary group entered the city first, while Vice Captain Zheng stood beside Hao’er’s group and sighed, “You’d better hurry up and notify your family members to come and take you back once you’re in the city, those people’s clans are considered to be one of the best in the city, I’m worried that they won’t be kind enough to let go of you guys so easily.”"]},{"number":4531,"title":"Chapter 4531: Trouble","paragraphs":["Chapter 4531: Trouble","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Hao’er nodded, “I know.”","“Then I will leave first.” He glanced at a few children and told them to be careful before sighing and leaving on his own.","“Young Master Hao, are we going into the city? Or should we find another place to settle down?” Seventeen inquired.","Hao’er looked at the city gate in front of him and said, “We’ve seen it on the way over here, other than this town, there are no other towns. The most, there are just one or two small villages, we’ll have to pass through here even if we want to leave to go to another town.”","He paused slightly, after thinking for a while, he said, “Seventeen, after entering the town, go and find a quieter courtyard, we’re not going to live in an inn, we’ll directly rent a courtyard to live in.”","...","“Yes.” Seventeen answered and followed the three of them into the city, after sending them to a restaurant to get something to eat first, he himself quickly went to accomplish his mission.","On the other hand, in the Lin family in the city, in the hall, the woman surnamed Lin was jumping into her Mother’s arms and crying, telling her parents roughly what happened.","“This injury of yours, it was actually a child who had caused it?” Patriarch Lin frowned and grimaced, “Are you sure you’re not mistaken? It was a four year old child who did it?”","The woman sobbed softly while saying, “I also didn’t expect that little girl to have such a vicious mind, she actually sprinkled medicine on me, if it wasn’t for those mercenaries who saved me in time, your daughter would only have died under the claws of those fierce beasts.”","“Damn it!” Patriarch Lin shouted angrily, slapping one hand heavily on the table, “Where did that wild child come from? How dare you bully my Lin family members?”","He cursed angrily and frowned as he asked in a deep voice, “Where are they now? Are they in this city too?”","“They followed the mercenary group back, they should have entered the city as well.” The woman sobbed softly and said, “Father, you must arrest those kids, I’m going to clean them up to relieve all this anger!”","On this side, Patriarch listened to his daughter’s words, and then asked the other three people who were travelling with her, and finally learnt that although he knew that there were some differences with what his daughter said, but it was a fact that his daughter had suffered a loss at the hands of those kids, so he immediately sent people to look for them in the city, and if he saw those kids, he would directly bring them back!","On the other side, Hao’er and the others were eating in the restaurant, and bought some pastries to put away in the space to bring back to eat, they borrowed the restaurant owner’s backyard, the three of them took a hot water bath, changed their clothes and then sat in the front waiting for Seventeen to come back.","The trio with outstanding appearance, even in the restaurant, was exceptionally eye-catching. Only, many people look at the three children’s body temperament were extraordinary, thinking that they should be the children of some big family, so they just cast some furtive glances to measure and then retracted their gaze.","“Big Brother, Seventeen is back.” Yue’er saw Seventeen coming back and revealed a delighted smile.","Hao’er and Muchen glanced down and knew that he had found the courtyard.","Not long after, Seventeen came up and bowed towards them, then said, “Young Master Hao, it has been arranged.”","Hao’er nodded and after settling the bill, he took his siblings and followed Seventeen out.","“Those kids are really outstanding looking, and at a glance, one can tell that they must be the children of a great family.”","“But the strength of that guard doesn’t look good, not quite like a guard of a great family.”","The people in the restaurant were talking, when two guards came in, and after hearing their words, they inquired, “Where did those kids you guys say went?”"]},{"number":4532,"title":"Chapter 4532: Array","paragraphs":["Chapter 4532: Array","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The voices talking in the restaurant paused for a moment, and their gazes sized up those two men, but neither of them said anything.","Seeing this, the two guards took out a piece of silver, threw it to the second, and asked, “What did those children look like? Where did they go?”","The waiter’s eyes followed the silver as he grinned, and said, “Thoere were a pair of identical looking twins, about three or four years old, they also have an older brother, about ten years old or so, and a guard dressed in black, but they’ve already left, heading in that direction, exactly where they’ve gone, this little one doesn’t know.”","Seeing this, the two guards looked at each other, and then turned around to follow the direction that waiter pointed out to seek.","Seeing them leave, the guests in the restaurant glanced at the waiter and said, “Without knowing who they are and casually revealing the direction where those kids left, if these two guards are going to find trouble with those kids, you’ve sinned.”","...","“What could happen? Those kids don’t look like they belong to an ordinary family, besides, those two guards just now had the Lin family’s token hanging on their waist. At a glance they knew they were the Lin family’s guards, so what could they do to those kids?” The waiter retorted in disbelief.","Seeing this, the people in the restaurant didn’t say anything more. The Lin Family was a big family in this city, so they shouldn’t be looking for trouble from a few children.","On the other hand, Seventeen brought Hao’er and the others to the courtyard that they had just rented. Entering inside, Seventeen spoke to them while saying, “My subordinate looked for someone to enquire about renting a house, the housekeeper introduced several courtyards, my subordinate went to see them all and finally picked this one.”","Seventeen looked at the courtyard and said, “This courtyard is out of the door to the east and then walk a street is the City Lord’s residence, so no one in this area dares to cause trouble, the environment is relatively good, although the courtyard is not big, the rent is also a bit more expensive than the other places, but in the end, subordinate felt that this courtyard is still more suitable for us.”","“Well, this place is very good.” Hao’er nodded and looked at Muchen and Muyue, saying, “Let’s stay here first, we’ll inquire some news about this territory first then we’ll make plans after we’ve become familiar with it. During this period of time, the two of you shouldn’t run out, lest you run into danger, got it?”","“Mm hmm, Big Brother don’t worry, we know.” The two little ones obediently said.","“Let’s rest for today! Starting tomorrow, Seventeen, go out and get some information, in addition ... ” Hao’er’s voice paused, looked at this courtyard and said, “Set up an array, the three of you are to familiarise yourselves with it, lest you get lost in there.”","“Good.” The three of them responded and headed inside first, familiarising themselves with the structure of this courtyard first.","The Lin family’s guards split up to look for and inquire, and it wasn’t until nightfall that they learnt that those few children had rented a courtyard and were already living in it, and so, they went back to the house to report first.","In the Patriarch’s house, hearing the report from the guards, the Patriarch sank his face and looked at the guards below with displeasure, and said, “Didn’t I say for you to bring the people back directly? After renting the courtyard, can’t you guys just enter?”","Upon hearing this, the guards responded in a loud voice, “Yes, my subordinates will now go and capture the person back.” With that, he quickly retreated.","At the small courtyard where Hao’er and the few were living, Muchen and Muyue fell into deep sleep the moment their heads touched the pillow. Because they had been travelling in the wilderness during this period of time, now as soon as they had a proper bed to rest on, they couldn’t help but relax. Knowing that their Big Brother was there, they weren’t worried about their safety at all."]},{"number":4533,"title":"Chapter 4533: Night","paragraphs":["Chapter 4533: Night","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Seventeen, go rest!” Hao’er stood in the courtyard and spoke to Seventeen who was on guard.","“Young Master Hao, it is fine for this subordinate to keep watch, you go to sleep first!” Seventeen said and did not leave.","Hao’er shook his head and said, “It’s useless for you to stand guard here, your strength is too weak, even if someone comes, you won’t be able to defeat them, so it’s better to go and rest first, so that you can do other things.”","Hearing this, Seventeen pursed his lips before finally responding, “Yes.” After taking two steps, he stopped again and asked, “Young Master Hao, will someone really sneak in tonight?” Would those young men really hold onto this?","“It doesn’t matter if there is or isn’t.” Hao’er said, saying, “Go on! You don’t need to worry here.”","...","Seeing this, Seventeen then walked towards his room.","This courtyard only has two courtyards, the front courtyard and the back courtyard, the front courtyard is the hall, and the back courtyard has three rooms, Muchen and Muyue were still young, and they were used to sleeping in one room, having each other as a companion, while Hao’er has his own room, and the other room was for Seventeen to live in.","Hao’er was sitting in front of Muchen and Muyue’s room door and cultivating with his eyes closed, at the same time releasing his divine sense to cover the entire courtyard ....","As the night deepened, the four guards quietly came to the door of the small courtyard and looked at the closed door, they looked at each other and then lifted their qi and leapt up, heading towards the small courtyard.","The courtyard was quiet, there was no sound, darkness all around. They walked along the path of the front yard, ready to go to the backyard, but did not expect that several people had been walking about for a long time also did not arrive at the front yard.","“What’s going on? How come we seem to be walking around in circles here?” A guard was a bit alarmed and lowered his voice to ask.","“Oh no, I’m afraid there’s an array here!” Another guard spoke.","“Isn’t it true that there are only three children and a guard who just condensed spirit energy into his body not long ago? How could they lay an array?” Another person asked with some dismay.","“We can’t walk out of this array, let’s exit first and go back to report to the Patriarch before deciding.”","Thus, several people followed the original and circled around several times before retreating back and going back to the Lin family to report.","“What? That small courtyard still has an array? You guys didn’t make a mistake?” When Patriarch Lin heard their report, his brows wrinkled as he walked through the hall with his hands in the air, looking at his daughter on the side, asking, “Didn’t you say that it was just three children and a guard with unimpressive strength? How did they know about arrays?”","“This, this daughter doesn’t know! It’s true that they followed the mercenaries this whole way, and they never showed anything.” The woman spoke in a hurry.","“Patriarch, I’ll go take a look!” A man in his thirties walked out with a confident look on his face and said, “I’ve dabbled slightly in arrays, breaking a Confusion Array won’t be a problem.”","“Well, go ahead! I don’t care what methods you use, you must bring those brats back to me!” Patriarch Lin commanded with a deep voice.","Thus, several guards, with the addition of a man in his thirties, once again headed to that small courtyard.","Hao’er, who was sitting cross-legged in front of the door of the room, had already noticed when those people stepped into the courtyard for the second time, and he slowly opened his eyes, as a cold glint flashed by his eyes.","He stood up and quietly walked towards the front courtyard.","Arriving at the front yard, the small figure stood at the corner and looked at the several people who were going round and round in the front yard, his eyes moved slightly, and in his mind, he remembered his father and mother’s teachings in the past."]},{"number":4534,"title":"Chapter 4534: Shocking","paragraphs":["Chapter 4534: Shocking","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Thus, instead of striking out to directly kill the people, he released the pressure of his Golden Core cultivation on his body and enveloped those few intruders.","“Puh!”","“Ah!”","“Pfft!”","“Pfft!”","...","The moment he released the oppressive pressure, those few people in the array immediately spat out a mouthful of blood, and dropped down to their knees.","“Who’s there?” The man in his thirties asked in shock, a look of fear in his eyes.","“Scram!”","Between the air, an icy cold voice came out, hitting several people straight in the head, causing them to hold their heads and cry out in pain at the same time, several people were also lifted out by a gust of wind, and one by one, they were swept out of that courtyard.","“Hiss!”","“Ah!”","The sound of cutting air accompanied by miserable screams rang out, those few people looked towards that small courtyard in horror, their faces turned pale, and they quickly left.","Hao’er pursed his lips as he stood in the courtyard, looking at the sky before finally turning back to rest.","He revealed his strength, intending to let them think that even though they were but a few children, but, in the dark, there were strong people to protect them, so that they did not dare to set their sights on them again, so that they can eliminate future problems.","If that Lin family was sensible, after this, they should not dare to come back.","At this time, in the Lin family.","Patriarch Lin looked at the several people in the hall in silence, after listening to their words, his face became grave: “It seems that those few children should have strong people protecting them in the dark, they cannot be moved.”","“Father, do you mean that we are just to let it go?” The woman asked with some reluctance.","“Or else?”","He sank his face to look at her with a look of displeasure in his eyes, “If it wasn’t because of you, how would we have offended an unknown strong man? To be able to have a strong person like that secretly protecting them, how could those children be ordinary people’s children like you said?”","After chastising his daughter, he then looked at the few people in the hall and said, “Tomorrow, you guys prepare a gift and go to that small courtyard to make amends and apologise, and in the meantime, probe their bottom line.”","“Patriarch, do you mean you want the few of us to go?” That man was a bit terrified, simply because tonight’s events made his heart fearful, he was really a bit afraid to go to that small courtyard again.","“Otherwise? Do you want me to go personally?” He grunted heavily, striding out with his hand on his back.","The next day, Seventeen went out early to buy breakfast and came back, as soon as he arrived at the courtyard gate, he saw a few people wandering back and forth in front of the gate, seeing this, he went forward and asked, “What are you doing here?”","Seeing Seventeen who was dressed in black, those people hastily backed up, the man in the lead revealed a smile and said, “Little brother, we are from the Lin family, we are here to make amends for our offence, we have offended you earlier, please don’t mind your Master, this is some of our thoughts, please take it.”","Seventeen didn’t take it, instead, after glancing at them, he said, “We don’t know any Lin family, nor do we know you guys, you guys hurry up and leave! Don’t hang around here.” With that, he crossed over them and pushed open the door into the courtyard, directly closing the courtyard door behind him.","A few people outside the door looked at each other in disbelief, and one of them asked, “What now?”","“What can we do? Naturally go back, do you guys dare to break in?” The man said in no good humour, and after shoving the things he was carrying into the guards” hands, he turned around and left with large strides.","At around the hour, several children got up and washed up and sat in the courtyard ready to eat breakfast when Seventeen told them about what happened in the morning.","“This subordinate just went to check, they have already left.”","“There is no need to pay attention to them, in the next few days you go out more and ask around for news.” Hao’er confided."]},{"number":4535,"title":"Chapter 4535: Breaking through and advancing","paragraphs":["Chapter 4535: Breaking through and advancing","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Thus, after having breakfast, Seventeen went out to inquire about the news, while Hao’er told the two little ones to cultivate by themselves and then prepared to go back to his room to cultivate, however, just as he was about to go back to his room, his sleeve was pulled by Yue’er.","“Big Brother.” Yue’er tilted her little exquisite face to look at him.","“What’s wrong, Yue’er?” Hao’er asked, turning around and asking, “Is there something you don’t understand in cultivation? Where do you not understand? Big Brother will explain to you.”","Yue’er shook her head and looked at him, “No Big Brother, Yue’er wants, wants to learn about herbs and medicine.” After she had tasted the use of medicines to clean up people, she thought of learning the knowledge of herbs, maybe she could also be like her Mother and be able to make those powerful medicines and medicinal pills?","Upon hearing this, Hao’er was stunned for a moment, and said with some disapproval, “You are still too young now, it’s hard for you to understand the knowledge of herbs, and those have to be done while trying your hand at it to become familiar with it quickly, you’d better learn swordsmanship first!”","...","“But, but Yue’er just wants to learn about herbs and medicine.” She whispered, tugging his sleeve coyly and said, “Big Brother, Yue’er will also work hard to learn swordsmanship, just, can you spare a little bit of time every day to teach me herbs and medicine?”","Seeing this, Muchen beside him also spoke, “Big Brother, let Yue’er learn if she wants to! She’ll learn quickly especially what she’s interested in.”","Seeing this, Hao’er thought of their Mother and looked at Yue’er again before finally nodding, “Alright! However, you can’t fall behind in cultivation, those are the skills you can use to protect yourself, and in medicine, when you see Father and Mother in the future, then you can let Mother teach you, so you can understand how those things work.”","“Mm hmm~” Yue’er nodded joyfully and asked with a smile, “Big Brother, then are we going to go outside to buy books on herbal medicine?”","Hao’er smiled and said, “No need, I have a book here that Mother gave me to read.”","He took out a thick Centennial Herbs Manual from his space to hand it to her, not forgetting to confide, “Yue’er, this is Mother’s book, you have to keep it carefully, you can’t dirty it or tear it.”","“Mmmmm, Yue’er will definitely take good care of Mother’s book!” She nodded, her small face filled with seriousness and solemnity, her small hands tightly holding the thick manual in her arms.","This was her Mother’s book! Mother, when can she see Mother again?","In another realm, Feng Jiu, as if she had a feeling in her heart, held Xuanyuan Mo Ze’s hand beside her, revealing a smile, “I think that the children must be thinking of me as well.”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze was slightly stunned, glanced at her, the corners of his lips slightly hooked: “Those three little guys, no one around to control them, I don’t know what kind of trouble they will evoke.”","“Hao’er and Chen’er have always been obedient and self-disciplined, but it’s this girl Yue’er, I’m really a little worried that she’ll cause trouble everywhere.” Feng Jiu shook her head helplessly and sighed, “I really want to find them earlier.”","“We will.”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze gripped her hand tightly and said, suddenly, the slow walking pace paused, his complexion slightly moved, especially after sensing the surging Spirit Energy surging in his body, his expression changed.","Feng Jiu who was beside him felt the change in his body’s spirit energy aura as soon as his steps stopped, and after being stunned for a moment, she said with some surprise: “You’re not going to advance, are you?”","“Probably.” Xuanyuan Mo Ze said, while suppressing the raging spirit energy aura in his body, saying, “This realm can’t withstand my advancement.”","“Then quickly go! Your advancement this time is not trivial, I will personally protect you!” Feng Jiu said, with a flick of her sleeve, a vortex appeared in front of them, and in the next moment, she pulled him towards that vortex."]},{"number":4536,"title":"Chapter 4536: Restless","paragraphs":["Chapter 4536: Restless","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","During this time, due to the disappearance of the three children, Feng Jiu had been preoccupied and unable to focus on refining medicinal pills. Even when she had mentioned before that she would set aside time to refine pills for emergencies, she hadn’t been able to find a moment to stop and meditate, let alone refine any pills.","This time, Xuanyuan Mo Ze’s advancement came so suddenly that both of them were somewhat caught off guard.","With the strength of his strength, this mortal realm could not withstand his breakthrough advancement, therefore, the two could only swiftly shuttle across from the void, returning to that piece of suspended island in the realm where their spirit consciousness was spread out.","This place, floating in the sky, surrounded by defensive boundaries, and the place where those people that Feng Jiu had taken in at the beginning lived, it was the safest place to advance in.","At this moment, on the suspended island in the clouds at the peak of the mountain, Xuanyuan Mo Ze sat, enveloped by the powerful, absorbing spirit energy frantically. For a hundred miles around, no one dared to come within even half a point of the island.","...","Feng Jiu stood a hundred metres away and watched, her brows lightly gathered, there was worry in her eyes, her heart was very anxious.","Supreme level strength, is the highest level she knows, is the rare existence of Immortal cultivators between heaven and earth, but, when such a grade is advanced, it is also a life of nine deaths, dangerous.","They had thought that the strength of the supreme level wouldn’t be so easy to touch, but they didn’t want it to come so suddenly when they weren’t prepared.","In that emergency, she only had time to stuff him with all the medicinal pills that could be of use, but she was still worried that those pills wouldn’t be able to withstand his advancement this time.","Xuanyuan Mo Ze could feel the overwhelming surge of spirit energy within his body, and he realized he could no longer delay his advancement to a later time. As he guided the energy through him, he opened his eyes and gazed at Feng Jiu, who stood a hundred meters away.","“Ah Jiu, don’t worry,” he reassured her, “In the past, there were never any problems during my advancement, and this time, nothing will go wrong either.” He looked at her and continued, “My advancement will take time, so you don’t need to stay here to guard me. At this level, no one can help me—go on and do what you need to do!”","“What are you talking about?” Feng Jiu retorted, her tone sharp. “Just focus on your advancement and don’t worry about anything else. I’ll stay here and guard you until you successfully complete it.”","Upon hearing her response, Xuanyuan Mo Ze’s lips parted slightly, as if wanting to say something. But in the end, he didn’t speak, his lips only curving into a faint smile.","“Alright.” He finally replied, slowly closing his eyes and letting go of all distractions, focusing solely on his advancement.","“Boom!”","“Crack!”","A deep rumble echoed from the sky, like distant thunder, and a bolt of lightning tore through the clouds. A sharp crackle resounded, reverberating in the air, making one’s heart race and stirring an unease deep within.","“Boom!”","“Crack!”","The thunder and lightning continued to crash above, shaking the sky with a roar so powerful it seemed to shake the very heavens, lingering in the air long after it had struck.","A hundred meters away, Feng Jiu stood at the mountain’s peak in a red dress, facing the turbulent winds and swirling clouds. Her ink-black hair whipped through the air, her robes billowing as the strong winds and spirit energy surged around her, the fabric slicing through the air with a sharp, cutting sound."]},{"number":4537,"title":"Chapter 4537: Old Man Tianji","paragraphs":["Chapter 4537: Old Man Tianji","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Feng Jiu narrowed her eyes as she gazed at the sky above where Xuanyuan Mo Ze sat cross-legged. There, a mass of dark clouds began to form, initially no bigger than his head, but gradually expanding outward, slowly turning the sky into a deep, ominous black.","The sun’s rays were blocked, and the sky that had once been bright now darkened to resemble the twilight of a setting sun. The entire world seemed shrouded in this dusk, and the oppressive atmosphere weighed heavily, making it hard to breathe.","Feng Jiu’s hands trembled slightly, her body tense, and her heart clenched in anxiety. Despite her rank as a peak Divine King and having experienced countless advancements and tribulations, she had never encountered anything like this. The unnatural phenomenon in the heavens and the incredibly strong spirit energy surging through Mo Ze’s body filled her with an unease and fear she had never known before.","At their level of strength, there was often a vague premonition just before disaster struck. And in this moment, she couldn’t shake the feeling that something was wrong.","Taking a deep breath, she steadied her emotions, clenching her trembling hand. She looked at the figure before her—Mo Ze, sitting with his eyes closed. Many times in the past, his advancements had gone smoothly without issue, and she hoped that this time would be no different. Perhaps her anxiety was simply due to the absence of the children and her failure to prepare the medicinal pills in advance.","...","Unbeknownst to her, as Xuanyuan Mo Ze’s aura surged and the thunder echoed through the sky, Old Tianji Zi, far away in another part of the world, suddenly opened his eyes. He looked up toward the darkening sky. Sitting cross-legged atop the Heavenly Mountain, his brow furrowed as he extended his hand to calculate. But despite his efforts, he could not discern the Heavenly Chance he sought, leaving his furrowed brow tense for a long time.","Other monarchs in distant heavenly regions heard the thunder. Some were clueless about its source, while others, curious, sought to investigate the heavenly phenomenon.","Feng Jiu expected the first lightning tribulation to strike soon, but to her surprise, Mo Ze remained kneeling at the mountain top for three days. Finally, the first lightning tribulation rumbled from the sky, crashing down with thunder and lightning, precisely targeting the spot where he sat.","However, the lightning tribulation was blocked by the defensive airflow created by the surging spirit energy around Mo Ze, dissolving most of its power. Only a small thread of lightning struck his body.","At the sight of this, Feng Jiu exhaled softly, her tense heart relaxing a little. If this was the case, there should be no danger. Even if the advancement was difficult, he should be able to make it through.","But just as relief began to settle in, a soft sigh reached her ears.","“Sigh!”","“Who’s there?” she immediately snapped, her gaze turning cold, sweeping over the source of the voice with a formidable pressure. Wherever her gaze landed, an ancient pressure emanated from her.","“It’s me.”","A nonchalant voice replied from behind the clouds. As Feng Jiu processed the familiar tone, she saw Old Man Tianji, dressed in a flowing white robe, one hand in front of him and the other behind, stepping on an Immortal Artifact, slowly descending toward her."]},{"number":4538,"title":"Chapter 4538: Unable to Predict","paragraphs":["Chapter 4538: Unable to Predict","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Senior?” Feng Jiu was slightly startled, her eyes betraying her surprise and concern. As far as she knew, Old Man Tianji rarely left the Sky Mountain, even when Mo Chen had disappeared, scattered between heaven and earth, Old Man Tianji had not shown himself. So why had he come now?","A vague sense of something unusual lingered in the air, and the moment her heart had calmed, it was once again lifted by his unexpected arrival.","Old Man Tianji floated down, stepping on his Immortal Artifact. His wise and weathered gaze fell on Xuanyuan Mo Ze, and a trace of pity flickered in his eyes. Looking up at the sky, now shrouded in gloom, he sighed softly under his breath.","“Why are you here, Senior? Is something wrong?” Feng Jiu asked, focusing her energy and glancing at him with a mix of curiosity and apprehension.","Old Man Tianji stood beside her, his eyes still fixed on Xuanyuan Mo Ze. “I came to take a look,” he replied simply, not offering any further explanation. His gaze remained fixed on Xuanyuan Mo Ze, his expression inscrutable.","...","Feng Jiu’s heart tightened. She turned to him, her voice soft with worry, “Senior, do you think he will be able to advance smoothly?”","Old Man Tianji remained silent, his eyes steady as he observed.","“I didn’t prepare the medicinal pills for him, and I can’t even imagine what kind of tribulation he’ll face this time,” Feng Jiu murmured, a note of unease creeping into her voice.","At her words, Old Man Tianji sighed deeply, casting a brief glance at her. “Even if you had prepared the pills, it would be of little use. Sometimes, the will of heaven cannot be defied.”","Feng Jiu’s brow furrowed slightly, and her heart sank at his cryptic response. “Are you saying he won’t be able to pass this trial?”","Old Man Tianji’s gaze remained fixed ahead. His voice was calm, but carried an air of finality. “How his destiny unfolds, we will see in nine hundred and ninety-one days.”","His words were heavy, and he paused before continuing, “Sometimes, it’s not that a person does not want to survive, but rather that the heavens will not allow it. Cultivating immortality is a journey against the heavens. Each advancement is like stepping into the gates of hell, and for those seeking to reach the Supreme, it is no easy feat.”","Feng Jiu’s face paled as she listened, her anxiety growing with each word. “In the past, there were always three lightning tribulations. Could this time... could it really be nine hundred and eighty-one?”","Her voice trembled as she thought of the previous lightning tribulation, which had been partially blocked, but still had left Xuanyuan Mo Ze’s robes singed. If it were truly nine hundred and eighty-one tribulations...","Old Man Tianji said nothing more, his gaze distant, lost in thought.","Feng Jiu’s face turned even paler as she watched the sky darken further. The powerful airflow and the oppressive pressure in the air only amplified her unease. She felt a desperate urge to act, to rush forward and stop this, but she knew that even if she tried, she could not interfere with his advancement now.","At this moment, there were only two possible outcomes: success, or failure—and the consequences of failure...","A shudder ran through her body as she dared not think of what that failure might bring. She couldn’t bear the thought of it.","Xuanyuan Mo Ze, in the midst of his advancement, remained unaware of everything around him. His focus was entirely on guiding the spirit energy and enduring the overwhelming force of the tribulation.","Feng Jiu took a few steps back, sitting down on a nearby rock. Her fists clenched tightly, her heart set with determination. “No matter what happens, I believe he will succeed!” she murmured firmly to herself, the weight of the situation pressing down on her, but her faith in him unwavering."]},{"number":4539,"title":"Chapter 4539: Can He Hold On?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4539: Can He Hold On?","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Feng Jiu couldn’t bear to think about what would happen if Xuanyuan Mo Ze failed to advance. If he failed, it wouldn’t just mean the loss of strength or cultivation—it could cost him his very life.","Perhaps it was the unrelenting vision in the sky, or the thunder and lightning that continued to reverberate, but gradually, more monarchs began to investigate the celestial phenomenon. They followed the sound of the thunder and the disturbance in the air, arriving at the outskirts of the levitating island.","However, since the island was Feng Jiu’s territory, suspended high in the sky and surrounded by a powerful barrier, none of the monarchs could approach. They were all blocked by the boundary, unable to get any closer.","One Monarch tried to force his way in, but was immediately repelled by the barrier’s powerful current. It pushed him back without hesitation.","He stroked his chin, murmuring, “This boundary Feng Jiu set up is truly remarkable, to the point where even I, a monarch, can’t enter.”","...","It wasn’t that they were entirely unable to enter—it was just that forcing their way through would break the barrier. Given that they respected Feng Jiu and her territory, none of them were willing to violate her space and risk breaking the barrier just for curiosity. As monarchs, their dignity prevented them from starting a confrontation with her.","What they didn’t know was that Old Man Tianji, despite his simple and unassuming appearance, had effortlessly entered the island without being stopped by the boundary.","“Could it be that Feng Jiu or Xuanyuan Mo Ze is advancing?” one of the monarchs who had gathered asked, his curiosity piqued.","“They’ve caused such a commotion—it must be them advancing,” another replied. “But both of them are at the peak of the Divine King level. If they were to advance any further, they could become Supreme-level beings, and that level of power is incredibly rare.”","“Maybe it’s not that they’re advancing. I heard they’ve been traveling around the Mortal Realm recently, so how could they suddenly return and be in the midst of such an advancement? Besides, they’ve been at the Divine King level for such a short time—it’s impossible for them to advance so quickly.”","“If they’re not advancing, then what else could explain all of this?”","The monarchs exchanged uncertain glances. After a long pause, one of them suggested, “Rather than standing here with no answers, we should visit the Black Tortoise Monarch. He’s on better terms with Feng Jiu and Xuanyuan Mo Ze, so he might have some insight.”","“That’s a good idea,” another monarch agreed, and they all swiftly flew off in the direction of the Black Tortoise Monarch’s territory.","Meanwhile, Feng Jiu remained unaware of the monarchs’ discussions outside the levitating island. She was completely focused on Xuanyuan Mo Ze’s advancement. As Old Man Tianji had said, this wasn’t a simple matter of just three lightning tribulations. Since the moment Old Man Tianji had appeared, four lightning tribulations had already struck.","Over the past few days, one lightning tribulation had fallen each day, each more intense than the last. After enduring four strikes, Xuanyuan Mo Ze sat on the mountaintop, his robes scorched black and his once-neat hair now disheveled and tangled.","“The fifth lightning tribulation is coming,” Feng Jiu murmured under her breath, her eyes filled with worry.","Each of these lightning tribulations was far stronger than anything they had experienced before. Even when she herself had advanced to the Divine King level, she had never faced such overwhelming and powerful tribulations. And now, there weren’t just three tribulations—there were ninety-nine hundred and eighty-one to endure.","Her heart tightened as she worried—could Mo Ze really hold out against them all?"]},{"number":4540,"title":"Chapter 4540: Linked Feelings","paragraphs":["Chapter 4540: Linked Feelings","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","As they were speaking, a loud rumble echoed in the sky, followed by a lightning bolt that split the heavens in two, accompanied by the intense thunderclap of the lightning tribulation.","Rumble!","The crack of thunder was deafening, and Feng Jiu, standing a hundred meters away, saw the lightning strike Mo Ze with precision. The sheer force of the strike sent a shock through her, and even from where she stood, she could feel the terrifying power of the lightning.","She watched helplessly as the bolt struck Mo Ze’s body, the electric current, glowing blue, coursing through him visibly. His clothes were burned to ashes, and his defensive vest disintegrated under the overwhelming power, scattering in all directions.","The smell of charred flesh filled the air, and Feng Jiu’s face turned pale. She instinctively stepped forward, but before she could take another step, Old Man Tianji’s hand shot out and grabbed her wrist.","...","“Don’t go.”","His voice was grave as he looked at the scene, his gaze fixed ahead. “The power of this lightning is far too great. You cannot help him.”","Feng Jiu’s lips pressed into a tight line, her gaze still on Mo Ze as she silently retracted her foot. The hand hidden under her sleeve clenched into a fist, the tension in her body unmistakable.","The two of them stood in silence, watching the scene unfold. Days passed, but Feng Jiu remained rooted to the spot, as though her feet were shackled. Day after day, she observed the ongoing tribulations. Every morning, the wounds from the previous day’s lightning hadn’t even begun to heal before the next strike came, battering Mo Ze’s already broken body.","She watched, helpless, as his injuries worsened each day, his body drenched in blood, but nothing she could do could change his fate.","Meanwhile, on the Floating Edge Immortal Island in the Mortal Realm, Hao’er emerged from his room to find Muchen and Muyue sitting together at a stone table in the courtyard, lost in their own thoughts. They were so absorbed that they didn’t even notice him approach.","Pausing, Hao’er frowned and walked over, calling out to them. “Chen’er, Yue’er, what’s wrong?”","Startled, the two children snapped out of their trance. Before Muchen could speak, Yue’er’s soft voice, tinged with fear and helplessness, reached him. “Big Brother, I think Yue’er might be dying.”","Hao’er’s heart skipped a beat, his face changing at once. “Don’t talk like that. Why would you say something like dying?”","“It’s true,” Yue’er replied, her eyes red and her head lowered. She placed a hand on her chest and continued, “My heart has been racing, really fast... like I’m going to die, Big Brother. What’s happening to me and Big Brother? Are we sick and going to die? I’m so scared.”","As her voice cracked, she jumped into Hao’er’s arms, clutching him tightly.","Hao’er gently patted her back, trying to calm her. “It’s alright, Yue’er, don’t be afraid. Everything will be fine.”","He turned to Muchen, concern in his eyes. “Chen’er, are you feeling the same way as Yue’er?”","Muchen nodded slowly. “It doesn’t happen all the time, but sometimes my heart races really fast, and I feel panic and fear. After a while, it passes. But...” He hesitated, then added, “It’s been getting worse these past two days. The feeling comes on stronger and faster.”","Hao’er thought for a moment, then took their pulses again, but found nothing out of the ordinary. His medical skills were basic at best, so he couldn’t detect any hidden issue. He was left more puzzled than before."]},{"number":4541,"title":"Chapter 4541: Seeking a Doctor","paragraphs":["Chapter 4541: Seeking a Doctor","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Hao’er glanced outside the courtyard and asked, “Where’s Seventeen?”","Muchen replied, “He went to buy food. He’s been gone for a while, so he should be back soon.”","Hao’er nodded and said, “Alright then, let’s go. I’ll take you both to the medical center in the city to have the doctor check you out. I’m concerned there might be something wrong, and it’s better to be safe.”","The three of them walked toward the front courtyard, crossing the array and heading toward the gate, when they saw Seventeen coming in, carrying a food box.","“Young Master Hao, Young Master Chen, Miss Yue, are you going out?” Seventeen asked, surprised.","...","“Seventeen, you’re back just in time.” Hao’er stopped and looked at him, asking, “Which medical hall in the city has the best doctors?”","“The most famous one in the city is Rejuvenating Hall,” Seventeen answered. “They have not only doctors, but also refiners and pharmacists.”","Seventeen then looked at the three of them, his brow furrowed. “Is someone feeling unwell? Should I send someone to get a doctor?”","“No need, we’ll go there ourselves,” Hao’er replied. “Chen’er and Yue’er aren’t feeling well, and I want to get them checked out.”","“It’s a bit far to Rejuvenating Hall, so I’ll get a carriage ready,” Seventeen said. Then, noticing the food box in his hand, he hesitated. “Young Master, Miss, would you like to eat something before we go?”","Hao’er thought for a moment and glanced at Muchen and Yue’er. He stepped forward, took the food box from Seventeen, and said, “You go ahead and prepare the carriage. We’ll eat here first.”","He led Muchen and Yue’er back to the small hall in the front yard, laid out the food, and said, “Eat a little. I’m not sure how long it will take later.”","The two little ones, clearly anxious and scared, barely touched their food, unable to eat more than a few bites. Hao’er also ate casually, and not long after, Seventeen returned to report that the carriage was ready. The group then set off for Rejuvenating Hall.","Rejuvenating Hall, being the most prestigious medical facility in the city, didn’t see many customers. The prices for both medicine and consultations were steep, so only those with serious, unsolved issues would come here. Most people who visited were either seeking consultations or buying expensive medicines and pills.","When Seventeen drove the carriage to the front of Rejuvenating Hall, he stopped and announced, “Young Masters, Miss, we’ve arrived.”","Hao’er opened the carriage curtain and glanced out. The doorway was quiet, with only a few people inside. Remembering Seventeen’s words about the exclusivity of Rejuvenating Hall, he stepped down from the carriage, leading Muchen and Yue’er out as well.","Seventeen parked the carriage and followed them into the hall.","The pharmacist running the hall noticed the children’s fine clothes and the presence of a guard in black, so he smiled and approached them.","“Young Master, how can I assist you?”","“We’re here for a consultation,” Hao’er replied, adopting the demeanor of someone much older. “Please bring forth the doctor with the best skills.”","“Of course, please follow me,” the apprentice said with a smile, leading them to the back where an elderly man waited."]},{"number":4542,"title":"Chapter 4542: Being Beaten","paragraphs":["Chapter 4542: Being Beaten","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“This is Doctor Feng from our Rejuvenating Hall. He has been practicing medicine for decades and is highly skilled,” the apprentice introduced. He then turned to the elderly man. “Doctor Feng, these are the ones requesting a consultation.”","The old man stroked his beard and looked at the children standing before him, then glanced at the guards behind them. He asked, “Who needs the consultation? Come forward and show your hand.”","Before Hao’er could speak, Muchen stepped forward and sat on the stool. “I do.” He placed his hand on the cushion before him.","Doctor Feng extended his hand to check Muchen’s pulse while his other hand continued to stroke his beard. After a moment, he withdrew his hand and studied Muchen’s face carefully before speaking. “You’re not ill. Your health is excellent. You’ve simply been restless these past couple of nights, which has disturbed your sleep. I’ll prescribe some calming medicine, and you’ll feel better soon.”","Muchen, relieved, hadn’t expected such a simple diagnosis. His mind had been restless lately, which caused the discomfort in his chest. He pursed his lips, glancing up at Hao’er.","...","Noticing this, Hao’er spoke up. “My brother’s heart beats very fast sometimes. He feels panicked and uneasy. Are you sure there’s no other issue?”","Doctor Feng’s face darkened at the question. “Restlessness is all. There’s no other problem. His health is fine. If you take him to other doctors, they’d likely tell you the same.”","He stroked his mustache and looked at Hao’er sternly. “Such a minor symptom, I won’t make a mistake in diagnosing it.”","Hao’er, unconvinced, turned to Yue’er. “Come here.”","Muchen stepped aside as Yue’er went forward and sat on the stool. She blinked up at the elderly man with a hint of fear in her eyes. Her soft voice trembled as she spoke, “Grandfather, I can’t sleep well lately. Sometimes I wake up in the middle of the night, and my heart races very fast. When it happens, I get scared. Grandfather, do I have a serious illness? Will I die?”","The little girl’s voice, filled with fear and vulnerability, was so endearing that Doctor Feng couldn’t help but think of his own granddaughter. His stern expression softened.","He smiled gently and said, “Don’t worry, little one. You’re not sick. Your body is fine. Like your brother, you’ve just been feeling restless. It’s nothing serious. A bit of calming medicine should do the trick.”","“Thank you, Grandfather~” Yue’er said sweetly, her eyes brightening with relief.","Hao’er thought for a moment before asking, “Could you prescribe something to help calm their minds, please?”","Doctor Feng glanced at him and quickly wrote out a prescription. Seventeen, who had been waiting nearby, stepped forward to take it and went to the front to gather the medicine.","Hao’er then asked Doctor Feng a few more questions about any precautions to take. After receiving the answers, he thanked the doctor and turned to lead his younger siblings toward Seventeen, when a loud, angry voice broke through the calm atmosphere of the hall.","“Idiot! Can’t you watch where you’re going?!”","The harsh words, accompanied by a scolding tone, echoed clearly in the still air of the Rejuvenating Hall.","Hao’er and the others immediately tensed. The voice belonged to a man, and judging by the tone, someone was angrily reprimanding Seventeen, who had gone to collect the medicine and settle the bill.","As they approached, they saw that one side of Seventeen’s face was slightly swollen. Hao’er’s expression darkened, and a dangerous glint flashed in his eyes."]},{"number":4543,"title":"Chapter 4543: Retaliate","paragraphs":["Chapter 4543: Retaliate","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Seventeen’s face burned with anger. The man and woman had clearly bumped into him, yet he’d been met with a swift, brutal slap. The blow was so sudden, his ear still rang, and his cheek pulsed with pain.","“Seventeen, what happened?” Hao’er’s voice was sharp and cold.","“Young Master,” Seventeen began, suppressing his fury. He stepped back, shaking his head. “Let’s just go back.” He’d endured the slap. They were strangers here, vulnerable. As an adult, he knew he couldn’t risk causing trouble for the children.","“Go back? Ha! Not without an apology!” The man sneered, emboldened by Seventeen’s restraint. His eyes narrowed menacingly as he looked at the young boy before him.","“Answer me,” Hao’er commanded, his tone unwavering.","...","Seventeen hesitated, then explained, “I’d paid the bill and was returning to you when they bumped into me. As I moved aside, he slapped me.”","“So what?” the man retorted, advancing. He raised his hand to strike Seventeen again, but a sharp pain shot through his shin, and his knees buckled. He cried out, collapsing onto the ground.","“Ssshh! Arghhhhhhhh!”","He clutched his legs, appearing to kneel before Seventeen.","Seventeen stared, bewildered, at Muchen standing nearby. “Young Master Chen...”","Muchen had kicked the man’s shin with surprising force. The man’s cry of agony suggested the kick had landed squarely on the bone.","“He hit you, you hit him back,” Muchen declared, his small frame radiating authority. He simply couldn’t tolerate anyone bullying Seventeen.","“Brother!” The girl shrieked, attempting to push Muchen away, but he deftly dodged her.","“You little brat! I’ll gut you!” The man snarled, struggling to his feet. He lunged towards Muchen.","Hao’er stepped forward to protect Muchen, but Yue’er intervened. “Big Brother, use this!” She presented him with a broom, seemingly conjured out from thin air.","The apprentice, hoping to avoid trouble, watched with growing unease. He couldn’t help but twitch at the sight of the young girl offering a broom as a weapon. Where did these children come from?","Hao’er took the broom, pushing Muchen behind him. He swung the broom, striking the man across the face.","“Ah! Damn brat!”","The broom connected with the man’s nose, sending a jolt of pain and a rush of blood flowed down his face.","“Brother, you...your nose is bleeding!”","The woman shrieked, her eyes wide with fury. “You ill-mannered children from god knows where! Are you trying to get yourselves killed?”"]},{"number":4544,"title":"Chapter 4544: What to do","paragraphs":["Chapter 4544: What to do","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Yue’er’s eyes widened, her innocent gaze filled with shock. “Big Brother,” she pouted, “She’s scolding us!”","“Ignore her,” Hao’er replied, glancing disdainfully at the man with the bloody nose. “Mad dogs always bark.” He turned to Seventeen and Muchen. “Let’s go.” He tossed the broom at the Apprentice and took Yue’er’s hand, heading for the exit.","As they stepped towards the door, the man, now wiping his nose, lunged at Hao’er’s back. “You think you can just walk away?” He snarled, swinging a fist.","“Watch out!” The apprentice cried, fearing for the young boy.","Sensing the attack, Hao’er’s eyes narrowed. He swiftly turned, grabbing the man’s wrist and bending it sharply downwards. Simultaneously, he delivered a precise kick to the man’s chin. He spun in mid-air, landing gracefully as the sickening crack of bone and a scream echoed through the hall. The man crashed to the floor.","...","“Brother!” the girl shrieked, rushing to his side. She stared at Hao’er, her face a mask of disbelief. “You... you...”","Blood started gushing out from that man’s mouth, his jaw throbbing, and his hands uselessly twitching. He couldn’t even lift them.","The apprentice, broom still in hand, stood frozen. Doctor Feng, who had come to investigate the commotion, was equally stunned.","Seventeen and Muchen stood beside Hao’er, who looked at the fallen man with cold detachment. “This is a lesson,” Hao’er said, his voice sharp. “Attack us again, and I’ll make sure you can’t use your hand ever.”","No one intervened as the three children, flanked by their guard, walked away. Only after they had left did a deep, authoritative voice break the silence, snapping Doctor Feng back to reality.","“Prepare a carriage to take this Young Master home.”","The apprentice and Doctor Feng turned to see a middle-aged man in rich brocade standing at the top of the stairs. They bowed respectfully.","“Chen Family.”","After bowing, the apprentice hurried to help the injured man and then went to find a carriage to send the injured man back.","Once outside Rejuvenating Hall, Seventeen asked, “Young Master, shall we return or go elsewhere?”","“Let’s get dessert at the shop down the street,” Hao’er suggested, turning to Muchen and Yue’er. “We’ll have some treats before going back. Anything else you’d like to eat? Big Brother will take you.”","The younger children shook their heads. “Big Brother,” Yue’er asked, “The doctor said we’re not sick. Does that mean we’re really fine and not sick?”","“Yes, if the doctor said so, you’re fine. Don’t worry,” Hao’er reassured them.","They paused, then Yue’er asked, “Big Brother, we hurt that man. Will he cause trouble? What if he brings more people, and we can’t win?”"]},{"number":4545,"title":"Chapter 4545: Unknown origin","paragraphs":["Chapter 4545: Unknown origin","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Young Master,” Seventeen said, a hint of worry in his voice as he drove, “We’ve beaten up someone today. I fear they won’t let it go. Should we lay low for a while?”","“We only acted in self-defense,” Hao’er replied, his gaze hardening. “Why should we fear their retaliation?” He recalled the insults and the violent attack. “Breaking his hand was a sufficient lesson. If he persists, another confrontation won’t deter me. My parents taught me to avoid trouble, but never to back down. If someone bullies you, settle the score. If you can’t win, escape.”","He had assessed the situation before making a move. People of the Floating Edge Immortal Island weren’t generally powerful. His skills were sufficient for most threats. And if not, Silver Wolf would protect them. He wasn’t afraid.","Seventeen remained silent. At the dessert shop, they found a table. Hao’er’s gaze flickered. Without moving his head, he scanned a section of the street and scoffed lightly.","Someone was following them.","...","Who was it? The man who had been beaten by them back at Rejuvenating Hall? Or someone else?","He pondered, his expression unmoved. After finishing their desserts, they returned to the courtyard they had rented. As they entered, Hao’er sensed their pursuer retreating.","Back at Rejuvenating Hall, in the attic, an informant delivered his report. “They entered the courtyard, and I inquired about them. Three children and a guard, recent arrivals. They rarely leave, and the guard fetches their meals. No one knows their origins.”","The man drinking tea waved his hand, dismissing the guard.","Another guard arrived. “Master, the injured man is Yang family’s Second Young Master. They’re investigating the children’s background, but have made no other moves.”","“You may retreat,” the man said, swirling his tea.","“What do you think?” he asked an elderly man who emerged.","“Master, the guard’s and the twins’ strength are negligible, but their spirit energy is remarkably pure. The teenager’s skill is exceptional, he concealed his energy very well. I can’t gauge his level.”","The man’s expression shifted. “They possess an air of nobility, especially the older boy, with his domineering presence. No ordinary family could raise such children.”","He paused. “I know the prominent families here, and few have children comparable to them. They must be from another region.”","The old man hesitated. “If they’re noble, why such a weak bodyguard? And no hidden protectors on the first floor? The report of only three children and a guard is unusual.”"]},{"number":4546,"title":"Chapter 4546: Can’t be touched","paragraphs":["Chapter 4546: Can’t be touched","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The middle-aged man in black, tapped his fingers rhythmically against the polished tabletop, while he contemplated. After a moment , his eyes flickered with a sudden, sharp intensity. “Elder Yuan,” he instructed, his voice low and deliberate, “I need you to personally observe those children. Pay close attention to their movements, their habits, everything. More importantly, gauge the reaction of the Yang family to this incident. We must tread carefully, Elder Yuan. Do not, under any circumstances, alert the snake before the Yang family makes their move.”","The old man hesitated, a flicker of uncertainty crossing his weathered features. “But Master,” he ventured, his voice filled with polite inquiry, “Why such an intense focus on these children? They appear to have no direct connection to us. Even if they pique your curiosity, surely such personal observation is unnecessary?”","A soft, almost indistinguishable chuckle escaped the middle-aged man’s lips. He gently rotated the delicate teacup in his hands, the fragrant steam swirling upwards. “Elder Yuan, tell me. Did you manage to get a clear, unobstructed view of the young boy’s movements earlier today?”","Elder Yuan, taken slightly aback by the directness of the question, shook his head slowly. “I must confess, Master, I did not.” He elaborated, “The boy’s counterattack was so swift, so unexpected. We were not prepared for such a rapid response. Consequently, neither the precise movements nor the sheer speed of his strikes were discernible. In the blink of an eye, all I saw wa sthat he had seized Young Master Yang’s hand and delivered a devastating kick to his chin.”","The middle-aged man nodded thoughtfully, a hint of intrigue in his eyes. “Indeed,” he mused, his voice filled with contemplation. “Among the numerous families within this city, I can think of no young teenager, particularly one of approximately ten years of age, who would possess such remarkable courage and such formidable speed. Furthermore,” he continued, his tone deepening, “the young teenager’s true strength remains completely obscured. It is evident that he possesses a remarkable ability to conceal his power. Tell me, Elder Yuan, what kind of secret technique would be required to effectively mask one’s strength, even from seasoned observers such as ourselves?”","...","Upon hearing these words, Elder Yuan’s heart stirred. His gaze, previously lowered, lifted to meet the man. “Master,” he asked, his voice now had a newfound understanding, “What are you implying?”","“These children,” the middle-aged man explained, “exude an undeniable air of nobility. Yet, they are conspicuously lacking in robust, visible protection. They have chosen to rent a modest courtyard, living a secluded and unassuming existence. I strongly suspect that they are fugitives, fleeing from some unknown peril, and that they are carrying with them precious, hidden treasures.” With a penetrating stare, he continued on “Do you now comprehend my meaning, Elder Yuan?”","Elder Yuan’s heart skipped a beat, a sense of urgency washing over him. He lowered his head quickly, acknowledging the implications. “I understand, Master.”","“Go, then,” the middle-aged man commanded, his voice now calm and authoritative. “If you successfully manage this delicate situation, you will be rewarded handsomely.”","“Yes, Master,” Elder Yuan replied, bowing respectfully. He turned and exited the attic, closing the door behind him. As he walked away, he looked up, his eyes reflecting a complex mix of emotions.","At his advanced age, the allure of material wealth had diminished significantly, particularly if it required him to undertake actions that could potentially harm innocent children.","However, he was acutely aware that failure to comply would simply result in the task being assigned to another.","With a heavy sigh, he turned and walked away, resigned to his duty.","Meanwhile, across the street, within the confines of the Yang family compound, Patriarch Yang listened attentively to the information provided by his subordinates. His brow furrowed, his expression stern. “Only three children and their bodyguards are renting that courtyard?” he questioned, his voice laced with skepticism. “Have you thoroughly investigated? Are you absolutely certain you cannot ascertain their origins?”","“Patriarch,” the subordinate replied, his voice apologetic, “we have exhausted all available avenues, but we have been unable to determine their place of origin. However, I did overhear a conversation between one of the Lin family bodyguards and a close associate, in which they discussed these three children.”","“Oh?” Patriarch Yang asked with piqued interest. “And what did they say?”","The subordinate continued, his voice quick and eager to please. “My associate, a guard within the Lin family, mentioned that these three children are under the protection of a powerful individual. The Lin family, it seems, learned this lesson through a rather unpleasant experience. Ultimately, Patriarch Lin was forced to suppress the incident, even sending gifts to their door as an apology. However, they were unable to gain entry to the courtyard.”","“Is that truly the case?” Patriarch Yang asked, his surprise evident. “This requires further investigation. Tell me everything you know.”","“The bodyguard only mentioned these few details, and the rest of his subordinates are unaware of anything further,” the subordinate admitted, his head bowed in deference."]},{"number":4547,"title":"Chapter 4547: Guess","paragraphs":["Chapter 4547: Guess","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Patriarch Yang, upon hearing the report, fixed his gaze on the subordinate, pausing thoughtfully. “Then delve deeper,” he commanded. “I demand to know their origins and the nature of their conflict with the Lin family. What specific losses did the Lins endure, and why was the matter concealed? Unearth these details, and you will be generously rewarded.”","“Yes, Patriarch,” the guard responded swiftly, retreating to carry out his orders.","The following day, having learned the full extent of the Lin family’s suppressed defeat and the presence of a powerful guardian within the children’s courtyard, Patriarch Yang, after careful deliberation, decided to conceal the assault on his son.","The Lin family held significant influence. To challenge those who could so thoroughly humble the Lin family would be imprudent. Should news of the Yang family’s aggression towards children spread, they would be universally condemned. Since direct confrontation was inadvisable, and a quiet resolution impossible, the matter was best left undisturbed.","Within the tranquil courtyard, Hao’er and his companions spent two uneventful days. Hao’er dedicated himself to cultivation, while also guiding Muchen, Yue’er and Seventeen.","...","The calming soup offered some respite, improving their sleep and lessening their restlessness. However, periodic episodes of intense fear and heart palpitations persisted.","“Big Brother, the calming soup seems ineffective. What should we do?” Yue’er asked, her delicate face etched with concern.","“I agree,” Muchen added. “It tastes horrible!”","“Then stop drinking it,” Hao’er advised. “Rest, and cease your training. Let’s observe if the symptoms persist.”","As he spoke, Muchen and Yue’er paled, their foreheads beaded with sweat. They clutched their chests, visibly distressed.","“Muchen, Yue’er!” Hao’er exclaimed, his worry evident.","“The feeling’s returning...” Muchen groaned, clutching his chest in agony.","“Young Master Chen, Young Miss Yue!” Seventeen cried, alarmed.","“Seventeen, carry Chen’er to his room!” Hao’er instructed, lifting Yue’er and rushing inside.","Seventeen obeyed, placing Muchen on his bed.","Hao’er sat behind them, channeling spiritual energy. “Breathe deeply,” he instructed, gently massaging their backs.","They followed his guidance, their breathing gradually calming. After a time, their distress subsided, and they opened their eyes.","“Are you better?” Hao’er asked.","“The feeling’s gone,” Muchen said, his hand over his heart.","“Why do we share this pain?” Yue’er asked, puzzled.","Hao’er considered their symptoms: shared heart palpitations, panic, and fear, interspersed with periods of calm. Despite the doctor’s assurances of their physical health, a theory began to form in his mind, though he remained uncertain."]},{"number":4548,"title":"Chapter 4548: Danger","paragraphs":["Chapter 4548: Danger","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“I’ve been thinking over the past few days,” Hao’er began, his gaze fixed on Muchen and Yue’er, “Perhaps your symptoms aren’t due to illness, but a bloodline connection. A sense that something has happened to Father and Mother.” Seeing their startled expressions, he continued on with apprehension, “It’s just my own guess. After all, Father and Mother are incredibly powerful. With the Devil Lord gone, who could possibly be their enemy? I really can’t think of anyone that can be their match.”","“Then, what happened to them?” The children asked, their voices filled with worry.","Hao’er shook his head. “I don’t know. We can’t get any news here. Even if something happened, we’d be in the dark.”","“Then let’s go!” Muchen exclaimed, his face urgent. “Let’s find that sect. You said they could help us leave this place and reach the other realms! Maybe we can go home that way!”","“Big Brother, are we leaving?” Yue’er asked with a twinkle in her eyes.","...","Hao’er paused, then nodded. “Alright, we’ll prepare to leave for the sect and find a way back as soon as possible.” He turned to Seventeen. “Prepare dried food, pastries, anything we can eat on the journey.”","“Yes,” Seventeen replied immediately as he turned and went to gather all the things needed for the next leg of their journey.","They spent the entire day preparing. At dawn the next morning, Seventeen drove the carriage, heading towards the sect.","The old man from Rejuvenating Hall who had been watching them, sent a report back and continued to follow them. The owner of Rejuvenating Hall, suspecting they carried valuables, joined the pursuit.","The carriage left the west gate, speeding along the mountain road. Muchen and Yue’er gazed out the window, enjoying the morning breeze as they watched the scenery pass them by.","Hao’er was resting with his eyes closed, until they left the city, he suddenly opened his eyes and a cold glint flashed by his eyes.","“Big Brother, what’s wrong?” Muchen asked, noticing the change.","“Someone’s following us,” Hao’er said.","Muchen and Yue’er tensed. Seventeen asked, “Could it be someone from Rejuvenating Hall, Young Master?”","“Keep going. We’ll see who it is,” Hao’er replied. “Stay alert.”","“Alright,” the children nodded, though they couldn’t sense the pursuers.","The carriage continued, passing occasional travelers. On a secluded mountain road, a figure suddenly leapt onto the horse’s head, forcing it to its knees.","“Ssshh!”","“Bang!”","The horse whinnied, then collapsed, tilting the carriage forward, throwing the children and Seventeen out."]},{"number":4549,"title":"Chapter 4549: Face of a human, heart of a beast","paragraphs":["Chapter 4549: Face of a human, heart of a beast","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Watch out!” Seventeen shouted, reacting instantly. As he tumbled from the collapsing carriage, he braced himself with one hand, twisting to catch Yue’er, who had been thrown out. With a swift somersault, he landed gracefully, the child safely in his arms.","Meanwhile, Hao’er, anticipating the chaos, pulled Muchen close as they were ejected from the carriage. He propelled them forward, landing several meters away along the edge of the mountain path.","“Are you alright? Are you hurt?” Hao’er asked, his eyes scanning the two younger children forany injuries.","They both shook their heads in unison, although Muchen’s expression was grim and Yue’er’s brows furrowed. They were unharmed, but the sudden, violent disruption had unsettled them.","“Young Master, the carriage is destroyed,” Seventeen reported, his voice tight, his gaze fixed on the wreckage.","...","Hao’er’s eyes swept over the shattered carriage before settling on the group of eight or nine figures standing before them. A flicker of recognition crossed his face.","These were not the individuals they had encountered previously. Instead, it was the owner of Rejuvenating Hall himself, accompanied by his men.","The group consisted of nine individuals: the owner, a cultivator at the Golden Core; two elderly men, also at the Golden Core level; and several others with cultivation levels in the mid-stage of foundation building.","For a confrontation with a few children, this was an overwhelming force. These cultivators represented the core strength of Rejuvenating Hall, perhaps even the extent of their power.","“Rejuvenating Hall? What do you want?” Seventeen demanded, his voice steady.","A low chuckle emanated from the owner of Rejuvenating Hall. He ignored Seventeen, focusing his attention on Hao’er, his gaze lingering before shifting to the younger children. “I have no desire to cause you children harm,” he said, his tone deceptively mild. “Simply leave behind the treasures you carry, and you may depart unharmed.”","“Treasures?” Hao’er asked, his eyes narrowing. “What treasures?”","“Ha, indeed, what treasures?” The owner of Rejuvenating Hall replied, his eyes gleaming with avarice.","“Brother,” Yue’er said, her voice filled with childlike surprise, “isn’t the owner of Rejuvenating Hall a wealthy merchant? How can he be so poor as to resort to robbery?”","Muchen scoffed, his voice laced with disdain. “The phrase ‘unscrupulous mind, beastly heart’ perfectly describes him.”","“Or perhaps ‘a wolf in sheep’s clothing’?” Yue’er suggested, blinking innocently.","Muchen pondered for a moment. “That’s not quite accurate,” he concluded.","“So, is he truly the owner of Rejuvenating Hall, or a bandit who waylays travelers?” Yue’er asked, her curiosity piqued.","The two four-year-olds stared at the group, their innocent words and pure gazes causing the old man Yuan, standing behind the owner, to lower his head in shame. He couldn’t meet their eyes.","However, not everyone shared his remorse. Another elderly man, hearing their words, scoffed. “Master, why not dispose of the guard and simply take the brats? A thorough search will reveal their treasures.”"]},{"number":4550,"title":"Chapter 4550: Shock","paragraphs":["Chapter 4550: Shock","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Do it!” The owner of Rejuvenating Hall glanced coldly at Hao’er and the others, and with a single order, several cultivators behind him swept forward, heading toward Hao’er and his group.","“Seventeen, take care of Chen’er and Yue’er!” Hao’er said in a cold voice, motioning for them to step back. At the same time, his hand moved, and a long sword with a cold gleam appeared in his hand. Spirit energy surged from his body, and the sword qi instantly lashed out, striking the cultivators like a flash of lightning at a speed too fast to perceive.","“Arghhh!”","“Sss!”","“How is this possible?”","...","For a moment, the screams were accompanied by gasps of pain and disbelief. They had originally thought, that they were just a few kids and having so many of them to beseige them was an overkill. When they made their move, they didn’t think for a second that these kids could avoid it, but then...","Hao’er’s strength was at the pinnacle of cultivation with a Golden Core. He immediately overwhelmed the mid-stage cultivators, both in speed and strength as he released his oppressive aura of his realm.","A mere mid-stage cultivator was like a child facing an adult when matched against a cultivator with the strength of a Golden Core. There was no chance or possibility of them fighting back at all.","What’s more, how could they possibly have imagined that this young boy, only around ten years old, had already reached the strength of a Golden Core?","Not only were the mid-stage cultivators shocked, but even the owner of Rejuvenating Hall and the two elderly men, all at the level of a Golden Core, gasped as they watched the small figure.","“A Golden Core Cultivator?!”","“Impossible!”","“Indeed! This child is actually a cultivator with a Golden Core?!”","If they had previously suspected that these children possessed precious treasures, at this moment, when they saw the Golden Core cultivation permeating from the little boy, they were even more certain that these children must have precious treasures! Maybe they were even treasures from heaven and earth that could allow people to advance in cultivation!","Otherwise, at the age of only ten or so, how could he possibly have reached the level of Golden Core cultivation?","Upon thinking of this, the three heaved their breaths. Even Yuan Lao, who had previously felt a little ashamed of targeting the children, stared at the three children with sparkling eyes and rapid breathing.","They could not believe that someone so young could have reached the level of a medicinal pill cultivator without some kind of natural treasure or top-notch cultivation method or treasure.","Not to mention anything else, if they could obtain that top-notch cultivation method or a treasure that could help them break through to the next level, perhaps they could suddenly reach a higher level of medicinal pill cultivation and extend their lifespan!","At the thought of this, the blood in their bodies boiled. This was truly an unexpected surprise! As long as they captured these children, they would be able to pry the information they wanted from them!","With Hao’er’s peak strength of a Golden Core, he naturally knew that the other three cultivators with similar cultivation levels were breathing rapidly and excitedly. He pursed his lips, and the sword in his hand pointed diagonally at the ground. The blade was clean and did not even have a speck of blood on it, because what struck out was just sword energy.","His indifferent and deep gaze swept over the two dead cultivators on the ground, as well as the four people who were covering their wounds in horror and backing away. The sword in his hand rotated, and the sword shadow refracted.","He looked at the owner of Rejuvenating Hall and the two old men and said coldly, “If you leave now, I can pretend that nothing happened.”","“Haha, leave? Do you think that’s possible?” The owner of Rejuvenating Hall laughed, his greedy eyes fixed on him as if he had spotted prey."]},{"number":4551,"title":"Chapter 4551: Unbelievable","paragraphs":["Chapter 4551: Unbelievable","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Hearing those words, Hao’er clenched the sword in his hand. “Since you wish to die, I shall grant your wish.”","The young boy, sword in hand, appeared like a king controlling life and death. His tone was domineering and confident, cold and bloodthirsty. Had one not witnessed it firsthand, no one would believe it came from the mouth of a young boy who was merely ten years old.","Elder Yuan listened, his eyes twitching slightly. He looked at the child and said, “Hand everything over. Our Master said you can leave alive. You must understand that if you die, you will have nothing. Moreover, even if you are a Golden Core Cultivator, we three are also Golden Core Cultivators, not to mention you are just a young boy of around ten years old. How can you fight us? Even if you try, you alone cannot defeat the three of us.”","“Really? You can try.” Hao’er replied, unfazed, protecting Muyue and Muchen in front of him, his gaze fixed on the men.","The owner of Rejuvenating Hall sneered, “Since you are so ungrateful, do not blame us for being rude!” He then said, “Elder Yuan, Elder He, take them down!”","...","“Yes,” the two men answered without hesitation. They raised their energy and swept out, long swords appearing in their hands.","Hao’er saw this and gestured behind him with one hand, telling Muchen and Muyue to back up further. At the same time, the small figure darted out, directly meeting their attack.","Muyue was worried. “Will Big Brother be able to defeat them?”","Muchen pursed his lips and remained silent, his gaze fixed on the battle ahead. Suddenly, he noticed the four injured cultivators who had retreated, and under the signal of the owner of Rejuvenating Hall, they quietly approached them.","“Be careful!” Muchen whispered, warning his sister and Seventeen.","However, just as Muchen gave his warning, the cultivators charged forward, reaching out to grab the two younger ones.","They couldn’t handle the stronger one, but they were more than capable of handling the two younger children!","“Get out of the way!” Seventeen yelled angrily, his hand moving from his waist, drawing his sword and slashing at the cultivators.","Unfortunately, even though he was from a family of dark guards, rigorously trained, his skills were no match for cultivators in the mid-stage of cultivation. As soon as he moved, he was kicked away by one of them.","“Overestimating your own abilities!”","They were seething with anger! They had followed their master on an errand, and they had lost two men before even accomplishing anything. They had not expected the brat to be a Golden Core Cultivator. They were willing to accept the loss if they encountered a Golden Core Cultivator, but this little Second Stage Qi Refining Cultivator dared to attack them. What a fool!","“Pfffft!”","Seventeen was kicked hard, and he flew several metres, landing in the small forest by the roadside. A mouthful of blood spurted from his mouth. He felt his chest burning with pain, and he tried to stand with great effort, but he fell back down with a thud.","“Seventeen!” Yue’er exclaimed in alarm, her beautiful eyes glaring with anger, as if she had been provoked like a kitten, her whole body bristling.","“Come quietly with us!”","One of the cultivators sneered, reaching out to grab Yue’er, but the little girl leapt up and charged at him with breakneck speed.","The cultivator was taken aback and almost instinctively tried to back away, but then he felt a cold, murderous intent coming at him, and his neck went cold. He felt something slice across his throat, and the next moment, a stab of pain shot through his brain, his eyes opening wide in disbelief, and his entire body froze in place."]},{"number":4552,"title":"Chapter 4552: Plan","paragraphs":["Chapter 4552: Plan","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Bang!”","The cultivator fell straight over, and the other three cultivators who were about to seize Muchen were so shocked their faces changed. They almost instinctively retreated, thinking they had encountered another formidable Golden Core Cultivator.","However, as they retreated and glanced at the two children, they noticed no change in the spirit energy they emitted, and no aura of a Golden Core Cultivator. They let out a small sigh of relief, but remained cautious.","Muchen and Muyue stood back to back, guarding against any sneak attacks. Both held daggers in their hands and stared vigilantly at the cultivators. They might be able to exploit an unsuspecting opponent, but in a head-on fight, they would be no match.","In front, Hao’er was besieged by two Golden Core Cultivators. He was superior in martial arts and combat techniques, but he was still outnumbered by two battle-hardened Golden Core Cultivators, and couldn’t free his hands to help Muchen and Muyue behind him.","...","As he watched the three cultivators surround them and advance, he gritted his teeth and retreated while avoiding the attacks of the two Golden Core Cultivators, moving closer in their direction. Just then, as he saw the two Golden Core Cultivators slash at him with two sword qi, he could have blocked it, but instead, he leapt into the air and landed next to Muchen and Muyue, taking them with him to avoid the two attacks.","“Whoosh!”","“Whoosh!”","“Ah!”","“Sss!”","The three cultivators, preoccupied with the two children and their strange skills, didn’t notice the battle on their side. However, when they sensed the danger, the two sword qi had already struck them. Unable to dodge in time, they screamed, and two more fell. However, the remaining one had an entire arm severed by the sword qi.","“Arghhh! My arm!”","A bloody arm flew through the air, landing a few metres away by Seventeen’s side. The cultivator whose arm had been cut off also stumbled, due to blood loss and severe injuries, and fell unconscious.","Looking at the severed arm and smelling the blood that filled the air, Seventeen was stunned. He glanced again at the three young children and sighed in relief when he saw they were unharmed.","Seeing that several Foundation Cultivators had been injured, the remaining three Golden Core Cultivators were shaken. However, these were just children, yet they had caused so many of their people to be injured. For a moment, the two old men felt apprehensive.","“If we can subdue them today, that’s fine, but if we can’t, I’m afraid it’ll be trouble.”","“Go to Seventeen,” Hao’er said to the two younger ones, telling them to step back while he advanced.","Seeing this, the two elderly men struck again, their attacks becoming even more fierce and ruthless. However, they didn’t expect the young boy’s moves to be unpredictable, and his speed to be exceptional. Even though they did their best, they couldn’t subdue him. Moreover, as the battle continued, they sustained more wounds.","Perhaps seeing that even the two Golden Core Cultivators were unable to subdue him, the owner of Rejuvenating Hall, who had been watching, his eyes flickering slightly, glanced past the three fighting and focused on the two children behind them.","The boy was clearly concerned about the younger ones. If he captured them, he was confident the boy would surrender!","With a swift thought, he moved quietly..."]},{"number":4553,"title":"Chapter 4553: Seeking Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 4553: Seeking Death","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Even though it was a mountain road, there were still people coming and going, and as the battle continued and the surge of air currents, some cultivators passing by stopped and hid to watch from a distance.","To their surprise, the middle-aged man and the old men were fighting three children. This was a little surprising to them, but the three adults were all Golden Core Cultivators, a level they, as Qi condensation stage and Foundation Cultivators, couldn’t hope to reach. Therefore, they didn’t dare meddle in others’ affairs and just hid in the shadows, watching from afar.","“I recognise the middle-aged man—he’s the owner of Rejuvenating Hall. Why would they attack a few children?” One cultivator could not help but ask in a low voice.","“Children? Look at that child of around ten years old. He’s exuding the aura of a Golden Core, and he’s not losing to those two Golden Core Cultivators. On the contrary, he’s left them covered in wounds. This is no ordinary child’s ability!”","“You’re right. Not only is it something an ordinary child couldn’t do, even most adults would have a hard time injuring those two. I guess only some of the elders and the sect leader could do it?”","...","“More than that, I’m curious why the owner of Rejuvenating Hall would want to attack those kids?” Another cultivator spoke in a low voice, his eyes gleaming as he watched the scene.","None of the cultivators hiding to watch dared to intervene. They didn’t even dare to show themselves, and could only hide in the shadows and watch.","Over there, Hao’er’s sword twirled, and a sword flower struck out with a turn of the blade. The speed was lightning-fast. Almost instantly, the robe of one of the old men attacking him was shattered by the sword flower, and the man was shaken back by the sword energy. Before he could recover, he saw Hao’er approaching, and a palm strike landed directly on his chest.","“Bang!”","“Pfft!”","The palm contained the aura of a peak Golden Core Cultivator, heavily slamming down, knocking the old man back. As the old man flew out, fell to the ground, and coughed up a mouthful of blood, looking pale as paper. Hao’er pursed his lips, his gaze shifting, his cold stare fixed on the other old man, who attacked again.","Behind him, the owner of Rejuvenating Hall suddenly leapt forward, reaching for Muchen and Muyue.","Seeing this, Seventeen on the ground gritted his teeth, forcing himself to leap up despite excruciating internal injuries, blocking in front of the two younger ones, while shouting, “Hurry and go!”","“Get out of the way!”","The owner of Rejuvenating Hall, Leng Changmu, changed his grip to a slap, and directly slapped Seventeen away. As a loud thud sounded, Seventeen’s body flew out like a kite with a broken string.","“Seventeen!”","Muchen and Muyue exclaimed, quickly running towards where he had fallen. However, in doing so, they turned their backs to the owner of Rejuvenating Hall, giving him a perfect opportunity to strike.","Just as the owner of Rejuvenating Hall was about to pounce, Hao’er heard a noise behind him and turned around. He saw the owner of Rejuvenating Hall reaching for his younger brother and sister, and his face immediately changed. Killing intent welled up in his eyes.","“Seeking death!”","His cold voice contained killing intent and pressure as a flash of light emanated from him, instantly transforming into a ferocious snow-white giant wolf that pounced on the man."]},{"number":4554,"title":"Chapter 4554: Silver Wolf Appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 4554: Silver Wolf Appears","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Awoooooo!”","A wolf howl resounded, carrying the pressure of a Super Sacred Beast. The powerful howl resonated with imbued pressure, as if from ancient times, almost pierced the sky, shaking everyone’s eardrums and causing their legs to weaken, so much that they all fell to their knees.","The vast area was instantly covered and enveloped by a powerful pressure. The birds perched on the branches fell to the ground with a thud, unable to move. All around, with the sound of the wolf howl, there was instantly not a single sound. It was eerily quiet, so quiet that it made people’s hair stand on end.","The owner of Rejuvenating Hall, who had been heading towards the two children, was startled when he suddenly heard the howl of a wolf. He turned and looked, and the pressure of the beast’s gaze enveloped him, almost without giving him a chance to escape, and he fell to his knees with a thud.","It wasn’t that he wanted to kneel, but in the face of that powerful pressure, in the face of that terrifyingly powerful beast, he was so scared that his legs went weak and he couldn’t stand up.","...","“Ah!”","In the eerie silence, a miserable scream resounded. The shrill scream broke the silence for a moment, echoing in the sky and entering everyone’s ears.","However, no one made a sound, not a single noise. Even the sound of breathing seemed to have stopped. Whether it was the seriously injured Golden Core Cultivator who had been knocked back, or Elder Yuan who was standing there with his eyes wide open, or the passing cultivators who were hiding in the grass and trees watching from a distance, they were all looking in horror at the horrifying scene in front of them. They were so frightened that their hearts had almost stopped beating...","In front of them, a majestic giant silver wolf was standing on top of the owner of Rejuvenating Hall, and had bitten off and pulled out one of his arms from his shoulder, discarding it to the side. After that, the wolf raised its claw, which gleamed with a sharp light, and ripped out his left leg as well.","Blood gushed onto the ground, and the bloody and cruel scene left everyone stunned, not daring to make a sound. All they could hear was the miserable and tragic screams of the owner of Rejuvenating Hall.","The silver wolf licked the blood from the corner of its mouth and raised its sharp claws again. This time, it pressed down directly on the person under its claws. A bloodthirsty voice came from its mouth: “Biting your neck off directly is too kind to you. If I weren’t afraid of scaring my young masters, I would really want to empty your insides, tear you into pieces and throw you in the wilderness to feed the beasts.”","Its voice was low, and it said it with its head lowered, close to the ear of the owner of Rejuvenating Hall. Therefore, apart from Hao’er and a few others nearby, those in the distance could not hear a word it said.","The bloodthirsty voice and the cruel words scared the owner of Rejuvenating Hall so much that he could not say a word, not even a scream. He looked at the huge silver wolf, which had him under its paw, in horror, with despair and regret in his eyes.","He never imagined that the child was not only a formidable Golden Core Cultivator, but also had such a powerful sacred beast! As for whether it was a sacred beast or a Super Sacred Beast, to him, there was no difference...","Because he knew that he was dead! And he would die a miserable death...","Hao’er walked over step by step, stood next to the silver wolf, and stared with cold eyes and bloodthirsty murderous intent at the person who had been torn limb from limb and was lying on the ground dying. He said in a single sentence, “Dare to lay a hand on my younger siblings, die!”"]},{"number":4555,"title":"Chapter 4555: Close to Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 4555: Close to Death","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","As soon as his voice fell, he raised the long sword in his hand and stabbed it directly into his heart with a whoosh.","“Ugh!”","The owner of Rejuvenating Hall’s eyes were wide open in terror, and he couldn’t even scream. He just let out a muffled grunt, blood overflowing from his mouth, and his body twitching slightly, until, with a gulp, his body became stiff, and those eyes were still wide open in terror.","After watching the human at his feet die, the silver wolf turned around, its bloodthirsty gaze falling on the two elderly men with the medicinal pills. It took a step towards them. Anyone who dared to lay a hand on its young master must die!","Hao’er did not try to stop them, and he didn’t even look at the two elderly men behind him. He drew his long sword, wiped the blood off it, and then sheathed it before walking towards his younger siblings.","...","“It’s alright, don’t be afraid,” he said, patting their heads awkwardly in a low voice of reassurance.","Muchen and Muyue’s bodies, which had been tense, relaxed after they heard the sound of their Big Brother’s voice. It was false to say they weren’t afraid. After all, they were only four years old!","Even if they were learning to kill and face danger, they would still be scared, afraid, and at a loss.","Old Man Yuan’s body trembled as he watched the huge silver wolf walking towards him. There was despair in his eyes, as well as regret. If he had not followed, if he had not obeyed the order to attack the three children, perhaps he would not have to face this scene!","Thinking of the owner’s limbs being ripped off, his heart trembled. Withstanding the powerful pressure, he raised his hand, clenched his teeth, and slammed his palm against his temple.","Rather than die in pieces, he might as well end it himself!","With a loud thud, blood spurted from his mouth, and he fell backwards straight.","“Heh!”","The silver wolf snorted, exhaling two breaths between its nose, glanced at the dead old man, and then strode towards the other one.","“Don’t, don’t eat me, don’t eat me...”","The other elderly man was seriously injured. Even if he wanted to escape at this time, he was unable to do so under this powerful and terrifying pressure. He begged for mercy with a pale face, his eyes filled with fear and horror.","However, Hao’er would not allow him to live, and the silver wolf would never allow him to live either!","So, the silver wolf walked up to him, raised his paw, and several streams of air sliced his throat. Several claw marks as deep as the bone appeared, and blood gushed out. Amidst the screams, the old man fell over with his eyes wide open.","Muchen and Muyue watched this scene with pursed lips. They watched expressionlessly as the two adults died, took a deep breath, and then looked away as the silver wolf walked back. It was only then that the two children slowly came to their senses and remembered the seriously injured Seventeen by their side.","“Big Brother, Seventeen is very seriously injured and can’t walk anymore,” Muyue said with trepidation, looking at the pale-faced Seventeen, who was staring agape at the silver wolf in front of him.","He seemed to be shocked by the huge silver wolf in front of him as well. At this moment, his body was stiff and he was looking at it without moving, not even blinking once.","“Seventeen?”","Muchen called out to Seventeen and nudged Seventeen’s shoulder, who they were struggling to hold upright. To his dismay, all he saw was the man slump forward, then fall completely unconscious.","“Seventeen!”","“Seventeen!”","Muchen and Muyue were shocked, thinking he was dead, and let out a cry of alarm.","The silver wolf walked back, glanced at Seventeen, and said to them, “He’s seriously injured and his breathing is very weak. Although he’s not dead, he’s close.”"]},{"number":4556,"title":"Chapter 4556: Seeking a Doctor","paragraphs":["Chapter 4556: Seeking a Doctor","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Upon hearing this, Hao’er pursed his lips, glanced back at the corpses on the ground, then stepped forward and took the cosmos sacks off their bodies, storing them in his own space. He then took an artifact out of the space, threw it into the air, and said to the Silver Wolf, “Bring him up.” As he spoke, she pulled Muchen and Muyue up with him.","As soon as the Silver Wolf saw this, it lowered its head, grabbed onto Seventeen’s collar, and leapt up, sending him flying onto the flying artifact. At the same time, it shrunk its own huge body and stood guard.","The cultivators who were frozen in place further down the road let out a sigh of relief when they saw the flying artifact take off with the children and the wolf. Their legs gave way and they all sat down, looking at the mountain path covered in body parts and corpses like a battlefield. Their faces were pale and they couldn’t say a word for a long time.","On the other side, Hao’er and the others, who had boarded the flying artifact and disappeared into the clouds, were looking at the pale-faced Seventeen lying the deck. The atmosphere was a little tense.","“Big Brother, is Seventeen going to die?” Yue’er asked, her eyes red. “Yue’er doesn’t want Seventeen to die.”","...","Seventeen had been with them for so long, they had developed feelings for him, and they didn’t want him to just die.","“Big Brother, are there any medicinal pills in the space that Seventeen can take?” Muchen asked, also looking at Hao’er with hope.","Hao’er was looking for medicinal pills at the time. He discovered that the owner of Rejuvenating Hall also had medicinal pills for internal injuries in his cosmos sack. So, he took one out and put it in Seventeen’s mouth, while saying to them, “These are the medicinal pills from the person from Rejuvenating Hall. I’ve looked at them, and although they’re not as good as the ones Mother made, they still have a good effect on healing injuries. Let’s give him a try, and when we get to the next town, we’ll find a doctor to take a look at him.”","As they listened to his words, the two younger siblings looked at Seventeen and observed whether his breathing would gradually stabilise.","The flying artifact was flying through the air, and as it disappeared into the clouds, it did not attract the attention of the others. It was not until noon that they discovered that Seventeen’s breathing had gradually stabilised, and they let out a small sigh of relief.","“Big Brother, that medicinal pill also worked, so let’s give Seventeen another one!” Yue’er finally raised a smile. She thought, at least in this way, Seventeen will not die.","Hao’er shook his head, saying, “Every medicinal pill has some poison in it, especially those made on the mortal plane. Even if they are considered top-grade, they can’t be as pure as the medicinal pills of Mother. So, since his breathing has stabilised for now, let’s not use any more medicine. We’ll wait until we see a doctor and then make a plan.”","“But right now we don’t have a carriage, and Seventeen is unconscious, so how are we going to get into the city?” Muchen asked, frowning.","Hao’er thought for a moment and said, “Once we reach the outskirts of the next town, find a place to rest. Have the Silver Wolf guard you while I go into town to buy a carriage and bring you back in.”","“Why don’t I just carry him into town? That way, we won’t have to go through all this trouble,” the Silver Wolf said.","“That would be too conspicuous,” Hao’er shook his head, disagreeing.","Silver Wolf said, “I have already revealed myself before, and I guess it won’t take long for the news to spread. It’s only a town away, so the news will reach here soon. Besides, after those people die, I guess the forces behind them will also pursue responsibility. Coupled with my appearance, it is certain to attract the attention of all sides.”"]},{"number":4557,"title":"Chapter 4557: Entering the City Grandly","paragraphs":["Chapter 4557: Entering the City Grandly","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“So you mean, since we can’t keep a low profile, we might as well do things in a high profile manner?”","“Precisely,” the Silver Wolf replied. “You three are vulnerable. No protectors, yet striking appearances. You’re easy targets. By being bold, my presence alone will deter most. And those who dare challenge us will think twice.”","He paused, his gaze sweeping over them. “Besides, our goal is the sect, right? A low profile won’t get us answers. We need to make an impression. Claim you’re descendants from the upper world, here for experience, but stranded. Ask for their aid, promising generous rewards upon your return. It’s a more direct approach.”","Hearing this, Hao’er couldn’t help but ponder. He thought seriously about Silver Wolf’s idea. After a while, he said, ‘What you said is not without reason, but I’m just worried that we’ll attract our parents’ enemies before we find them. Then...”","“If that happens, there will be a lot of noise, and they may also know about you.” Silver Wolf pointed out, looking at the three of them. “This does carry some risk, but I don’t think there’s a better way.”","...","Hao’er was silent for a moment, looking at Muchen and Muyue, and asked, “What do you two think?”","The two younger ones glanced at each other and said, “We’ll listen to Big Brother.”","Upon hearing this, Hao’er paused for a moment, and then said, “Then let’s do what the Silver Wolf says! Because what he said also makes sense. Since he appeared today, it won’t be long before the various forces on the Floating Edge Immortal Island hear the news. We might as well make a grand entrance.”","“Alright!” The two younger ones nodded in agreement.","So, they went straight to the outskirts of the city, got off the flying artifact, and Silver Wolf, with Seventeen, walked towards the city gate while the three children followed.","“Ah! Wolf, wolf!”","“Sss! This, this is a fierce beast?”","“No, it’s not a fierce beast, this, this is a Sacred Beast!”","“This is a Super Sacred Beast that has been contracted!”","“Sss, this is no ordinary spirit beast, this is the king of wolves, the Silver Wolf! And it’s a Super Sacred Beast?”","No one on Floating Edge Immortal Island had ever seen a Super Sacred Beast before, so when they saw such a huge wolf appear before their eyes, they all concluded, stepped back, looked on in awe and fear, and even the city guards did not dare to stop them, so they let them go straight in.","There was no obstruction along the way. After Hao’er asked a person which was the best medical clinic in the city, he followed the directions and went to the Mo Family Medical Hall.","News of the giant silver wolf spread like wildfire. As they entered the city, people from all the families and clans in the city, and all the forces, heard that a huge silver wolf had entered the city, and even the City Lord was alerted.","“I heard that a huge wolf entered the city? And it’s not a fierce beast, but a Super Sacred Beast? Is this true?” An elder from one of the clans was alerted and hurriedly came out to inquire.","“It’s true, Father. All the powers in the city have heard the news that a huge silver wolf several metres tall has entered the city with a black-robed man on its back, accompanied by three children with very attractive appearances. They have already gone to the Mo Family Medical Hall in the city,” the middle-aged man hurriedly said to his father.","There was a pause, and he added, “Father, I’m going to go and have a look. Shall I tell you more when I get back?’"]},{"number":4558,"title":"Chapter 4558: Turmoil","paragraphs":["Chapter 4558: Turmoil","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“What are you talking about? I’ll accompany you to investigate,” the old man said, exiting the room. “What classification of spirit beast is this silver wolf? Have you not heard the reports? Surely, they are accompanied by powerful individuals, beyond those three children?”","The middle-aged man followed closely, saying, “Father, you are aware as I am of the scarcity of high-level spirit beasts in this region. Even if they existed, I doubt many could identify the wolf’s classification. However, the aura and pressure emanating from it were highly intimidating, leading me to believe it is no ordinary spirit beast.”","Both father and son hurriedly walked out while they were talking. At the same time, the other families in the city were doing the same thing. The Old Predecessors of each family were all alarmed and planned to go and see for themselves what was going on.","Even the City Lord could not care about anything else and went in person to Mo Family Medical Hall.","By this time, the Medical Hall’s entrance was thronged with onlookers, leaving only Hao’er, a few others, and the shrunken Silver Wolf within. Those outside could not penetrate the crowd.","...","“Doctor, please examine his injuries,” Hao’er requested, his gaze fixed on the unconscious Seventeen.","The commotion drew out the Old Patriarch of the Mo Family. Even the seasoned Old Patriarch Mo, experiencing a tremor at the sight of the Silver Wolf, examined Seventeen with meticulous care.","After a prolonged examination, he announced, “The injuries have affected the five internal organs and six viscera. It seems that he has taken medicinal pills to treat internal injuries, but they can only stabilise the injuries in the body, but not heal them. Even if I use medicine to make him drink it for ten or more days, I’m afraid he will be useless after he recovers.’.”","“Useless?” Muchen frowned. “You cannot heal him?”","Old Patriarch Mo shook his head. “He was injured by a Golden Core cultivator, with resulting damage to his internal organs. Ordinary medicine is insufficient. Unless...” He paused, sighing.","“Unless what?” Yue’er asked.","Old Patriarch Mo glanced at Yue’er, then Hao’er. “Unless there is a miraculous remedy, otherwise, even if he recovers from his injuries, he will still have the root cause and he will be a useless person.”","Hao’er’s eyes flickered. Originally, he was thinking that if the medicinal pills from Rejuvenating Hall would improve Seventeen’s condition, then he would use the medicinal pills from Rejuvenating Hall. After all, he no longer had many of the medicinal pills his Mother gave him to treat internal injuries. If he still couldn’t find a way back, and if something happened to Muchen and Muyue, without the medicinal pills nearby just in case, he wouldn’t know what to do if something were to happen.","However, after listening to the Doctor, he knew that if he wanted to save Seventeen, it seemed that he had no choice but to use his mother’s medicinal pills.","“Doctor, we need to recuperate here for a few days. Do you have any place we can rent to recuperate?” Hao’er asked directly.","Old Patriarch Mo, momentarily taken aback, nodded. “There is a small courtyard in the rear, but...” He glanced at the Silver Wolf, concern evident.","“Rest assured, it will harm no one,” Hao’er said, understanding his apprehension. “Provided no one harbours ill intent, it will remain docile. You need not fear it causing trouble.”","Old Patriarch Mo nodded. “Very well. I will show you to the courtyard and have someone prepare medicine.”"]},{"number":4559,"title":"Chapter 4559: Scruples","paragraphs":["Chapter 4559: Scruples","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Elder Mo instructed his staff to carry Seventeen to a room in the small courtyard at the back, and prescribed medicines for them to boil. He then had his staff clear the curious onlookers who had gathered at the medical center’s entrance. However, before he could address the other children and individuals, he was informed that the City Lord, along with the Patriarchs and power holders of various forces in the city, had arrived at the medical center.","“Old Patriarch, Old Predecessor, the City Lord has arrived and is waiting outside. The Patriarchs and Old Ancestors of the various clans in the city have also come,” the Medical Hall apprentice reported, his face showing clear nervousness.","Beside him, a middle-aged man, hearing this, looked at Elder Mo and said, “Father, should I go out and see what they want?”","“I’ll go with you,” Elder Mo sighed lightly. “I suspect they want to see the children.”","The two of them walked outside, and upon reaching the outer room, they found it packed with people, some standing, some sitting. Despite a “closed for rest” sign being posted due to the sudden arrival of the children and the imposing silver wolf, it hadn’t deterred the city’s power holders from gathering at the door.","...","“Elder Mo,” the City Lord greeted with a smile, stepping forward.","“City Lord,” Elder Mo bowed, then gestured to the others, “And to all of you! Your presence truly honors my humble medical hall!”","“Ha ha, Elder Mo is being modest,” one of the old men chuckled. “We heard there are some extraordinary individuals in the city, accompanied by a rare silver wolf, and we were curious to see what was happening.”","“Elder Sun, I’m afraid that won’t be possible,” Elder Mo said softly. “Those individuals are currently resting in our backyard to recover from their injuries, and they have expressly stated they do not wish to be disturbed, so...”","Upon hearing this, the people exchanged glances. One of them inquired, “I wonder, Elder Mo, what grade of spirit beast is that silver wolf? Did they mention which clan it belongs to? Or how they arrived here?”","“Ha ha, I run a medical center, and my focus is on healing the sick and injured, not inquiring about such matters! I truly don’t know the answers to your questions,” Elder Mo replied, waving his hand.","“Since they’re in your backyard, surely we could take a quick look, right?” Another person tentatively suggested.","“It’s not that I wish to prevent you,” Elder Mo said, looking at them, “but I’m concerned for your safety! That silver wolf is guarding the courtyard, and one of the young masters has warned that while the wolf won’t harm anyone who doesn’t provoke it, it will certainly react if disturbed.”","This warning made some of those who had been eager to explore hesitate.","“As the host here, representing the City Lord’s Manor, I would like to invite them to stay at the manor to recuperate, fulfilling my duty as their host,” the City Lord said, smiling at Elder Mo. “Elder Mo, could you please have someone relay my invitation and ask for their opinion?”","“This...”","Elder Mo paused, then said, “Very well! City Lord, please wait a moment, and I’ll ask them personally.” With that, he instructed his son to entertain the guests and went to the backyard.","In the backyard, upon hearing Elder Mo’s words, Hao’er looked at him and asked, “Are we causing you trouble by staying here?”","“Ha ha, not at all. It’s just that everyone is curious about you and your companions, so...”","Nodding, Hao’er said, “I understand. I’ll go out and speak with them.” As soon as he finished speaking, he led the silver wolf towards the front."]},{"number":4560,"title":"Chapter 4560: From the Upper Realm","paragraphs":["Chapter 4560: From the Upper Realm","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","As the City Lord and the others waited outside, they were surprised when a small young man, clad in a black robe, emerged. His aura revealed the strength of a Golden Core cultivator.","While this level of power might not have been astonishing to the assembled power holders, who themselves possessed similar cultivation, its presence in a ten-year-old child was undeniably shocking.","It seemed improbable. Even with exceptional talent, reaching Golden Core cultivation at such a young age was considered nearly impossible. Yet, the child before them displayed this very strength, compelling their attention and astonishment.","Furthermore, the boy’s every movement exuded an undeniable air of nobility, suggesting an extraordinary background. His features were striking, though his demeanor was notably cold.","When they noticed the snow-white silver wolf beside him, a collective gasp swept through the group, and several people stood abruptly.","...","“This, this is a divine beast? No, it’s a Super Sacred Beast!” the City Lord exclaimed, his voice trembling slightly as the silver wolf glanced in his direction.","Hao’er surveyed them, his small face devoid of emotion. Despite his young age, he displayed no hint of timidity before these influential figures. Instead, he maintained an indifferent and composed demeanor, regarding them with the gaze of a superior.","“You’re looking for me?” Hao’er inquired coldly, his eyes scanning the group.","The City Lord, having regained his composure, quickly adopted a respectful stance, bowing slightly as he spoke. “I am the City Lord of this city. I would like to invite you and your companions to the City Lord’s Manor to recuperate, fulfilling my duties as your host. I wonder what your thoughts are on this?”","Hao’er paused briefly, then replied, “My guard is injured and unable to move at the moment. We will accept your invitation in a few days, once he has recovered sufficiently.”","This decision differed from their initial plans. However, the silver wolf had suggested that, having made a high-profile appearance, they should await contact from the sect they intended to visit. As news spread, the sect would likely send representatives, making it more convenient to proceed.","The City Lord, who hadn’t anticipated such an acceptance, was delighted. “Excellent, excellent! I will arrange a suitable courtyard at the manor to await your arrival.”","Turning to Elder Mo, he added, “Elder Mo, please provide the best possible medicine for the injured guard, ensuring his swift recovery.”","“Please rest assured, City Lord,” Elder Mo replied with a nod.","As the others watched Hao’er and the silver wolf return inside, they turned to the City Lord. “City Lord, that young man is clearly no ordinary individual. I wonder from what noble lineage he’s from.”","“That silver wolf is a Super Sacred Beast, far surpassing the strength of a divine beast. Such beings are not found in our region. I suspect they are from the Upper Realm!” an old man remarked, stroking his beard thoughtfully.","The others remained silent, their minds echoing the same sentiment. Super Sacred Beasts were legendary, and they were certain that none existed on Floating Edge Immortal Island."]},{"number":4561,"title":"Chapter 4561: Recovery","paragraphs":["Chapter 4561: Recovery","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Let’s return first. We shouldn’t disturb them here. Elder Mo’s establishment is a place of business, and it’s not appropriate for us to linger,” the City Lord stated, addressing the others. “Please join me at the City Lord’s Manor for a cup of tea.”","The crowd exchanged glances and readily agreed, following him towards the City Lord’s Manor.","As they departed, the medical center gradually emptied. Elder Mo sighed softly, instructed his son to oversee matters, and then headed to the back courtyard.","The small courtyard, originally Elder Mo’s private space for medicinal research, now housed the newcomers. They had requested the Mo Family Medical Hall staff to refrain from entering, ensuring a quiet atmosphere.","At this time, Silver Wolf stood guard outside, while the three children were inside the room, tending to Seventeen, who lay on the bed. Hao’er administered a medicinal pill and explained to Muchen and Muyue, “After feeding these pills that treat internal injuries to Seventeen, there are only two left.”","...","Hearing this, the younger children understood why their older brother hadn’t immediately given Seventeen the pills their mother had prepared. The supply was nearly exhausted.","“Big Brother, we’ll be careful and won’t get hurt,” Muyue assured him earnestly, wanting to alleviate his worries.","“Yes, we won’t let ourselves get hurt. Don’t worry, Big Brother. Perhaps we’ll be able to see Father and Mother soon, and then Mother can give us more pills for protection,” Muchen added.","Hao’er nodded and said, “Once Seventeen’s injuries have improved, we’ll stay at the City Lord’s Manor for a few days. We won’t have to travel all the way to that sect. I believe they’ll hear the news and send representatives. We can then accompany them.”","He provided the younger children with instructions and then encouraged them to rest.","Their high-profile arrival in the city had created quite a stir. As Silver Wolf and Hao’er had anticipated, the Floating Edge Immortal Sect heard the news, and the Patriarch, accompanied by two elders and two peak masters, arrived in person.","Three days later, in the medical hall, Elder Mo was examining Seventeen’s pulse. He was surprised by what he felt, his eyes widening slightly. He conducted another careful examination and then looked at Hao’er with a complex expression.","“Did you give him any medicinal pills?” Elder Mo asked.","Hao’er glanced at him and replied, “Yes, a pill for internal injuries. How are his injuries now?”","“The pill you gave him must be exceptionally precious. He has already recovered sixty to seventy percent within three days, despite his severe injuries. It’s truly remarkable,” Elder Mo said, his voice filled with awe.","He looked at the group and added, “With such divine pills, he would have recovered in a few more days even without my prescriptions. He can now get out of bed and walk around.”","In just three days, Seventeen’s injuries had healed to such an extent. Had Elder Mo not personally examined him, he would have found it unbelievable.","This experience reinforced his belief that they were from the Upper Realm. Only such a place could produce such potent medicinal pills, capable of saving a life with a single dose."]},{"number":4562,"title":"Chapter 4562: Enquiring","paragraphs":["Chapter 4562: Enquiring","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“In that case, let’s go to the City Lord’s Manor today,” Hao’er said, looking at Elder Mo. “I’ve troubled you here for the past few days.” He then produced some gold coins. “This is for the medical expenses and the cost of our stay.”","Elder Mo accepted the gold coins without protest. “Then I’ll send someone to the City Lord’s Manor to inform them and request a carriage.”","“Good, thank you,” Hao’er replied, watching him leave. He then turned to Seventeen. “We’ll stay at the City Lord’s Manor for a few days, and you can focus on your recovery.”","“Young Master, aren’t we in a hurry? Seventeen has already delayed us considerably. If we delay further...”","“There’s no need to rush,” Hao’er interrupted. “Just do as I say. Right now, you should focus solely on recuperating.”","...","“Yes,” Seventeen replied, expressing his gratitude. “Many thanks to the three Masters for the precious medicinal pill.”","“Seventeen, it’s good that you’re alright. You’re still going to be following us, so don’t die on us so easily,” Yue’er said with a smile, clapping her hands. “How about this! Big Brother, let’s teach Seventeen an escape technique! That way, even if he can’t defeat his opponents, he can still escape.”","Seventeen quickly shook his head. “There’s no need to! I’m here to protect the three Masters. If there’s any danger, how can I escape alone? I won’t learn that technique!”","Having pledged his loyalty, he considered his own life to be at their disposal. Learning an escape technique would be a betrayal of that commitment.","Hao’er looked at him and said, “We’ll discuss that later. Focus on your recovery for now.”","Upon receiving word from the Mo family, the City Lord’s Manor dispatched people and carriages to the medical center to escort them to the manor, where they were given a prepared courtyard.","Following the City Lord’s earlier instructions, the manor staff, despite their curiosity, refrained from disturbing them.","After two days at the City Lord’s Manor, the City Lord, under the guise of delivering medicinal herbs, visited the courtyard. “Young Masters, you’ve been here for two days, and we still don’t know how to address you.”","“Our surname is Xuanyuan,” Hao’er replied.","“Xuanyuan? Xuanyuan is a prominent ancient surname, not found on Floating Edge Immortal Island. Young Master Xuanyuan, are you from the Upper Realm?” the City Lord asked cautiously.","“Indeed,” Hao’er confirmed. “We are from the Upper Realm.”","Despite his suspicions, the City Lord was excited to hear it confirmed. He bowed slightly, his face beaming, and asked, “Young Master Xuanyuan, we rarely have the opportunity to learn about the Upper Realm. Would you be willing to share some information?”","“What do you wish to know?” Hao’er asked.","The City Lord, overjoyed, immediately inquired, “Is the Upper Realm filled with powerful individuals with Golden Core cultivation or higher? Are spirit beasts commonplace? Are there countless strong individuals? How can someone like us ascend to the Upper Realm?”","Hao’er glanced at him and said, “Your Floating Edge Immortal Island is located in a remote corner of the mortal realm, lacking spirit energy and hindering cultivation. Few strong individuals emerge from here. The Upper Realm comprises numerous large and small heavenly territories, with both strong and weak individuals, and a variety of fierce and spirit beasts. As for ascension, don’t you have clans that send people down periodically?”"]},{"number":4563,"title":"Chapter 4563: Arrive","paragraphs":["Chapter 4563: Arrive","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Yes, there are, but they only bring up children. For people like us, they won’t let us go to the Upper Realm,” the City Lord said, bowing respectfully. “I would like to ask Young Master Xuanyuan if you can enlighten me on how to reach the Upper Realm?”","“Great strength can break through the void and allow travel. Alternatively, there are teleportation arrays. Or, you can cultivate until you reach a level where the Upper Realm accepts you. However...” Hao’er paused, looking at him. “Your strength might make you a City Lord here, but in the Upper Realm, you’d be obliterated with a snap of a finger if you offended a powerful individual. Moreover, not just the City Lord, but even the guards, are too weak by Upper Realm standards. Even those weaker than you might be from influential families with powerful backing. Therefore, I don’t recommend you going to the Upper Realm.”","The City Lord was stunned and remained silent for a while.","Having been a City Lord for so long, he understood that things weren’t simple, but he still felt a sense of disappointment.","Hao’er changed the subject. “We’re waiting for the sect’s people to come here. If they arrive, bring them to us.”","...","“Young Master is waiting for the sect’s people?” the City Lord asked, surprised.","“Yes,” Hao’er nodded, offering no further explanation.","“Alright, I understand. If they arrive, I’ll bring them to see you,” the City Lord said, bowing before departing.","Ten days passed. Muchen and Muyue, having finished their practice in the courtyard, sat in silence, their hands covering their chests where their hearts beat erratically. They were accustomed to the symptoms, enduring them until they subsided, but the possibility that it was connected to their parents caused them worry.","“Brother, do you think Father and Mother are alright?” Muyue asked softly.","“They should be. Big Brother said they’re very strong,” Muchen replied.","Silver Wolf, who had been resting in the courtyard, stood up and stretched. Walking over to the children, he said, “They’ll be fine. Your parents are very strong; no one can harm them. Besides, if something had happened, it wouldn’t have lasted this long.”","He glanced at them. “Because of your blood ties, the blood curse hasn’t been broken yet. But don’t worry, they’ll find a way to help you when you meet.”","“My Big Brother said we have powerful contracted beasts inside us,” Muyue said, looking at Silver Wolf. “Are they more powerful than you?”","Silver Wolf scoffed. “Not as powerful as me. I am the King of Wolves, the Silver Wolf, and I am not inferior to the Ancient Divine Beasts in combat or speed.”","He paused, muttering to himself. “Ancient Divine Beast,” he sighed. All that he had lost was to this name. But in terms of combat prowess, he definitely wouldn’t say that he was inferior to that Qilin or Nine-tailed Fox.","While the children were chatting with Silver Wolf, a group of travelers arrived at the City Lord’s Manor, looking travel-worn. One of them approached the door and knocked."]},{"number":4564,"title":"Chapter 4564: Meeting","paragraphs":["Chapter 4564: Meeting","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“How many people are there?” The guard asked, immediately aware of the extraordinary aura emanating from the group.","The person in the lead reached out for his waist token and presented it. The guard examined it, bowed respectfully, and opened the gate, inviting them in. He then whispered to another guard, instructing him to deliver a message inside.","The City Lord was walking towards the courtyard, wondering if the sect’s people, whom Young Master Xuanyuan had mentioned, would actually arrive after so many days.","As he pondered, he saw the housekeeper hurrying towards him. “What’s wrong? Why the panic?” he asked.","“Master, master, the Immortal Sect, the Immortal Sect’s people are here,” the butler said, his breath slightly labored.","...","The City Lord’s expression brightened. “Have tea prepared immediately. I’ll personally welcome them,” he said, adjusting his robes and walking forward.","Halfway there, he encountered the group. Upon seeing them, he bowed and greeted, “I didn’t expect it to be the Sect Master himself. I’m truly honored. Please come inside.”","“Heh heh, City Lord Gong, it’s a pleasure,” the Sect Master replied, returning the salute and walking with him.","Upon reaching the hall and settling down, the Sect Master introduced his companions. “These are the Second Elder and the Third Elder, and these are our sect’s Peak Masters. We rushed here after hearing the rumors. We need to confirm if they are true.”","“They are indeed true,” the City Lord confirmed. “The young masters are currently staying at my manor, accompanied by a Super Sacred Beast level Silver Wolf.”","“Oh? It’s really true? Then they must be from the upper realm,” the Sect Master said, his eyes filled with surprise. “Do you know how they arrived here? And from where in the Upper Realm?”","“I do not. How about I have them come here and speak for themselves?” the City Lord suggested, about to call the butler.","The Sect Master paused, looking at the elders. “Perhaps we should meet them instead. City Lord, would you please introduce us?”","The City Lord agreed. “Very well, gentlemen, this way please.”","Hao’er was guiding Muchen and Muyue in their cultivation in the courtyard. Seventeen stood beside him, and Silver Wolf watched from the side. Sensing their approach, Silver Wolf turned and snorted.","Hao’er and the others stopped and looked towards the entrance.","Moments later, the City Lord led the group to the courtyard entrance. “Young Master Xuanyuan, the sect’s Sect Master, the two Elders, and the two Peak Masters are here.”","“Please come in,” Seventeen said, welcoming them.","The sect members entered the courtyard, their gaze immediately drawn to the Silver Wolf. They were shocked to see the rumors of a Super Sacred Beast confirmed.","The Silver Wolf, though seemingly relaxed, exuded an aura that commanded respect.","They quickly averted their gaze and looked at the three children, surprised by their striking appearances and noble bearing, which clearly indicated extraordinary origins."]},{"number":4565,"title":"Chapter 4565: Eventually","paragraphs":["Chapter 4565: Eventually","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","After glancing at the group, Hao’er turned to the City Lord. “City Lord, I need to speak with them privately.”","“Very well. I’ll have tea brought to you.” The City Lord replied, excusing himself.","“Young Master’s surname is Xuanyuan?”","Following introductions, the Sect Master looked at Hao’er, then at the twins, his mind filled with wonder.","How could such young children be accompanied by a guard of such unremarkable strength?","...","The silver wolf, however, was clearly a formidable presence. What kind of family would send these children to the Lower Realm?","“Indeed,” Hao’er replied, adding, “We are from the Upper Realm.”","The sect members exchanged glances, unsurprised, as they had already suspected as much. However, it was clear that Hao’er had anticipated their arrival.","“Since you are from the Upper Realm, how did you arrive here? And what do you wish to discuss?” the Sect Master asked.","“We heard that your sect can facilitate travel to the Upper Realm. We seek your assistance in returning,” Hao’er said, adding, “Your help will be generously rewarded.”","The sect members exchanged puzzled looks. “If you are from the Upper Realm and arrived here, surely you have a way to return. Why do you need our help?” An elder asked.","“We arrived due to an accident and lost contact with our families. We are currently unable to return on our own,” Hao’er explained.","“If that’s the case, which Upper Realm family are you from? Perhaps we can notify them,” the Sect Master suggested, smiling wryly. “I must be frank: the Immortal Envoys who come to select individuals for the Upper Realm decide who and what they bring. Even as Sect Master, I have no influence.”","Hao’er frowned, pausing in thought. This presented a problem.","“In that case, we will accompany you to the sect and wait. We will speak with the Immortal Envoy when he arrives,” Silver Wolf said, standing and stretching. He walked towards the sect members, who instinctively leaned back. He looked down at them. “My little masters’ parents are not to be mentioned lightly. Your assistance now will be rewarded in the future.”","The sect members exchanged thoughtful glances and agreed. “Very well. You will return with us to the sect.”","They reasoned that assisting them could only bring good fortune. Moreover, Hao’er’s exceptional cultivation at such a young age suggested his parents were even more powerful.","They prepared to depart, but the City Lord arrived, his expression grave. “Young Master Xuanyuan, nearly a hundred cultivators have arrived, claiming to be from Rejuvenating Hall. They demand an explanation.”"]},{"number":4566,"title":"Chapter 4566: Response","paragraphs":["Chapter 4566: Response","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The City Lord, concerned that they might not recognize the force, explained, “I know of Rejuvenating Hall. It’s a hall specializing in herbs and medicinal pills. They’re from the Ruan Family in South Ridge, and they’re very powerful.”","“From the South Ridge’s Ruan family?” The Sect Master frowned, looking at Hao’er and his companions. “Do you have issues with them?”","“Some time ago, I killed the owner of Rejuvenating Hall and some of their people,” Hao’er stated, his expression undisturbed.","“I didn’t expect they’d dare come looking,” Silver Wolf snorted. “I’ll go deal with them.” He stepped outside.","An elder, observing the calm expressions of the children and Seventeen, could not help but asked, “How did you come into conflict with them?”","...","Yue’er tilted her head, smiling sweetly. “They were bad people. They tried to capture us, so Big Brother killed them~”","The sect members were taken aback, understanding the situation.","“There are hundreds of people who are armed. You should stay inside. We’ll go see what’s happening.” The Sect Master said, leading the others outside.","However, Hao’er and his group followed them.","Outside the City Lord’s Manor, hundreds of cultivators surrounded the area, while onlookers gathered further back.","“Hand over the one who killed my son!” a shadowy voice demanded, filled with killing intent and amplified by spiritual energy.","“Hand them over! Hand them over!” The cultivators shouted, brandishing their swords.","“Is City Lord going to openly defy the South Ridge’s Ruan Family?” The old man asked aggressively as he stared furiosly at the closed gates.","“South Ridge’s Ruan Family? Hmph!”","A low, majestic voice with a bloodthirsty aura echoed. Suddenly, a silver wolf stood on the City Lord’s Manor wall, looking down at them. “Do you wish to die without a corpse? Or have your clan exterminated? Or will you turn around and leave now?”","“Hiss! A divine beast!”","“No, it’s a Super Sacred Beast!”","“The rumors are true!”","The Ruan Family members gasped, shocked. Some were excited, while others were cautious, scanning their surroundings.","The Ruan Family Patriarch, holding a black walking stick, looked at the silver wolf, his eyes filled with predatory intent.","Ten days ago, he learned of his third son’s death, reportedly torn apart by a divine beast.","He had ordered a thorough investigation, gathering information about the children, trying to find out about their origins and it seemed that there was only a weak guard travelling alongside and yes, there was also the matter of a silver wolf. After deep contemplation, he decided to come personally."]},{"number":4567,"title":"Chapter 4567: Life and Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 4567: Life and Death","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Three children, a guard with unremarkable strength, and a Super Sacred Beast as their contracted companion. After careful consideration, the Ruan Family Patriarch decided to bring his men and rush forward personally.","If he could capture the children, wouldn’t he be able to deal with that divine beast. If he could transfer the contract, then...","The moemnt such a thought stirred in his heart, his blood surged. The South Ridge’s Ruan Family were presented with such an opportunity. Their family had always been seeking wealth and power, so why not take this risk, even if it meant sacrificing some. What if they succeeded?","The City Lord’s Manor gates opened, and the sect members emerged. The Sect Master looked at the Ruan Family Patriarch and said, “It’s been a long time, Patriarch Ruan.”","“Heh, I didn’t expect you to be here,” The Patriarch replied, glancing at the Sect Master. “If you don’t want to become enemies of the South Ridge’s Ruan Family, you’d best leave.”","...","He scanned the group, including the City Lord and the three children, Hao’er, Muchen and Muyue.","Seeing the children, he decided capturing them would be more effective than confronting the silver wolf. Then, the silver wolf would have to comply.","He signaled to his men, who had spread out, to act accordingly.","“Patriarch Ruan, they are our honored guests. I’d advise you to withdraw your family. Otherwise, a conflict will result in significant losses,” the Sect Master reminded him, hoping to avoid bloodshed.","“They killed a member of my family. We cannot let this go,” the patriarch said grimly, striking his walking stick on the ground. This was a prearranged signal. His men, hidden among the cultivators, rushed towards the children.","The Sect Master and his group prepared to intervene, but Hao’er commanded, “Silver Wolf!”","Instantly, Silver Wolf, who had been on the wall, pounced, biting the necks of those who had charged forward.","Blood sprayed, and the scent of death filled the air. The suddenness of the attack shocked the sect members. Silver Wolf’s speed was so great they couldn’t react.","“Arghhhhhh!”","“Hiss! Arghhh!”","The cultivators, all Golden Core cultivators, screamed as they were killed. Some were bitten, others were crushed by Silver Wolf’s claws.","Hao’er stepped forward, standing beside Silver Wolf. “Do you want to die? Or live?” he asked the Ruan Family Patriarch coldly.","Threatened by a ten-year-old, the Patriarch was speechless. He stared at the corpses, their eyes still open, and at the surrounding crowd. He gritted his teeth and shouted, “Capture him! Kill him if necessary! And those two little ones, whoever captures one and will receive 10,000 gold coins!”"]},{"number":4568,"title":"Chapter 4568: Don’t Kill Me","paragraphs":["Chapter 4568: Don’t Kill Me","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Driven by the promise of substantial rewards, the cultivators who had initially hesitated now rushed forward, hoping to seize the opportunity to capture the children amidst the chaos.","Upon hearing this, Hao’er’s expression turned icy. “Kill them all! Leave no one alive!” He commanded Silver Wolf.","“Awooooo!”","Silver Wolf lifted its head and unleashed a ferocious howl. The overwhelming pressure of a Super Sacred Beast emanated from its body, causing those who had charged forward to freeze. Some collapsed to their knees, while others stood motionless, unable to take a single step further.","A powerful pressure filled the air, an irresistible force for both the sect members and the Ruan family pressed upon them.","...","Even the Ruan Family Patriarch was paralyzed by the pressure, his eyes wide with horror, his lips trembling, and his face contorted with fear.","He finally understood the gruesome fate of his son.","Despite being a Nascent Soul cultivator, he was utterly powerless against such immense pressure.","“Arghhhhh!”","With each pounce, swipe of its claws, and bite, Silver Wolf inflicted gruesome deaths upon the immobilized cultivators. Their corpses littered the ground, and the air was thick with the stench of blood.","The onlookers gasped, horrified by the carnage. The sight of the slashed throats and severed necks, the blood staining the ground like crimson blossoms, left them breathless with shock.","The Ruan Family Patriarch stared in disbelief, overwhelmed by fear and regret. He struggled to breathe, his grip on his walking stick trembling.","The sect members were equally stunned. They remained silent, intimidated by Hao’er’s cold demeanor and the murderous glint in his eyes.","He had made his intentions clear. They had witnessed the terrifying power of the Super Sacred Beast.","Within a short time, all the Ruan Family cultivators lay dead before the City Lord’s Manor, leaving only the Patriarch standing.","However, no one expected him to survive, as the majestic silver wolf stood before him.","“How do you wish to die?” Silver Wolf mocked, its eyes fixed on the terrified old man. “Or perhaps you’d prefer the same fate as your son? To experience the final moments as he did?”","Silver Wolf stomped him to the ground, its claws gleaming with deadly intent. The Patriarch screamed in terror as he looked at the massive silver wolf before him with horrified eyes.","“No! Don’t kill me! I’ll give you the entire Ruan family! Don’t... ahhhhhhhh!” His plea was cut short as he let out a bloodcurdling scream."]},{"number":4569,"title":"Chapter 4569: Can’t Survive","paragraphs":["Chapter 4569: Can’t Survive","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","With his arm torn off, the Ruan family Patriarch’s screams were cut short as a leg was also severed. His body twitched violently, unable to even utter a whimper.","The wolf paw pressed down on his chest, ensuring he wouldn’t escape death. As the old man gasped, a ball of light, his Nascent Soul, attempted to flee.","“Trying to escape? Hmph!”","Silver Wolf lunged, devouring the Nascent Soul in one gulp.","The Immortal Sect members swallowed hard, their pale faces betraying their shock.","Silver Wolf turned to the City Lord. “Have your men gather everything from the bodies and give it to my master.”","“Yes, yes...!” The City Lord stammered, wiping his brow. He felt the oppressive pressure lift and quickly ordered his men to collect the items, handing them to Hao’er.","Under Silver Wolf’s watchful gaze, no one dared to hesitate. After the items were given to Hao’er, the City Lord had the bodies removed.","Hao’er took two cosmos sacks and handed them to the City Lord. “Consider the contents of these sacks as thanks for your hospitality.”","The City Lord, about to decline, saw Hao’er’s gaze and quickly accepted. “Thank you, Young Master.”","“Let’s go,” Hao’er said to the sect members. “Do you travel by sword or flying artifact?”","“By sword,” the Sect Master replied. “We can bring you along on our sword.”","“Then we’ll trouble you,” Hao’er said. He didn’t want to fly himself, and this way, he would save energy as well.","He glanced at Silver Wolf, who transformed into a ray of light and entered his body.","The sect members breathed a sigh of relief and took to the sky, heading towards their sect.","The bloody scene had deterred anyone from causing trouble. The overwhelming power of Silver Wolf had left them terrified.","The children arrived at the sect and settled in, awaiting the arrival of the Upper Realm envoys.","Meanwhile, Xuanyuan Mo Ze continued to endure his heavenly lightning tribulation. A lightning strike each day caused him immense pain and injury.","On the mountain, Feng Jiu watched Xuanyuan Mo Ze, his body covered in wounds. Her heart ached.","“He won’t survive this....” Feng Jiu murmured to herself, her voice hoarse.","She turned to Old Man Tianji. “He’s going to die, isn’t he? That’s why you’re here?”","Old Man Tianji remained silent, sighing softly.","Feng Jiu gritted her teeth. “I won’t let him die! If he can’t stop the tribulation, I’ll take the rest of the lightning for him!”"]},{"number":4570,"title":"Chapter 4570: Scared","paragraphs":["Chapter 4570: Scared","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Before Feng Jiuuld react or defend herself, Old Man Tianji struck her on the back, immobilizing her. “I’ve already told you, his tribulation can only be oveme by him, himself. No one can help.”","Feng Jiu was paralyzed. Her anxiety and worry quickly turned to anger. “What are you doing! Release me! Quickly!”","Old Man Tianji glanced at the churning clouds and sighed. “Today is the forty-ninth day, the final lightning tribulation.” He looked at Xuanyuan Mo Ze’s ravaged body, his eyes filled with regret.","Feng Jiu’s heart sank. Her voice was strained. “What do you mean? Are you saying he won’t survive today?”","As if in response, a low rumble of thunder echoed. She looked up and noticed that, unlike yesterday, the lightning had not yet struck. The clouds were churning more violently than ever.","Panic surged through her. “Release me! Now!” She tried her best to break free, using her spiritual energy to oveme the immobilization without any regard.","“Look .” Old Man Tianji said, pointing towards Xuanyuan Mo Ze as he gave a wry smile.","When Feng Jiu’s gaze followed his fingers, her breath got caught in her throat. All sheuld see was nine bolts of lightning surrounding Xuanyuan Mo Ze, forming a cage around him. They stretched from the clouds to the ground, obscuring him from view.","Unable to see him, she wasnsumed by anxiety. Her spiritual energy surged, but sheuldn’t break free. Sheuldn’t understand how Old Man Tianji had managed to immobilize her so thoroughly.","“Rumble!”","The thunder grew louder, and the sky darkened, as if a black cloth had been draped over it.","Fierce winds whipped around them, but the clouds and the lightning pillars remained unmoved. The air grew heavy with foreboding as the cloudsntined to amass and the rumblingntinued.","In the mortal realm sect, Muchen and Muyue who were practicing their martial arts in theurtyard suddenly stopped in their tracks. They clutched their chests, their hearts pounding erratically. They stared at the sky, fear creeping into their eyes.","“Chen’er, Yue’er, is it happening again?” Hao’er rushed to them, pulling them into a tight embrace. “Don’t be afraid. Big Brother is here. Nothing will happen.”","Muchen stared at the sky, his eyes filled with dread. “Big Brother, something terrible is going to happen. I feel it. I’m so scared...”","Muyue bit her lip, her eyes filled with tears."]},{"number":4571,"title":"Chapter 4571: Sacrifice","paragraphs":["Chapter 4571: Sacrifice","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Hao’er hugged them tightly, feeling their small bodies tremble. This level of fear was unprecedented, highlighting the gravity of the situation.","“Don’t worry, it will be alright, everything will be alright.....” He repeatedly reassured them, unsure if he wasmforting them or himself. His heart sank with their fear and anxiety as he tried to calm himself.","Meanwhile, on the mountain, the sky was pitch black. Only the electric cage formed by the nine lightning bolts emitted crackling sounds and bright flashes.","Xuanyuan Mo Ze’s spiritualnsciousness empassed the surrounding area. A fierce storm raged, snapping trees, tearing roofs from houses, and triggering landslides. Chaos ensued as the tribulationntinued, tearing off a piece of the earth ferociously.","The upheaval alarmed everyone in the vicinity, but no one understood the cause.","High above, the long-awaited lightning tribulation, gathering the power of forty-nine days, finally struck. A massive bolt of lightning descended from the clouds, crashing into the center of the nine lightning pillars, causing an explosive boom to resound throughout.","Feng Jiu, whould only watch on helplessly by the side was close to tears. When she saw the lightning strike, she cried out in anguish, “Nooooooo!”","“Rumble! Crackle!”","The thunderclap was deafening, shaking the earth and reverberating through the heavens.","As the lightning struck, Old Man Tianji, who had been standing beside Feng Jiu, rushed towards the lightning cage. His voice echoed in Feng Jiu’s ears.","“Feng Jiu, Xuanyuan Mo Ze is a Lone Star, and your arrival, broke through the heavens, defying fate. Your actions have brought about his tribulation. Even with human determination, fate can prevail. I will sacrifice my life to give him a chance. His survival depends on his destiny. You too will face a heavenly tribulation, a near-death experience. Remember, you must find the method to break the eight extremes of the Heavenly Dao to cultivate a golden body, ascend to immortality, and bme the Supreme over the heavens...”","His words echoed in her mind, causing her heart to pound frantically.","She stared in disbelief as Old Man Tianji’s white figure vanished into the lightning cage. She watched the lightning tribulation strike, the nine pillars of lightning merging into a blinding light.","The thunderntinued to roar, ampanied by the crackling of lightning and the whistling wind.","Torrential rain fell, and theld stung her skin as she slowly regained her senses. She watched as the dark clouds gradually dispersed, the lightning faded, and the surrounding scenery became clearer."]},{"number":4572,"title":"Chapter 4572: Grieve","paragraphs":["Chapter 4572: Grieve","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When her vision cleared, her heart seemed to stop. She stood there, dazed, as if her soul had left her body. She remained silent and still for a long time.","The dark clouds dispersed, the thunder ceased, the wind calmed, and the rain continued to fall. A white figure and a red figure, along with Guan Xilin, Leng Shuang, Leng Hua, and others, descended from the sky. Seeing Feng Jiu standing below, they exchanged worried glances and rushed towards her.","“Little Jiu!”","“Ah Jiu!”","“Master!”","Jun Jueshang, clad in white, held Wanyan Qianhua’s arm. They looked at each other, their faces grave, their gazes drawn to the scorched black mass at the mountain’s peak. A sense of unease settled over them.","“Little Jiu, Little Jiu, what happened? Where is Mo Ze?” Guan Xilin quickly reached her side. He noticed that she hadn’t even activated her spiritual energy barrier, allowing the rain to soak her. Her red dress was drenched, and her ink-black hair dripped water. Her face was streaked with rain and tears.","He tried to shield her from the rain with his robe, but she didn’t even look at him. She walked forward, step by slow step, to the mountain’s peak, where a small pile of charred ash lay. She knelt before it.","Seeing this, the others’ hearts sank. Leng Shuang and Leng Hua silently knelt beside their master.","Jun Jueshang signaled to Wanyan Qianhua, who hesitated before walking to Feng Jiu and squatting beside her. “What happened? What happened to Mo Ze?”","Feng Jiu stared blankly at the ash, her lips moving. “He’s gone. He’s gone...”","Wanyan Qianhua glanced back at Jun Jueshang, his unease growing.","“We sensed the changes in the heavens and earth, the crumbling mountains and the lightning tribulations. We suspected something had happened to him,” Jun Jueshang said, joining Wanyan Qianhua. He looked at the ash, his eyes flickering. “Was he undergoing a heavenly tribulation?”","“Forty-nine heavenly thunderbolts, one each day, for forty-nine days. The lightning grew stronger each day, and today was the forty-ninth,” Feng Jiu murmured. “His body was covered in wounds, not a single piece of intact skin. The lightning had scarred him deeply.”","“Before today’s lightning struck, nine lightning pillars surrounded him. I couldn’t see him. Then, when the lightning struck..... he disappeared.”","Her voice was hoarse and strained. She tilted her head, letting the rain wash her face. She looked at the sky, a sorrowful smile on her lips, and shouted, “Mo Ze! Mo Ze! Come out! Come out!”","Tears mingled with the rain, and her voice grew feeble. “Mo Ze, where are you? Husband, come out, come out... We still have to find our children. How can you leave? How can you leave me and the children behind? Mo Ze, come back. Let’s go home, alright...”","Her figure swayed, as if the exhaustion of the past forty-nine days had finally overwhelmed her. She collapsed under the relentless rain."]},{"number":4573,"title":"Chapter 4573: Don’t Believe It","paragraphs":["Chapter 4573: Don’t Believe It","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Master!”","“Ah Jiu!”","“Little Jiu!”","Seeing her collapse, several people cried out and reached for her. Leng Shuang and Leng Hua, who were kneeling behind her, caught her falling figure.","Guan Xilin stepped forward and lifted her into his arms. “I’ll take her back first. Leng Hua, you stay here...” He glanced at the pile of gray ash, his voice strained. “Gather it up!”","“Yes!” Leng Hua replied, watching them leave. He then walked forward and kowtowed three times before the ash, retrieving an urn to collect it.","Guan Xilin carried Feng Jiu to her residence on the floating island. Wanyan Qianhua and Leng Shuang helped her change her wet clothes, while Guan Xilin paced anxiously outside.","“Do you think Mo Ze is really gone?” Guan Xilin asked Jun Jueshang.","Jun Jueshang pursed his lips. “He is the Sovereign Ruler of Heaven and Earth. He shouldn’t die so easily. But a Heavenly Tribulation is unpredictable. And as you know, we sensed the changes in heaven and earth, and the Heavenly Lightning Tribulation he faced was a rare forty-nine strikes.”","He paused, looking at Guan Xilin. “That pile of gray ash, though Feng Jiu didn’t say it, is likely Xuanyuan Mo Ze’s.”","Guan Xilin clenched his fists. “No! He wouldn’t die like that! He survived the Devil Lord, how could he die from lightning? I don’t believe it! He wouldn’t leave them behind, not like that!”","His eyes reddened, his voice choked. “If he’s really gone, what about my sister? What about their children? He wouldn’t be so heartless!”","“Then explain the ashes. Where is he? If he were alive, would he leave Feng Jiu so heartbroken?” Jun Jueshang asked, looking at the closed door of the room. He sighed. “They’ve been through so much. I thought after the Devil Lord, they’d finally have peace. But more has happened.”","Guan Xilin stared at the stone bench, then at the closed door. “If he’s really gone, how will Little Jiu cope? And the children, if they know...”","He felt a wave of grief. He had grown up without a father and knew the pain. He didn’t want his sister’s children to suffer the same.","“Feng Jiu’s condition isn’t good. This blow will be hard for her,” Jun Jueshang said. Just then, the room door creaked open.","“Qianhua, how is Little Jiu?” Guan Xilin rushed forward.","“She has a high fever, talking deliriously, laughing one moment, crying the next. She can’t sleep, so I had no choice but to tap pn her sleep acupoint. She’s asleep now. I’ll make her some medicine later.” Wanyan Qianhua said, joining Jun Jueshang.","“I’ll go see her,” Guan Xilin said, entering the room.","Wanyan Qianhua watched him go, then asked Jun Jueshang hesitantly, “Do you think Mo Ze is really gone?”"]},{"number":4574,"title":"Chapter 4574: At a loss for words","paragraphs":["Chapter 4574: At a loss for words","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Jun Jieshen wrapped his arm around her waist and said, ‘When the time comes, we’ll know when we go to the piece of heaven and earth he’s in charge of, he’s the Sovereign Ruler of heaven and earth there, and the entire heaven and earth will have his spirit consciousness, and if he’s no longer there, then his spirit consciousness will disappear along with him.’","Hearing this, Wanyan Qianhua sighed softly, ‘You say, how come they have so many trials and tribulations?’","Jun Jieshen patted her hand and didn’t answer, instead saying, ‘Aren’t you going to boil medicine for Feng Jiu? I’ll accompany you!’","Thus, the two of them headed out.","In the room, Guan Xi Rin looked at Feng Jiu who was lying on the bed with a pale face, he could not help but feel sad: ‘Xiao Jiu, there is no hurdle that cannot be stepped over, be strong yourself, think about your children, they are still waiting for you.’","He reached out to probe her forehead, into the hand of a piece of scalding hot, then to the side of Leng Shuang said: ‘first to get her a piece of cloth to cool down the heat, the other people have not come over, you have to take care of more in her side.’","‘Yes.’ Leng Shuang answered and used a wet handkerchief to help her cool down.","On the other side, in the mortal realm, in the sect.","The two of them, Muchen and Muyue, sat there, and their tears fell down without their free will, the two of them wiped away their tears, staring blankly at their tear-stained hands and sleeves, not saying a single word, only that their tears kept falling down.","Hao’er looked shocked, wiping their tears while comforting them, ‘Don’t cry, it’s fine, it’s fine, don’t cry.’","‘Big Brother, I didn’t want to cry, it was the tears that fell down by themselves ...’ Muchen mumbled, he grabbed the lapel at his chest with one hand, his face showing pain: ‘Big Brother, my heart hurts, it hurts so much! ...’","‘Woah! Wooooooooo...’ Yue’er on the other hand cried out with a wow sound, whimpering and crying, now that she said that earlier she was still holding back, then at this moment, she seemed to be unable to hold back the general, her tears were like breaking the dike as they were gushing outwards.","Seventeen went to fetch the food and came back, saw them in the courtyard crying so sadly, shocked and hastily put down the things in his hands and went forward: ‘What’s wrong? Is something wrong?’","No one answered him, because, Mu Chen and Yue’er were both crying so hard that they couldn’t catch their breath, Mu Chen, who was originally just shedding tears and didn’t cry out, followed suit after Yue’er cried out.","Hao’er had never encountered this kind of situation before, he was busy coaxing them, but his heart was getting more and more uneasy. Suddenly, he noticed that the spirit energy aura of the two men was surging along with their crying, as if there was something that wanted to break through, he was stunned for a moment and his face turned a little pale with a brush.","Was the blood curse placed by the Devil Lord about to break? How could it be? That blood curse is to blood source to relatives and under, both parents if in, they this blood curse of bondage will one day will not be easy to be unlocked, and right now ...","Could it be that something has really happened to his Father or Mother?","For a moment, he was flustered, not knowing what to do, but when he saw the spirit energy breath on Muchen and Muyue’s bodies surging with a contraction, he was worried that it would attract the attention of those people in the sect, so he immediately drank to Seventeen: ‘Go and guard the courtyard, no one is allowed to come in!’","As soon as his voice fell, he summoned the silver wolf in the space, when the light flashed and the silver wolf appeared in front of him, he said to him, ‘Chen’er and Yue’er’s situation is a little bit not quite right, it seems as if that blood spell on their body is reacting, you guard the courtyard, don’t let those people come in.’ As he spoke, he hurriedly brought the crying two into the room."]},{"number":4575,"title":"Chapter 4575: Going Forward","paragraphs":["Chapter 4575: Going Forward","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","At this moment, what they didn’t expect was that the people from the upper realm sect were coming down, and at this moment, they were inquiring about things at the sect master’s place.","In the sect’s council hall, an old man in grey clothes stroked his beard as he looked at the sect master and asked, ‘You sent word that there are a few children from the upper realm here? And they also have a Super Sacred Beast with them? What exactly is going on with this matter? You guys tell us carefully.’","‘Back to Your Holiness, the matter is like this ...,’ the Sect Master told them the general story of the matter and said, ‘So we brought them back, and that slightly older child said that Your Holiness is here, and he wants to talk to you guys, and wants to let Venerable One to bring them back to the Upper Realm.’","‘The Xuan Yuan surname? This surname is extremely rare, as far as I know, there are no lineages there in our Upper Realm with this surname.’ The old man pondered and looked at the Sect Master, saying, ‘Do they really not have anyone else accompanying them for protection? Only a Super Sacred Beast level Silver Wolf and a guard with little strength?’","‘Yes, they have been living here for quite some time now, and they usually rarely move around the sect, staying mostly in that courtyard all day long, because they have a Super Sacred Beast’s Silver Wolf guarding that courtyard, it’s not good for us to send someone to keep an eye on them, but it’s true that they don’t have anyone else with them, it’s just their three children and a Silver Wolf and a guard.’","‘Let them come and meet us! Let’s probe them first and find out where they really came from?’ The old man said, lifting his teacup and taking a sip of tea.","‘Yes, I’ll have someone invite them here now.’ The Sect Master said, he wanted to summon a disciple to go, but after thinking, he still said to the Third Taoist Priest at the side, ‘You go and take a trip!’","‘Good.’","The Third Elder also knew that the Sect Master was afraid of that Super Sacred Beast level Silver Wolf, and was worried that the disciple would get into trouble if he went, so after he answered, he bowed towards them and headed out.","Seeing that going to summon someone was just a matter of going to summon someone, and even letting the elders of a clan go forward, the middle-aged man sitting behind the name laughed when he saw it, ‘It seems that you guys are still paying quite a bit of attention to those few children!’","The Sect Master smiled and said, ‘Learning that they are nobles from the upper realm, I would not dare to have the gift of slackness.’","This was one, and the other was that the bloody scene in front of that City Lord’s Manor’s gate was still replaying in their minds, and it really put them in awe, not daring to have the intention of being slack.","Over here, the few people in the main hall chatted with the Sect Master, talking about Hao’er’s few people while waiting for them to arrive, however, after a while, only the Third Elder himself came back alone.","‘Where are they people? Not here?’ The Sect Master asked, slightly surprised.","The third elder bowed towards them before saying, ‘I went to the small courtyard, and that guard Seventeen was guarding outside, saying that a few of them were a little unwell, and would not be able to come today, so I came back first.’","Upon hearing this, the few people from that upper realm sect frowned, one of them said, ‘These few children are really unlikeable, we purposely came for them, but they avoided us? How rude.’","Seeing this, the Sect Master then hurriedly said, ‘I don’t think they would shirk for no reason, I guess they are really unwell, after all, those few children are still young, and they have been looking forward to all of you coming, so naturally it’s impossible for them to use an excuse not to come.’","With that, the Sect Master then looked towards the Third Elder and said, ‘Since they are not feeling well, you should quickly have the Sect’s herbalists go and give them a look!’","As the third elder was about to respond, an old man from the upper realm stood up, ‘Old man’s medical skills are still good, so let’s go take a look!’"]},{"number":4576,"title":"Chapter 4576: Broken","paragraphs":["Chapter 4576: Broken","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Seeing that the old man stood up, the Sect Master also hurriedly got up and said, ‘Since that’s the case, a few of you follow me!’ With that, he personally led the way, taking them towards the small courtyard where the few children lived.","When they arrived at the small courtyard, they saw that standing outside the courtyard was Seventeen, who was dressed in a guard outfit, and when he saw him, the Sect Master said, ‘I heard that the several young masters of your family are not feeling well? These are the honourable masters from the upper realm, they are proficient in the art of healing, why don’t you let him take a look at them!’","Seventeen bowed towards them and blocked in front of the courtyard gate, saying, ‘My Young Master gave instructions that he would not see anyone who comes, so all of you please return!’","‘Since you’re not feeling well, it’s better to take a look.’ A middle-aged man said, stepped forward to go forward, but did not want to, that that guard actually dared to stop in front of him, immediately sank his face, his sleeve flicked, flicked it away.","‘Unbridled! How dare you stop this honourable lord’s path!’","‘Your Holiness rests his anger.’ Door Master saw him strike, worrying about hurting Seventeen that Young Master will be angry, hastily stepped forward with one hand to push Seventeen towards the courtyard, while blocking the airflow that brushed, even if he shot to block, his body was also knocked back a few steps.","Seventeen was pushed inwards by the gate master, avoided the force and did not get hurt, only the body lost balance for a moment, unsteady pace back towards the courtyard, narrowly stabilised his footsteps.","The silver wolf lying in a corner of the courtyard glanced at the movement in front of the courtyard door, then lazily got up, stretched his waist and walked over, just in time to see those few people step to come in, so it was like that directly blocked in front of the courtyard door.","‘Who allowed you to come in? Get out!’ Its gaze contained a powerful pressure, and its voice drank, transmitting a few points of hostility, and it made the several people who had stepped in take a beat, and for a while, did not move forward any further.","‘This is that Super Sacred Beast?’ The old man stroked his moustache, staring at the silver wolf with a glint swept across his gaze.","‘Yes, yes, it is it.’ The Sect Master hurriedly responded.","‘It really is a Super Sacred Beast, and it’s also an extremely rare Silver Wolf.’ The old man said, looking at the silver wolf that opened its mouth to speak human language and asked, ‘Where are you guys from? As far as I know, it is our Upper Realm where Super Sacred Beasts are extremely rare, as well as the surname Xuanyuan, which is also extremely rare.’","The Silver Wolf swept a glance at the few people in front of him, seeing that they were only Flying Immortal Stage cultivators, a trace of contempt crossed his eyes, ‘What Heavenly Realm region is the Upper Realm you are from? What is the name of your clan? The strongest among your clan, what kind of rank has he reached?’","Seeing that this Silver Wolf did not answer his words, but instead threw out several questions, the old man pressed down the displeasure rising in his heart and said, ‘Even if you’re a Super Sacred Beast, you’re still just a beast, so you wouldn’t understand even if I told you, but what about those children? Didn’t you want us to bring them back to the upper realm? If we don’t call them out so that we can ask them what’s going on, we won’t take them to the Upper Realm.’","Silver Wolf glanced at him coldly and said, ‘You guys can come back tomorrow! They are not feeling well right now.’ Its voice had just fallen, when all of a sudden, the few people standing here in the courtyard felt a powerful wave of spirit energy aura surging out from within, instantly causing the hearts of the few people at the entrance of the courtyard to be startled.","‘Ah!’","‘Ah!’","In the room, Hao’er, who was hugging Muchen and Muyue, was knocked out several metres by the aura surging out from them, hitting the wall and falling to the ground again, the powerful aura surging out, shattering the boundary and soundproofing that he had laid down."]},{"number":4577,"title":"Chapter 4577: Probing","paragraphs":["Chapter 4577: Probing","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","‘Puh!’","Hao’er spewed out a mouthful of blood, looking at his younger brother and sister whose spirit energy breath surged greatly from their bodies, he forced himself to stand up with the pain in his chest, ‘Chen’er, Yue’er...’","He quickly stepped forward and came to the bedside to look at the two who had collapsed, calling out worriedly and anxiously, ‘Chen’er, Yue’er, wake up!’ He gently shook them, and soon realised that the spirit energy in their bodies was recovering little by little, and the pure aura from their bodies surged out to fill their surroundings.","Seeing this, he was stunned, hastily reached out and took their pulse, this probe, was even more stunned: ‘Is the blood spell washed away? Why is it like this? Could it be that something has really happened to Father and Mother?’","His heart had a moment of panic and helplessness, the blood curse was good for them, but, how could it be broken for no reason? Then there was only one possibility, their parents, something had really happened.","Outside in the courtyard, worried about Hao’er in the room, the silver wolf rushed into the room almost as soon as the airflow surged, when it came to the room and saw the two little ones lying unconscious on the bed, while the corner of the mouth of its master was covered with blood, it asked: ‘What’s wrong? How are they? Are you alright?’","‘You can’t go in!’ Seventeen tried to stop them, but, how could his strength possibly stop those people?","‘Let the people!’","Only to see that they pushed him away and followed him in with big strides, when they saw the scene inside, the crowd’s complexion moved slightly. Originally thought that saying that a few children were not feeling well was a word of excuses, but did not expect that something had really happened.","‘What’s wrong with them? I’m skilled in healing arts, let me help them take a look!’ Before waiting for the Silver Wolf, who had turned his head back to reveal a fierce look, the old man opened his mouth and spoke, while taking a tentative step forward.","Truly, the existence of the Silver Wolf was very shocking, the fighting power of a Super Sacred Beast, even if they were Flying Immortal level cultivators, they could not fight against it, thus, they did not dare to offend it easily.","Hao’er paused for a moment, then said to the Silver Wolf, ‘Let him come over!’","Seeing this, the Silver Wolf then backed away, but his gaze was still fixed on the old man who stepped forward.","The old man stepped forward in the silver wolf’s hostile gaze, came to the bedside, and after seeing the three children’s faces, he couldn’t help but praise them: they were really outstanding faces.","The old man glanced down at Hao’er and asked, ‘Do you want me to help you look first?’","‘No, look at them.’ Hao’er said, looking towards her brother and sister on the bed.","Seeing this, the old man nodded and stepped forward to probe their pulse, and within a short time, he said, ‘The breath in their bodies is slightly disorganised, but it’s nothing serious.’","‘Just like that?’ Hao’er frowned.","The old man glanced at him and asked, ‘What else? What else?’","Hao’er wanted to ask if the blood curse in their bodies had been lifted, but after thinking about it, he did not ask and instead asked, ‘When will you return to the upper realm?’","‘Since whenever is fine, but ...’ the old man stroked his beard, glanced at him and said, ‘We are now but cannot take you to the upper realm, unless... ...’","Hao’er frowned and said, ‘Speak.’","A flash of calculation crossed the old man’s eyes, and a smile appeared on his face, ‘Unless, inform us of all of your origins and identities, we have to figure out what exactly you are? And whether or not you are from the upper realms? Otherwise, we can’t just bring you guys up.’"]},{"number":4578,"title":"Chapter 4578: Threaten","paragraphs":["Chapter 4578: Threaten","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Hao’er glanced at him coldly, her chin flicked up, a touch of arrogance appeared on her face, she snorted coldly and said, ‘Seeing the Silver Wolf by my side, you should know that we are not children of an ordinary family, even if it’s a Patriarch of a hundred year old family, there is only a part of bowing and curtsying in front of us, you, a small Flying Immortal cultivator, want to make things difficult for you and threaten us with this? Are you not afraid that we will destroy your clan in the future?’","Hearing this, and then see in front of this little boy body emanates out of the noble atmosphere as well as the arrogance of the air, light words out of the words, is to extinguish their clan words, can not help but, so that the old man, together with the back of the heart of the few people are raised, face vaguely show the colour of gravity as well as deep thought.","The small thoughts that had originally risen, also due to the threat and severity of his words and rested, at this moment, they all had to reevaluate and measure the three children in front of them.","Not to mention the pair of twins, let’s say that in front of this little boy of about ten years old, if we talk about it, it’s just a little boy, but, from the time he saw them, no matter whether it’s the look or the demeanour, there is not a trace of constraints and uneasiness, on the contrary, his body naturally exudes a different from his age that should have a calm and cool.","Especially when he said these words, that frown, that tone of voice, that look, was a clear superior posture, as if their strength as Flying Immortal cultivators was not enough to mention in front of him.","What kind of family would raise such a child? What kind of family would raise a child with this kind of temperament? And what kind of parents would give birth to such an outstanding child?","At this moment, they couldn’t help but think deeply, their hearts beating a bit.","It would be fine if it was just these three children, but on the contrary, there was also a powerful Super Sacred Beast by their side, and this was what made them suspicious and dare not take them lightly.","To know, it was their Upper Realm Clan Sect that didn’t have a single such powerful Super Sacred Beast, and what kind of family? What kind of parents would contract such a powerful Super Sacred Beast to a child?","For a while, the original thoughts of threatening them to reveal their origins and identities were dispelled by the counter-threat of this tiny teenager in front of them, thus becoming grave and uneasy.","Not only was it the old man, the few people behind him were the same, the ones who were most alarmed were the Sect Master and the Third Elder, the bloody scene in front of the City Lord’s Manor’s gate that day was enough to make them alarmed, but, the threat that came out of the mouth of this child in front of him was even more shocking.","They didn’t expect that even the venerable masters from the upper realm sects, this child would dare to disregard them, it seems that they are really from extraordinary origins and must not be offended!","Hao’er looked at them, and when he saw each of them staring in deep thought, he said, ‘We are going back to the Upper Realm now, so prepare yourselves and take us back.’","This was no longer a tone of discussion, but a direct order. Because he knew that if he didn’t show strength, these people would take them back, and right now, he didn’t know what had happened to his parents? But from Muchen and Muyue’s situation, he knew that something must have happened!","Therefore, he wanted to go back as soon as possible and bring his younger siblings back to Father and Mother’s side.","‘Return now? Your younger siblings’ situation ...’ the old man said with some hesitation."]},{"number":4579,"title":"Chapter 4579: Frightened","paragraphs":["Chapter 4579: Frightened","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","‘Didn’t you say they weren’t in any serious condition?’ Hao’er asked as she swept a glance at him.","The old man stalled, half speechless.","‘We only arrived today and it’s getting late, even if we want to go back, we should wait for tomorrow!’ The middle-aged man in the back stepped forward and said.","‘Yeah! Young Master, it’s not that bad, why don’t we just rest and prepare today, and then set off early tomorrow morning?’ The Sect Master also stepped forward to persuade.","Hao’er paused for a moment before saying, ‘That’s fine, let’s wait until early tomorrow morning! You guys go out, we need to rest.’","Hearing him directly drive people out, although they were a little annoyed in their hearts, they did not say anything, they just looked at each other before turning around and walking out to leave the courtyard first.","After they went out, Hao’er said to Silver Wolf, ‘Go keep an eye on them, don’t let them sneak away.’","Silver Wolf froze for a moment and gave him an odd look before heading out. Run away? Shouldn’t be able to, right?","Seventeen, on the other hand, retreated and went outside to keep watch.","Only after they left did Hao’er sit down by the bedside, he covered his slightly aching chest and glanced at his fainting younger siblings before he sat cross-legged on the edge of the bed, regulating his breathing to repair the internal injuries he had just sustained from the blow.","On the other hand, the Sect Master took those few people who came from the upper realm to another courtyard to rest, and after settling them down, he was instructed by them to retire, and thus, he didn’t know what the few people in the courtyard were gathering together to talk about.","However, when he exited the courtyard ready to leave, but saw a flash of snow white, he was stunned for a moment, subconsciously looked at, see that the silver wolf eyes with a warning towards his cold sweep, and it gently landed on the roof of the courtyard, looking for a place to lie down.","Seeing this, the corner of his mouth slightly twitching a bit, did not dare to say a word more, quietly left.","In the courtyard, in the house, several Venerable Masters from the Upper Realm were sitting around the table, their faces wearing a few shades of gravity.","‘You guys, what kind of family’s children could these three children actually be? Would they really have that ability?’ The middle-aged man spoke, his face somewhat uncertain.","‘This matter has to be handled carefully, look at him, a child of about ten years old, actually opening his mouth is threatening us to destroy our clan, if this is not really ignorance, then it is really having the stamina and that strength, plus there’s also that Snow Wolf, that’s a Super Sacred Beast, but you guys see, the contracted master of this Super Sacred Beast is that child.’ The old man said with a grave expression on his face, looking at the several people, saying, ‘I’m really worried that they have a great deal of power, if we really offend them, I’m afraid that we will really cause trouble for the sect.’","‘Didn’t that Sect Master say so? Some time ago that kid ordered that Silver Wolf to exterminate a lineage, and the hundred or so cultivators who came to besiege them at that time, along with that family’s Old Patriarch, all died extremely gruesome deaths.’","The other person said, his brows furrowed, ‘I would like to think that since the above also told us to bring them back, then let’s bring them back first! As for their origins, if we can’t ask them, we’ll just wait until we get to the top and have the Patriarch and the others ask them.’","‘I do think that it’s better for us to go back first, if it’s really troublesome to bring them to the sect, it’s better to go back quietly first, they can’t go to the upper realm, even if they want to look for us they can’t find us, isn’t it better this way?’","Several people in the room to discuss, but do not know, their words word for word all fall into the ears of the silver wolf lying on the roof ..."]},{"number":4580,"title":"Chapter 4580: Hope","paragraphs":["A few people made up their minds, ready to quietly go back first, they heard the sound of light knocking from the roof, a few people were stunned, looked at each other, quickly walked outside, came to the courtyard to the roof to look at, this look, can not help but a stiff.","Only see, that silver wolf do not know when to come to their courtyard, is lying on the roof resting, at this time, see them out, actually grin towards them to reveal sharp wolf teeth, tongue lick, with a few points of bloodthirsty breath, inexplicably let them a chill in the heart.","It didn't say anything, just condescending with a warning aura of ferocious gaze coldly staring at them, then let their born mind rest, a few people lightly coughed, one of them said, 'Rest today!' Saying that, he went into the house first.","In another courtyard, after Hao'er adjusted his breath, he felt that the injuries he sustained from the air current had eased some, so he gathered his breath and opened his eyes to look at his brother and sister on the bed.","Seeing that the two of them are still awake and their clothes are slightly damp from sweat, he calls out, 'Seventeen, prepare a basin of hot water and come in.'","'Yes.' Seventeen, who was guarding outside, answered and went to the kitchen to bring a bucket of hot water and a small basin, coming to the bedside, he then asked, 'Young master, do you need your subordinate to come down?'","'No, you go out!' Hao'er said, letting him put the things down before going out first.","Seeing this, Seventeen quietly retreated and went outside to keep watch.","Hao'er just took off their outer garments and helped them wipe off the sweat on their bodies after dipping a handkerchief in hot water, and then used a hot towel to compress their eyes that were slightly swollen from crying, and then she sat down next to them to watch them.","Until, after a while, he saw the long eyelashes of the two people on the bed fluttering gently, he hurriedly called out, 'Chen'er, Yue'er? You guys are awake?'","The two slowly opened their eyes and saw their Big Brother's worried gaze, the two froze, as if remembering something, and called out, 'Big Brother.' Following that, they sat up.","'How are you guys feeling? Is there anywhere in your body that is uncomfortable?' Hao'er hurriedly asked.","The two pursed their lips and looked at each other, of which, Muchen said, 'Big Brother, I think that my sealed memories are restored.'","'Me too, I remember Father and Mother and them.' Yue'er said, biting her lip, and said, 'However, the contracted beast in her body can't be awakened.'","Muchen, on the other hand, said, 'I think that one third of the blood spell in our bodies is loosened, but the rest has not changed.'","Upon hearing this, Hao'er paused for a moment, looked at him and asked, 'Your contracted beast can't be conjured up either?'","'Well, it's as if it's asleep.' Muchen said, his little face was a bit gloomy, he slowly converged his eyes and said, 'Big Brother, something happened to Father, when we broke the blood spell of one of those three people, we felt it, something happened to Father.'","Next to her, Muyue did not say anything, but the tears that could not be stopped easily dripped down silently.","Hao'er's heart sank as he said, 'The people from that Upper Realm Sect have already arrived, and will take us to the Upper Realm tomorrow, so perhaps after we arrive at the Upper Realm, we can figure out how to contact Mother and the others.'","He reached out and wrapped his arms around the two of them, saying, 'Don't worry, with Mother here, Father will be fine.'","Although he said this, he was also clear in his heart that the blood curse in their bodies could be made to move loose, and that this calamity of their Father's was not going to be easy.","Right now, can only hope, everything will be fine!"]},{"number":4581,"title":"Chapter 4581: Waking Up","paragraphs":["The next morning, when they were properly packed, they went out of the courtyard to the front, seeing that the faces of the few people who came from the upper realm were a little hard to see, while Silver Wolf came to their side after seeing them.","'Alright, people have arrived, let's go then!' Those few people said and led Hao'er's few people towards the forbidden land at the back of the sect.","Arriving at a forbidden land in the back, those people stood in the middle, glanced at Hao'er's people and said, 'We are using the transmission array between the two sects to leave, so you guys stand in the middle here.'","Seeing this, Hao'er put the silver wolf into her space while leading Muchen and Muyue forward to stand in the middle, while Seventeen followed and stood behind them.","With the activation of the formation, a complex pattern floated up on the ground, and immediately after, the light flashed, and the several people in the formation disappeared along with that light ...","On the suspended island, Wanyan Qianhua and Leng Shuang took care of Feng Jiu, seeing that she never woke up, Wanyan Qianhua said, 'The fever has subsided, but she just keeps falling asleep and doesn't wake up, this isn't a solution!'","Jun Jie Zhen who followed Leng Hua in from behind heard her words and said, 'Her condition is fine, there won't be any major problems, waking up is just a matter of time.'","Wanyan Qianhua walked over and saw him sitting down at the table, so she also sat down next to him, while looking at Leng Hua who was standing at the side and asked, 'No news from Muchen and Muyue yet? No news from Hao'er either? These three children haven't been outside for a short period of time, how come we haven't found their whereabouts until now?'","'We've already deployed extra manpower to look for them, and I also instructed up yesterday to have the people underneath go to the various heavenly regions to ask for news.' Leng Hua spoke.","'Send more manpower there, and be sure to report at the first opportunity when you find it.' Wanyan Qianhua exhorted.","'Understood.' Leng Hua responded.","'I also don't know how well Guan Xi Rin went back to that heavenly realm to check? Has all of Mo Ze's spirit consciousness dissipated?' Wanyan Qianhua murmured, somewhat unable to sit still and stood up again.","Seeing her this annoyed, Jun Jieshen held her hand and said, 'Alright, it's useless for you to be anxious, it's better to wait for news! Stay here for this period of time and stay with Feng Jiu more, see what we can do to help, then help out.'","'What can we help? You see things are like this now, we can't help with anything.' Wanyan Qianhua said in a bad mood, but still eased his annoyance and sat down.","'Master has woken up!' Leng Shuang's surprised voice came, Leng Hua rushed forward, and Wanyan Qianhua was also delighted, and hurriedly got up and came to the bedside.","On the bed, Feng Jiu slowly opened her eyes, and when she saw the few of them, as if she hadn't slowed down, she asked, 'Why are you all here?'","'Making such a big commotion, can we not come?' Wanyan Qianhua said, her beautiful eyes glared at her, sitting on the edge of the bed and holding her hand, counting, 'You, you really don't know how to take care of yourself, how did you get yourself into this state? Even the biggest hurdles in the world will always be overcome, but you don't even care about your own body, now that you're sick, what energy do you have to fuss about other things?'","Feng Jiu listened to her counting down, her face had no expression either, she was just stunned, as if she was thinking about something, after a long time, she struggled to get up.","'You are still sick! The fever has been burning for the whole night, this fever has just subsided, what do you want to do again?' Wanyan Qianhua said, pressing her down to prevent her from getting up.","Feng Jiu grabbed her hand and asked in a hoarse voice, 'Where's Mo Ze? Sister? Where is Mo Ze?'"]},{"number":4582,"title":"Chapter 4582: A Trace","paragraphs":["Hearing her words, Wanyan Qianhua thought of the pile of ashes at the top of that mountain, for a moment she was a little speechless, she suppressed her undulating mood with astringency and heartache and said, 'Don't be anxious, get well first, we didn't see Mo Ze when we came here, but Guan Xi Rin has already gone to Mo Ze's part of the heaven and earth to check it out, and there will soon be news coming in.'","As Wanyan Qianhua spoke, seeing that she was already in better spirits, he couldn't help but ask, 'What the hell is going on here? Aren't you guys looking for a child? How could this happen again all of a sudden?'","Feng Jiu lay down and muttered, 'We had said that we were going to look for the child, but as a result, suddenly his body's spirit energy breath couldn't be suppressed, and he wanted to advance, and that mortal realm couldn't withstand his advancement, so we came here in a hurry, just that, I didn't think that the lightning tribulation that day was that powerful ... '","'In fact, not only is this sky echoing with the sound of lightning tribulation, even our side has hidden movements.' Jun Jieshen stood aside with a negative hand, looking at Feng Jiu on the bed, with doubts in his eyes, he asked, 'However, why did the lightning tribulation last for so many days this time? How could the power be that powerful?'","'I don't know, there was nothing unusual when the lightning tribulation first moved, but gradually, it became not quite the same, even Old Man Tianji who never goes out of the Heavenly Mountain came.' Feng Jiu murmured, thinking of Old Man Tianji, thinking of that scene, for a while, his throat choked a little.","'This tribulation is the Heavenly Tribulation, the lightning tribulation will last for ninety-nine to eighty-one days, once it starts it can't be stopped, it's either life or death.' Her voice was permeated with hoarseness as she spoke word by word.","'But, the heavenly lightning tribulation that Mo Ze underwent, only lasted for seventy-seven forty-nine days, the forty-ninth channel of heavenly lightning, it was as if it had condensed the power and force of each of the previous channels of heavenly lightning, when that channel of heavenly lightning appeared, I knew it was bad ...'","She paused for a while, for a good half-long while, before she astringently said, 'I wanted to go and help him block that lightning tribulation, but I was bound by Old Man Tianji with an ancient method, and I was unable to move half a step, and at the time when that forty-ninth lightning tribulation struck down, Old Man Tianji, he, he rushed out ...'","Listening to these words, several people were silent, their hearts heavy, even if they hadn't seen that scene with their own eyes, they knew that that scene, must have been extremely treacherous.","'Old Man Tianji is Mo Chen's master, right? Did he, did he die just like that?' Wanyan Qianhua couldn't help but ask, saying, 'Hasn't he long since jumped out of the Three Realms of Red Dust and is a person outside the world? How could he die just like this?'","Feng Jiu closed her eyes and said in a hoarse voice, 'That pile of ashes, I wonder if it was Mo Ze's? Or Old Man Tianji's? Or perhaps, it was both of them?'","In her mind, the words Old Man Tianji Zi transmitted at that time suddenly echoed, her heart was slightly stunned, she suddenly opened her eyes and muttered, 'A ray of hope?'","'A ray of life?' Wanyan Qianhua glanced at Jun Jiezhe and then asked Feng Jiu, 'What first line of life? Is it saying that Mo Ze has a ray of hope?'","'Help me up.' Feng Jiu said and looked at Leng Shuang.","Seeing this, Leng Shuang carefully helped her to sit up, and after letting her lean back and sit on the head of the bed, she quietly withdrew a few steps, came to the table and poured a cup of water, while saying to Leng Hua, 'Go to the kitchen and bring the warm porridge over, in a moment, give the Master something to eat first.'","'Good.' Leng Hua responded, before retreating.","Leng Shuang brought over the water and said, 'Master, drink a cup of water first to moisten your throat!'"]},{"number":4583,"title":"Chapter 4583: Unknown","paragraphs":["'I'll do it.' Wanyan Qianhua said, taking the water in Leng Shuang's hand, carefully feeding it to Feng Jiu to drink before handing her the empty cup.","After a cup of water moistened her throat, and her throat felt a lot more comfortable, Feng Jiu leaned back and sat down, looking at Wanyan Qianhua, and asked, 'Sister, did you say that my brother went to the piece of heaven and earth that Mo Ze is in charge of?'","'Yes, because you were passed out earlier, we didn't know how Mo Ze was doing, so we asked him to go on a walk to see.'","Wanyan Qianhua held her hand and said, 'Even if you don't see his person, even if you can't find him, don't worry about it for now, he's the monarch of that heaven and earth, as long as he's still alive, that heaven and earth will surely have his spirit consciousness present as well.'","'Old Man Tianji fought with his life for a ray of hope for him, I think, he might still be there.' Feng Jiu also gradually calmed down at this time, sorting things out and analysing carefully.","'With Xuanyuan Mo Ze's strength, if he passes this hurdle, he will be the immortal body.' Jun Jieshen said, looking at Feng Jiu, saying, 'Think on the bright side of everything! He, should not die that easily.'","'As long as he is still alive, there is no need to worry, one day, he will definitely come back for you and the child.' Wanyan Qianhua comforted.","'Porridge is here, Master, drink some clear porridge first!' Leng Hua came in with the congee.","'Leng Shuang, you guys take care of her, I'll go to the kitchen to see about getting her some body tonic, her good body has been tossed and weakened.' Wanyan Qianhua said, standing up to make room for them, letting Leng Shuang and Leng Hua take care of her.","'We will take care of the Master.' The two of them responded and watched the two of them leave the room before they went up to feed their Master congee.","And outside, Jun Jieshen accompanied Wanyan Qianhua towards the kitchen, and halfway there, Wanyan Qianhua asked, 'You said that Mo Ze will be an immortal body after passing this level? But he has only gone through seven seventy-fourty-nine lightning tribulations, so this shouldn't be considered a pass, right?'","Jun Jieshen sighed softly and said, 'How can an immortal body be so easy to repair? Over the past ten thousand years, we have hardly heard of any strong person who has cultivated an immortal body, and looking at all the parties in the world, how many of them can reach the strength of Feng Jiu and Xuanyuan Mo Ze? Not to mention an immortal body?'","Hearing this, Wanyan Qianhua frowned and said, 'The two of them were already extraordinary, how many things that the others couldn't do they did, this hurdle, they will definitely step through it as well.'","'But ...'","Wanyan Qianhua's voice lurched as she looked at him and asked, 'With Xuanyuan Mo Ze's strength, if this hurdle is really over and he remoulds his immortal body, then won't he also directly ascend to the Nine Heavens?'","Jun Jieshen glanced at her and said, 'Who in this world knows about that sort of thing? No one has succeeded in ascending for tens of thousands of years, so who knows what kind of heaven and earth will be after ascension?'","He looked at the sky, walked slowly with his hand on his back, and said softly and slowly, 'In this world, the way of heaven is the most unpredictable ...'","Wanyan Qianhua listened, silent and did not speak, and did not know what he was thinking.","On the other side of a heavenly realm, Hao'er and the others who came up from the mortal realm were transported along with that teleportation array, and went directly to the back of that sect's mountain teleportation array.","When they appeared at the formation, several children's figures were slightly shaken for a moment, apparently unable to stand, and Seventeen even directly fell to the ground, the next few people just coldly watched, not even reaching out to pull on a hand.","'Here is our upper realm sect, you come with us!' The old man said, glanced at Hao'er a few people, then negative hand stride in front."]},{"number":4584,"title":"Chapter 4584: Departure","paragraphs":["It felt that after these few people arrived at this upper realm sect, their attitude towards them was also suddenly different, as if they had some more backbone than before.","That's right, originally in the mortal realm clan, even if something really happened to start fighting, they only have a few people to fight with, but to this upper realm clan is different, if a big clan here, even if it is due to the pressure of the silver wolves and combat power, but in terms of the bottom of the air, it will also be more than before.","Noticing this, Seventeen saw those people walking ahead, so he lowered his voice and said to Hao'er, 'Young master, we're just going to follow them like this, do we need to take precautions?'","'We're already here, let's go check it out first!' Hao'er said, looking at Mu Chen and Muyue, 'You guys stay close, don't run around, got it?'","'Mm, Big Brother don't worry, we know.' The two little ones nodded, indicating that they wouldn't cause him any trouble.","As early as they arrived at the sect and appeared in the middle of the teleportation array, there were disciples from the sect who hurriedly went to report.","And when they were walking with a group of people, followed by a few children and a guard behind them, the sect's disciple sized up those three children after bowing to the few honoured ones in front of them.","'You guys see, those three children are so good looking, those two little ones look exactly the same, their features are exquisite and very delicate, looking at them makes people want to kiss them.' A female disciple said, her eyes glowing brightly as she looked at the two little dolls, Muchen and Muyue.","Muchen was holding his Big Brother's hand, walking expressionlessly with a taut little face, not even looking at those people, holding a look of a small adult, but it caused those female disciples to have bright eyes and follow closely.","As for Muyue herself, she was quite smiley, with a quirky little look, a pair of soulful eyes glowing with a cunning light, her delicate and delightful little face revealed an innocent and harmless smile at the people around, causing those disciples to resist the urge to lean forward.","Watching those Venerable Masters in front walk farther ahead, Yue'er then let go of her Big Brother's hand and rushed to the side to ask sweetly at a woman with a clear appearance, 'Pretty Big Sister, what sect is this place?'","'We are here in the Shangqing Sect, little sister, where are you from? How come you're back with several of our venerable masters?' The woman couldn't help but reveal a smile even as she listened to her soft and sticky voice calling sweetly.","'The Upper Clearance Sect ah, then what Heavenly Realm territory is this pretty big sister?' Yue'er asked again.","The woman was a little slightly surprised that such a young child asked such a strange question, however, she still said, 'This is the Leaving Heaven Realm's East Xuan Continent.'","After Hao'er and Muchen, who were waiting for her at the side, heard this, Hao'er then held Yue'er's hand and said, 'Let's go!'","'Bye pretty big sister.' Yue'er raised a sweet smile as she waved her hand and shouted.","The few people in front glanced back at them, but didn't say anything, just walking in front until, bringing them to the main hall above the main peak.","As early as after the disciple's briefing, the sect's Patriarch and several Elders, as well as the Peak Masters of the various peaks, were already seated in the hall.","'Patriarch, several venerables have returned.' A disciple came in and reported.","'Invite them in.' The middle-aged man at the main seat said, his low voice spreading as he did so, and that disciple answered in the affirmative and ran out.","Not long after, those venerable masters came in with Hao'er's few people."]},{"number":4585,"title":"Chapter 4585: Settling In","paragraphs":["The people in the great hall, their scrutinising and probing gazes naturally landed on the three children. Even if it was them, at this moment, when they saw the three children's appearance and aura, they still could not help but secretly sigh in admiration.","At such a young age, they had the appearance of a dragon and phoenix, so it could be seen that their parents must be extremely outstanding characters.","Thinking about the fact that the contracted beast of the older child among them was still a Super Sacred Beast, the hearts of the crowd were slightly moved. A Super Sacred Beast, if owned by their clan, could become a clan protector divine beast.","'Sovereign.' The few people who entered arched their hands and bowed respectfully.","'All of you have worked hard, and take your seats first.' The Patriarch said, brushing his hand for them to sit aside.","A few people responded and went to the empty seats on the left and right sides to sit down, then followed the crowd and looked at the three children standing in the hall.","'What are your names?' The Patriarch inquired, his gaze looking at the three Hao'er.","'Duplicate surname Xuanyuan, single name, Hao.' Hao'er said, not overbearing, his gaze looking straight at the middle-aged man sitting at the top.","'Xuanyuan Hao?' That Patriarch was slightly contemplating, when he heard a soft and glutinous voice coming from him.","'My name is Xuanyuan Muyue, this is my twin brother, Xuanyuan Muchen.' Yue'er said with a smile, a delightful smile filling her small face, appearing so harmless and innocent.","The Patriarch nodded and looked at them, asking, 'I heard that you guys also have a Super Sacred Beast?'","'Not bad.' Hao'er responded, his expression indifferent.","'Where is it? Can you summon it out for us to take a look?' A middle-aged man sitting on the lower left side spoke.","Hao'er glanced at the man and did not refuse, but directly summoned the Silver Wolf. With a flash of light, the majestic Silver Wolf appeared in front of the crowd.","'Hiss! It really is a Super Sacred Beast!'","The people who were originally sitting drew in a breath of cold air, while the few people who were closer to the Silver Wolf couldn't help but stand up and retreat to the back, distancing themselves from the Silver Wolf.","Looking at the silver wolf with a majestic aura, the crowd's complexion moved slightly, and after looking at each other, they suppressed their minds.","'Which clan are you guys from? What are your parents' names? May we need to bring them here?' The clan inquired, their gazes falling on the three children.","This time, the two younger ones didn't say anything and just looked at their Big Brother.","Hao'er, on the other hand, paused for a moment and said, 'Thank you, Sect Leader, but it's not necessary, we'll just go back down the mountain on our own.'","Seeing that they didn't even mention their clan or their parents' names, the eyes of those present flickered slightly, and one of them said, \"What are your parents\" names? The Xuan Yuan surname, as far as we know, there is no Xuan Yuan surname in this continent.'","Hao'er pursed her lips and did not speak.","'How about this! You guys take a rest first, and we'll talk about the rest later.' As the Sovereign said this, he said to a middle-aged man sitting below him, 'Left Peak Master, you take them to settle down!'","'Good.' That middle-aged man stood up and glanced at that silver wolf before saying to the three children, 'You guys come with me!'","Hao'er thought about it for a moment before he took his younger siblings and followed that man away, while behind him, Silver Wolf and Seventeen followed.","After watching them leave, the people in the great hall were silent for a moment, and after a while, an old man who had brought Hao'er's several people from the lower realm spoke up, 'Patriarch, I'm afraid that these children only come from an unusual background, would it be better for us to leave them here ...'"]},{"number":4586,"title":"Chapter 4586: Thoughts","paragraphs":["'These three children, either one of them is extraordinary.' That Patriarch stood up, walked slowly with his hand on his back, came to the middle of the great hall and said, 'The child called Xuanyuan Hao, but is only ten years old or so, but has already reached peak Golden Core cultivation, and acts calmly and steadily, not overbearing, not humble, and his body even naturally exudes an air of dignity, from this it can be seen that this child, must have an extraordinary origin, and has extremely high talent. '","His voice lurched, turning to look at the crowd, he asked, 'I wonder if you guys have noticed that pure spirit energy aura on those two twins?'","The crowd was stunned and fell silent for a moment.","As if the Patriarch also expected that they would not speak, he merely glanced at them before continuing, 'The Spirit Energy aura on their bodies is extremely pure, I have lived for hundreds of years, and this is the first time I have seen children with such a pure Spirit Energy aura on their bodies, my guess is that the one they have on their bodies should be an Innate Spirit Energy, or perhaps... . be innate spirit bodies themselves.'","'Hiss!'","As the crowd listened to his words, they drew in a breath of cold air, somewhat surprised and shocked.","'Innate Spiritual Body? It's that kind of Innate Spiritual Body that comes along once in a hundred years? It is said that cultivators with that kind of physique can cultivate at a speed of a thousand miles a day! It can be called a ghost talent!'","For a while, the minds of the crowd moved slightly, and one of them said, 'Sovereign, these few children, we have to keep them in the sect.'","'Admit them as disciples of the sect, such seedlings cannot be allowed to leave.' Another person spoke.","Listening to their words, an elder stroked his beard, pondered, and said, 'Do you guys think that they will be willing to stay? Don't forget that they still have a Super Sacred Beast by their side, and in terms of that Super Sacred Beast's combat prowess, even if all of us join forces, we might not be able to tame it.'","As soon as his words came out, the crowd instantly fell silent.","Indeed, the three children they were capable of taking down, but that Super Sacred Beast would ...","That old man who had spoken earlier glanced at the crowd, then said, 'Patriarch, I actually think that it is possible that they are not from this part of our heaven and earth.'","'Not from this part of our heaven and earth? How is that possible?' Another person was a little surprised, even in disbelief, 'If they are not from the mortal realm below, then they are from our place, where else could they be?'","'I also think it's highly likely that they're not from our Li Tian Realm.'","Another middle-aged man also spoke, looking at the Patriarch, saying, 'We've spent a little time with them down below in the Mortal Realm, and then when they inquired about our Patriarch and what this Heavenly Realm is called from the disciples in the sect when they came here, we had our suspicions in our minds, but we were just, a little less sure.'","Upon hearing this, the Patriarch pondered for a while, then said, 'In that case, let's find a way to probe their words first! Before that, don't let them leave yet.'","'Yes.' The crowd responded, before leaving one after another.","On the other hand, Hao'er's few people followed that Peak Master to a courtyard, and that Peak Master then smiled and said, 'You guys can rest here first! If there is anything you need to do, just leave it to the disciples.' Saying that, he didn't stay for long, just leaving two disciples to guard the courtyard gate for them to call on.","Seventeen, on the other hand, naturally took over the two disciples guarding the courtyard, and at the same time sent them away to help them prepare some food.","The three children and Silver Wolf then entered a room, and after looking around, Big Brother Yue'er asked, 'Big Brother, what are we going to do now?'"]},{"number":4587,"title":"Chapter 4587: Getting to Know","paragraphs":["'Stay for now! They won't let us go.'","Hao'er lowered his voice and spoke, gesturing for the two to sit down before saying, 'This isn't a place we're familiar with, nor is it where Mother's Phoenix Guard forces are located, and it's even less of a place Father's Palace of Hell's Palace's people can get to, right now, we can only stay here first, and on the one hand, secretly inquire to see if there are any cultivators who have heard of Ghost Healer's name.'","'Big Brother, it's all Yue'er's fault for being useless, if Yue'er could have awakened the little fox, perhaps we would have been able to return.' Yue'er lowered her head with some self-blame.","Seeing this, Hao'er rubbed her head and said, 'Yue'er is already very good and well behaved, Father and Mother would be very happy if they knew that you are so well behaved and obedient, and know how to protect yourselves.'","'I also wonder how Father is doing now?' Muchen said with a somewhat gloomy look.","'That Sovereign's strength is at the Immortal Venerable level, with such strength, I feel that there will definitely be cultivators from other heavenly realms travelling in this Li Tian Realm.' Silver Wolf said, looking at the three of them, saying, 'Instead of going to secretly investigate, it would be better to directly put out information to inquire, if the name of the Ghost Doctor is spread in such a place, cultivators who have heard of her and know about her will definitely come up to this sect to find out what is going on.'","'But this way, will it attract Father and Mother's enemies?' Hao'er is a little worried, if the strength of the incoming people is too strong, even with Silver Wolf by his side, I'm afraid he won't be able to protect his younger siblings.","'The risk is naturally there, but this is also the fastest way, and with their reputation being as loud as it is, I think that cultivators nowadays shouldn't dare to provoke them to seek their own deaths if they don't think their lives are too long, right?' The silver wolf was resting on the ground aside while looking at the three children, in fact, for the human mind, it was complicated and difficult to understand, it couldn't quite figure it out either.","Hao'er thought for a while, then said, 'If that's the case, it would be better to directly reveal our identities to the patriarch of this clan to know, so that we can prevent them from laying hands on us, and on the other hand, we can also get them to help us look for it.'","'The gazes of those of them looking at you guys aren't quite right, I think they're either fixated on me, a Super Sacred Beast, or on the three of you.'","Silver Wolf lazily said, stretched his waist and said, 'Don't look at them as a big clan, but sometimes these clans have the most unseemly things inside them, what should be guarded against should still be guarded against, you said to tell them your identity, I think it's also feasible, at least this way, they wouldn't dare to hit on your ideas.'","'Then let it be so!' Hao'er said, looking at Muchen and Muyue, saying, 'I'll tell you guys to do it ... like this,' he leaned forward and whispered the idea to them in their ears.","The two younger ones listened and nodded as they took serious notes, 'Mmmmm, we know.'","In the evening, the two venerable masters came in pairs, and saw that the two twins were sitting at the stone table in the courtyard, resting their chin and staring at the sky, and there was no one else there, and that silver wolf was nowhere to be seen, the two of them looked at each other, and were just about to go in, when they heard that soft and sticky voice come out.","'Brother, when I grow up I want to be a Ghost Doctor like Mother, and I also want to be the Sovereign Ruler of Heaven and Earth, and I also want to be very, very powerful.'","Hearing the message in those words at first, it instantly caused the two Venerable Lords' faces to change, and the footsteps that were originally prepared to step inside stopped, the entire person standing there rigidly."]},{"number":4588,"title":"Chapter 4588: Chills Rising from the Soles of Their Feet","paragraphs":["The two of them looked at each other, both of their eyes were horrified and shocked, and even their breathing slowed down a bit. It was as if they couldn't even hear what was being said in the courtyard, and all that filled their minds were the words in the little girl's soft and sticky words that made them smell the wind and change colour.","With their minds rumbling, they quietly backed away, step by step, until, after arriving more than ten metres away, the two of them gasped for air.","'This matter is not to be trifled with! We have to report it to the Patriarch immediately!'","'Right, hurry up!'","The two of them came in slow steps and hurried back, carrying a horrified and shocked heart as they swiftly headed towards the Patriarch's place.","They didn't know that right after they left, the two little ones in the courtyard looked at each other and revealed wry smiles.","The two Peak Masters hurriedly went straight to the courtyard where the Patriarch was located, and when they arrived in the courtyard, they saw that the Patriarch was drinking tea and chatting with a few Elders in the courtyard, so they quickly stepped forward.","'Patriarch, we have something important to report.'","'Oh? What is it that makes the two of you so anxious?' The Patriarch looked at the two in surprise.","'We were just thinking of going to those three children to probe the situation, but who knows, we had only walked outside the courtyard before entering, when we heard those two twins talking in the courtyard.' One of them spoke sharply.","'What words could make you two change your faces so drastically? Could it be that they are thinking of leaving here quietly?' An elder inquired.","'No.' The two Peak Masters shook their heads, and one of them said, 'That little girl told her brother that when she grows up in the future, she wants to be a Ghost Doctor like Mother, and that she wants to be the Sovereign Ruler of Heaven and Earth.'","'What?'","Hearing these words, the few people sitting instantly stood up in shock, and the Patriarch said in a trembling voice, 'You, you say that again?'","'That little girl said that when she grows up, she wants to be a ghost doctor like Mother, and that she wants to be the Sovereign Ruler of Heaven and Earth!' That Peak Master spoke once more, and his face went a little pale.","Ghost Doctor, Lord of Heaven and Earth, no matter which one it was, it was something they could not afford to offend, nor did they dare to do so.","Even if they were in this Heavenly Realm, they had heard of that Ghost Doctor's mighty name, and the Sovereign Ruler of Heaven and Earth, was the sovereign of a Heavenly Realm territory, and the strength of his power was something that even a three year old child would know about, not to mention, that this Ghost Doctor and the Sovereign Ruler of Heaven and Earth, were originally one person!","'You, you guys didn't hear it wrong, right? That Ghost Doctor Feng Jiu couldn't possibly be here in our Leaving Heaven Realm ah, what's more, those few children don't even have a strong protector by their side, how could they ...'","An elder spoke, but, the more he spoke, the smaller his voice became, because, it was true that those three children did not have a powerful and strong person secretly escorting them, but, they did have a Super Sacred Beast!","If earlier, they still felt that their origins were mysterious not knowing what family they were from, but right now at this moment, the words they heard, and that Super Sacred Beast, were already enough to explain everything!","'Those three children are not surrounded by strong people, but there is a Super Sacred Beast ah...' another elder murmured, at first hearing this news, he was also shocked and found it unbelievable.","'Patriarch, they, their compound surname Xuanyuan ... is Xuanyuan ah ... why didn't we think of that Xuanyuan Monarch ... ' the third elder said in a trembling voice, his face slightly white.","They were just here discussing how to lay hands on those three children, how to keep that Super Sacred Beast as their Patriarchal Divine Beast, but at this moment, it was so shocked that chills were rising from the soles of their feet."]},{"number":4589,"title":"Chapter 4589: Worrying","paragraphs":["The Patriarch forced himself to calm down, as he took a deep breath and exhaled it slowly, easing his mind that had risen and fallen violently due to the shock, before saying repeatedly, 'Fortunately, fortunately, we didn't do anything, we didn't do anything.'","It was unknown whether he was comforting himself or the others, but after hearing his words, the faces of the several elders gradually eased.","Yes, they had only just raised that thought, they hadn't done anything yet, nothing, things hadn't been out of hand yet.","At this time, those two Peak Masters looked at each other, and one of them hesitantly asked, 'Patriarch, do you think that the Ghost Doctor that that little girl said in her mouth, could it be that Ghost Doctor Feng Jiu from the legend?'","The Patriarch also calmed down at this time and said in a deep voice, 'Other than that Feng Jiu, who in this world would dare to call themselves a Ghost Doctor? Only, if those three children were really the children of those two, how did they end up straying into the mortal realm? And finally brought to us?'","'Patriarch, why don't we go and ask! If they really are those two's children, then it's really three little ancestors here, we not only can't touch and bump them, but we also have to protect and provide for them, otherwise, if something goes wrong, I'm afraid that it's hard for our Patriarch, or even all of us, to escape from the calamity!' The Grand Elder said, at this time a heart was in a state of flux, some panic, some shock, and some excitement.","If it was really the child of those two, and their clan protected them safely, perhaps, in the future, they would still have a chance to meet that legendary Ghost Doctor Feng Jiu.","'This matter is of great importance, it's good for you few to know, don't leak it out for the time being, how things really are, let's go and ask before we discuss.' The Patriarch spoke in a deep voice, his gaze sternly sweeping over the several people in the courtyard.","The several Elders and those two Peak Masters heard this and immediately said, 'Don't worry Patriarch, we will keep our mouths shut!'","Thus, several people hurriedly headed towards that small courtyard, intending to ask the truth in person.","In the small courtyard, the three children were sitting in the courtyard, while Seventeen and the two disciples carrying the evening meal placed the dishes and rice on the table, the two of them then retreated, while Seventeen stood aside.","'Brother, is this meat?' Yue'er blinked a pair of big curious eyes, looking at some meat froth inside the dish, and asked with some surprise.","Muchen looked at the dishes on the table, pursed his lips, looked at Seventeen and asked, 'Is this all they eat here? I don't even see any meat, and, how come there's no soup?'","Seventeen glanced at the two disciples outside, so he said to them, 'The people in the kitchen said that this is the standard for the outer disciples' meals, the inner disciples already abstained from eating grains, while the outer disciples normally eat like this, and if they want to add more dishes, they have to add crystals.'","Hao'er frowned, took out a cosmos sack and handed it to Seventeen, saying, 'Remove these! Let the kitchen redo them, they should have spirit beast meat or something like that.'","'There is, but it says that that's what the higher-ups like the Patriarch and Peak Master eat, and they don't allow their subordinates to touch it.' Seventeen said, thinking of the faces of those people in the kitchen, his face also chilled.","He originally thought that the several young Masters were growing their bodies and wanted them to get something better for them to eat, but who knew that the people in the kitchen were pushing and shoving these meals to them and then letting them go.","Upon hearing this, Hao'er's eyes moved slightly, and when he saw Seventeen's hands moving to remove the dishes on the table, he pondered for a moment before saying, 'Leave them there! Remove it later.'"]},{"number":4590,"title":"Chapter 4590: Spirit Fruit","paragraphs":["Chapter 4590: Spirit Fruit","Seventeen was slightly stunned, but he didn’t ask much, he just took a step back and stood aside.","The two little guys on the other hand looked at their Big Brother, seeing that he didn’t say anything either, they picked up their chopsticks and picked at the dishes on the table, and since they hadn’t eaten much until now today, their stomachs grumbled.","‘Let’s eat the fruit first to pad our bellies.’ Hao’er flipped her hand and took out two spirit fruits for them to eat.","‘Good.’ The two of them responded and took the fruits and were about to eat them when they heard footsteps coming from outside, and by the sound of it, it seemed that several people had come!","‘Sovereign.’ The two disciples on guard saw the visitors and hurriedly saluted and called out.","‘You guys retreat! There’s no need to wait here, I’ll call you if I need you.’ The Grand Elder said, allowing the two disciples to retreat first.","The two responded with a yes and retreated.","The two Peak Masters automatically stayed at the courtyard gate, but were facing the inside of the courtyard, listening and watching with their ears sideways, after all, they were also now very curious about the origins of these three children.","However, after the Patriarch and a few Elders entered the courtyard, they felt that the atmosphere in the courtyard was a bit strange, seeing the three children sitting at the stone table, with meals on the table, so the Patriarch revealed a smile and asked, ‘Are eating?’","However, when they approached, they saw that the dishes were ruffled a bit, and it looked like they weren’t eating.","‘We didn’t eat, these dishes aren’t tasty, there’s no meat, and there’s no soup.’ Yue’er said softly, leaning her hands against the stone table, the red spirit fruit she was holding then also fell into the eyes of the Patriarch and the several Elders.","Seeing that red spirit fruit, several people’s gazes contracted, their breathing became a little chaotic, and their footsteps even took a big step forward without their free will, however, right at this moment, a gaze that they couldn’t ignore fell straight onto their bodies with a powerful pressure, causing their bodies to instinctively stiffen.","Turning his head to look, that silver wolf was lying not far away staring at them, and also opened his mouth similar to yawning, revealing those sharp wolf teeth.","‘You this fruit ... ‘ Sovereign asked, before the words were finished, he saw that little girl took the fruit and clicked a bite, eating while saying, ‘We are hungry, the meal is not good, so we can only eat the fruit. ‘","‘Ka-ching!’","Next to him, Muchen also brought the spirit fruit to his mouth and took a bite in those people’s burning gaze, and ate it unhurriedly, the clicking and chewing sound heard the Patriarch and several elders gulping straight.","Even if they haven’t seen that Spirit Fruit, they also know that the Spirit Fruit that emits that kind of rich Spirit Energy is absolutely extraordinary, and right now, it is actually being used by them as a tummy-filling fruit to eat, it is really a waste!","‘Seventeen, remove the food! Take the crystals and have them redo it.’ Hao’er spoke at this time.","And the patriarch and several elders also slowed down, glancing at that meal, the patriarch then said, ‘It must be that the people below didn’t deliver, third elder, in a moment, you go and deliver a message, their food according to ours, and deliver the kitchen to do it carefully, and today’s first send ours over for them to eat first!’","‘Yes.’","The Third Elder answered and smiled at Seventeen, ‘Go outside and call two disciples to come in, tell them to just remove these, there is no need to give crystals to the kitchen, I will give instructions in a while.’","Seeing this, Seventeen answered and went outside to call two disciples in to help remove the dishes and re-serve them."]},{"number":4591,"title":"Chapter 4591: Questioning","paragraphs":["Chapter 4591: Questioning","It didn’t take much time to bring the Sovereign’s and their portions directly from the kitchen, as they saw that the three children hadn’t eaten yet and said that they were hungry, they couldn’t be bothered to ask questions at this point in time, and when they saw that the food was almost ready, the Sovereign said, ‘You guys eat first! We will first go outside and sit for a while, in a while when you guys are done eating, we have some things we want to ask you.’","‘Hmm.’ Hao’er answered, then first scooped a small cup of stewed soup into a bowl for Yue’er to drink, and then helped Muchen scoop a bowl.","After seeing the different meal from earlier, Yue’er’s eyes lit up and she ate it with a smile.","And the few people of the Sovereign who went to the trees not far outside the courtyard looked at the courtyard and sighed silently.","‘Patriarch, that spirit fruit they ate just now, it seems to be the Longevity Fruit.’ The fourth elder said, paused for a moment, and said, ‘That longevity fruit can increase longevity, it’s a treasure wherever you put it, but I didn’t expect that they would actually take it to an ordinary fruit and eat it, it’s really a waste!’","Patriarch lightly exhaled a breath, negative hand, said: ‘In fact, came to this trip, ask or not ask, I think there is not much need, can take out those two spirit fruit of the child, and Super Sacred Beast in the side of the protection, but also surnamed Xuanyuan, is not the child of those two, and will be whose child?’","‘It is said that when the ghost doctor’s child was born, it was indeed a pair of twins, and at that time, the commotion made a big fuss, and all the monarchs went to congratulate each other and bestow blessings, and then look at those two little ones, that little look and that delicate, and at a young age, they have that kind of a temperament, and if they say that they are not their children, it is not possible to say that it is not possible to say that it is not possible to say that it is not possible to say that it is not possible to say that it is not their children.’","The Grand Elder said, just slightly puzzled in his heart, saying, ‘Just, if it’s their children, how would they stray?’","‘Let’s wait for them to finish eating and then ask why! Even if it’s certain, we have to hear the reason from their own mouths.’","While several people were talking here, over there, after the three children had finished eating and touched their stomachs and burped, Hao’er looked at Seventeen and asked, ‘Did you save a portion for yourself?’","Seventeen was stunned, shook his head, and said, ‘No need to keep it, the young masters and young ladies can’t finish it, the rest of Seventeen will be fine.’","He had heard that these were different from the previous ones, the rice in these were all spirit rice, the meat was also spirit beast meat, and the soup stewed was also soup made from precious medicinal herbs, the Peak Master and the Patriarch and the others ate the things that the kitchen there were dumbfounded as soon as they heard that they were sent here.","How could he be so good as to ask for another copy of such a precious thing? What’s more, the three Little Masters couldn’t finish it, and he already had enough to eat the rest of them.","However, Hao’er frowned when he heard this, seeing that there are still quite a few things on the table, the soup is also scooped out, the vegetables are also pinched out, the rest of them have not been touched, and it doesn’t really matter if they eat them themselves, so he said to Seventeen, ‘You can just eat what you want today! Next time you keep a portion up for yourself.’","‘Yes.’ Seventeen busily responded, seeing the three of them out of the courtyard, heading up to clean up the meal and soup to put it aside first, and then go eat it later, and was about to follow when he saw Silver Wolf walking past him.","‘You don’t need to follow, go eat! This king will just go and take a look.’ The Silver Wolf said, walking forward step by step with a calm pace, following the three children unhurriedly.","Seeing this, Seventeen then returned to the courtyard and quickly settled the rest of the things.","Under the tree, when the Patriarch’s few people saw the three children coming over, they revealed a smile and asked, ‘Is the meal still to your liking?’","‘Mmmmm, delicious and filling.’ Yue’er said with a smile.","‘Hehehe, that’s good, in fact, we came over today because we wanted to ask you guys, your Mother, is her name Feng Jiu?’"]},{"number":4592,"title":"Chapter 4592: Promise","paragraphs":["Chapter 4592: Promise","Upon hearing this, the two younger ones blinked a pair of surprised eyes at him, as if they were surprised at how he knew.","Hao’er, on the other hand, glanced at them and said, ‘Not bad.’","Even though they had long believed it in their hearts, when they heard them admit it in person, the hearts of the crowd still shook fiercely. It was actually really the children of those two!","Several people’s breathing instantly went haywire, their breath slightly ragged. They glanced at each other, and among them, the Grand Elder couldn’t help but enquire, ‘Then how did you all end up in the Mortal Realm? And there’s no one around to protect you? Didn’t you guys inform your parents?’","One by one, questions came out of the Grand Elder’s mouth, and what he asked was exactly what the Patriarch’s few people wanted to know.","‘We had some accidents, we can’t tell you in a sentence or two, since you guys know our identities now, do you have a way to help us contact our parents?’","Hao’er inquired, her gaze falling on the Patriarch’s body as she said, ‘As long as you can help us contact them and let us go back, when we see my parents in the future, we will definitely let them thank us with generous gifts.’","Hearing these words, several people’s hearts that had managed to ease down violently rose and fell again, not only the several elders, even the Patriarch, an incredulous and surprised light floated up in his eyes.","‘You mean, as long as you help you guys return to them, you will be thanked with generous gifts in the future?’ The Patriarch couldn’t help but ask, thinking of a generous gift that was not other than the Ghost Doctor’s medicinal pill.","Ghost Doctor Feng Jiu’s name spread all over the heavenly realms, but all cultivators with some cultivation in their bodies have heard of her great name, and also know that her alchemy is unrivalled in the world, one of her medicinal pills can make a cultivator who has been stagnant for many years unable to advance easily break through, even if it’s a serious illness, as long as she is willing to do so, naturally, she can get rid of the disease with the help of medicine, just that the Ghost Doctor’s medicinal pills are worth a lot of money, and wanting to obtain one of her medicinal pills isn’t easy.","If they escorted the three children safely and let them return to their side, perhaps, they could get the medicinal pill gifted by her, moreover, this love of mutual protection could be far more useful than other benefits.","Thinking of this, they looked at each other in an agitated mood and secretly clenched their hands, easing their undulating agitation.","The Patriarch took a deep breath and tentatively asked, ‘What if we don’t want anything else, and only want to ask for a medicinal pill that can advance us?’","‘Yes.’","Hao’er said, looking at the few of them, saying, ‘During the period of time when we haven’t gone back yet, guarantee our safety, and at the same time, find a way to help us get to the side of our parents, and I can promise you all that after it’s done, one of you will be gifted with a medicinal pill that will help you advance.’","Because, not only did their Mother know how to refine medicinal pills for advancement, Fan Lin also knew how to do so, this was not a difficult task.","‘Good! We’ll take care of this matter!’ The Patriarch said immediately, his eyes glowing with joy.","After they finalised this matter here, the three Hao’er went back to the courtyard first. The Patriarch discussed with a few elders, and called those two Peak Masters, telling them about the matter in general, and also handing over that there was no need to send any more people to guard outside this courtyard, and at the same time, treating them as honoured guests.","In the Patriarch’s courtyard, several Elders and Peak Masters gathered together, and the Third Elder asked, ‘Patriarch, how are we going to inform the Ghost Doctor? We can’t even get to the Heavenly Realm where they are from here, so how are we going to send them back?’"]},{"number":4593,"title":"Chapter 4593: Hope","paragraphs":["Chapter 4593: Hope","‘There are some travelling cultivators from other heavenly realms here in the Departing Heavenly Realm, so we can put up a list to look for them.’ The Patriarch said, his voice lulled, and added, ‘With the three children and that Silver Wolf here, even if we want to block the news, we won’t be able to do so for long, there are many people in the sect, and as the days go by, even if no one guesses their identities and origins, that Super Sacred Beast will inevitably attract other people’s inquiries.’","‘Then what does the Sovereign mean?’ An elder asked.","‘I’m going to first open a list to look for those travelling cultivators, and then proceed to ask if any of them could be from the Heavenly Realm where the Ghost Doctor is from or from a clan, and when the news of the three children being here can’t be hidden any longer, then we’ll just release the news directly to go, it’s just that that would be a certain risk, as there are quite a lot of enemies for them as well.’","Speaking here, that Patriarch’s brows were slightly condensed, ‘But this way the news is transmitted fast as well, if the Ghost Doctor’s enemies know about it, then the Ghost Doctor’s people will definitely know about it as well, and before that, all we have to do is to ensure their safety.’","‘We know, so let’s do it then!’ The Grand Elder said and stood up, ‘I’ll go make the arrangements now.’","Thus, on this side, they quickly set about making the arrangements. On the other side, Hao’er and the others were sitting in the courtyard, holding their chins and looking at each other.","‘Big Brother, how long do you think it will take for them to help us find a way back?’ Yue’er asked curiously.","Hao’er shook his head, ‘I don’t know, but if we want to go back quickly, we just need to make a big commotion here, Mother and the others will definitely know.’","‘A big commotion ah? Then do we make it?’ Yue’er blinked and asked.","When Muchen heard this, he said, ‘If we make a big commotion Mother and the others know about it, Father and Mother’s enemies will also know about it, and if we fall into the enemy’s hands before they can find us, then it will be troublesome.’","‘Let’s see first! There’s no rush for this.’ Hao’er said, then looked at the two of them and said, ‘During this period of time, you should also cultivate more, and if you encounter danger in the future, you must find a way to keep yourselves safe.’","‘Mm, we know.’ They responded, and after staying in the courtyard for a while, they went back to their rooms to rest first.","On the other side, Guan Xi Rin rushed back to the hovering land, seeing Feng Jiu who gradually recovered, he then said, ‘Xiao Jiu, I went to Mo Ze’s piece of heaven and earth to check it out, on the very day he advanced and encountered the heavenly tribulation, his piece of heavenly territory had mountains crumbling and winds and clouds shifting, and the storm raged for three days, I stayed there for a few days, checking out the news from various places before I hurriedly rushed back. ‘","Feng Jiu listened, pursed her lips and asked, ‘Is he still in spirit consciousness?’","Guan Xi Rin nodded, ‘Not bad, although his piece of heaven and earth had a strange movement, his spirit consciousness is still there, only, it has become very weak, and if it is not carefully probed, it cannot be detected at all.’","He looked at her, wanting to tell her that that spirit consciousness was so weak that it could barely be detected, and that most likely, Mo Ze was in a bad way, but, the words that came to his mouth were involuntarily swallowed back after seeing the gaze that brightened up after she heard his words.","She still has hope in her heart, why would he bear to break her hope?","‘I knew it, he will definitely not die so easily.’","Feng Jiu said in surprise, the colour in his eyes overflowing, ‘He must be healing somewhere, or is facing some kind of calamity, when he is healed, or the calamity is over, he will definitely come back!"]},{"number":4594,"title":"Chapter 4594: Searching","paragraphs":["Chapter 4594: Searching","Seeing this, Wanyan Qianhua, who was on the side, asked, ‘Then what are your plans now? Or are you still looking for the child first? I heard Leng Hua and Du Fan and the others say that you’ve already searched quite a few places, and the approximate range has been differentiated, so I can’t say when you’ll meet or have news of them.’","‘Find the child first, Mo Ze he ...’ Feng Jiu’s voice lurched, said, ‘Where is he now? I simply don’t know, the child has not been found, he originally also has been reading to find the child, always have to find the child back first.’","‘Then what other places are you looking for that you haven’t found? We’ll help to look for them as well.’ Wanyan Qianhua spoke.","Upon hearing this, Feng Jiu looked at her, as well as Jun Jieshen by her side, and said, ‘The two of you, husband and wife, have been here for some days now, and the child isn’t with you, so can you rest assured? Why don’t you guys just go back first! The matter of finding the child, we will go and find it.’","‘Our child is following his Uncle in the Easy Sect, there is no need to worry about him.’ Jun Jie Zhen spoke nonchalantly.","Wanyan Qianhua also said, ‘Don’t worry about it blindly, our one is just like the Little Demon King of the Mixed World, he is treated like an ancestor up and down in the Loose Sect, even if we don’t go back for a year and a half, he won’t miss us.’","Hearing them say this, Feng Jiu paused for a moment, then said, ‘Alright then! I’ll tell you guys in detail about the places you still have to find.’","As soon as Guan Xi Rin heard this, she also followed and gathered around, ready to also find places they hadn’t gone to yet to look for and take their chances.","Seeing this, Du Fan, who had already been here for a day or two, followed suit and gathered around, listening to their Master speak there, and looking at the remaining places that they had yet to go and find in the Mortal Realms.","‘You guys say, could they have reached the Mortal Land Realm? How else could there be no news at all?’ Guan Xi Rin said, pointing at the map drawn by Feng Jiu herself, saying, ‘This place is marked as the Mortal Realm, you guys haven’t gone to find it yet.’","Feng Jiu thought about it and said, ‘Good, if there is any news, you will pass the news to us, and for the rest of these places, we will look for them separately.’","So, they mapped out the places in the room, Jun Jieshen’s Wanyan Qianhua had been here with Feng Jiu these days, and was also resting, this would divide the Heavenly Realm territories to look for, then the two of them would leave first as well.","‘Master, then we will also go to look for it first, as soon as there is any news, we will notify with the summoning jade token.’ Du Fan looked towards Feng Jiu and said.","‘Go!’ Feng Jiu nodded and watched the two of them leave in a group before saying to Guan Xi Rin, ‘Brother, you just came back, rest for a day before moving!’","‘It’s alright, it’s not like I’m tired, I’m leaving too, take care of yourself, take care of your body.’ Saying that, he looked at Leng Shuang and said, ‘You follow Little Nine around and watch her more.’","‘Good.’ Leng Shuang answered.","Thus, the people left one after another, leaving only Feng Jiu and Leng Shuang Leng Hua here. Seeing their Master looking outside, the two Leng Shuang siblings looked at each other and asked, ‘Master, let’s leave too!’","‘Well, let’s go!’ Feng Jiu responded, gathered her mind and headed out with them.","Half a month later, the capital city of the mortal realm.","Guan Xi Rin looked at the bustling mortal capital city, thinking of the rumours he had heard along the way in the past half month, he couldn’t help but let his eyes flicker slightly.","There weren’t many people who cultivated Immortals in the Mortal Realm, after all, this kind of place had a lack of Spirit Energy, and cultivators wouldn’t be willing to come here."]},{"number":4595,"title":"Chapter 4595: Clues","paragraphs":["Chapter 4595: Clues","Only, when he arrived here to ask around a little bit, but he heard that there seemed to have been traces of immortals here, and all the way he chased after them, he didn’t see any traces of any immortals at all.","He walked forward with big strides and came to a tea stall by the roadside to sit down, ready to have a cup of tea to rest his feet and inquire about the news.","‘Brother, have you heard anything about any Immortals in this Imperial City?’ Guan Xi Rin asked a few men who were sitting next to him drinking tea and chatting.","Those few people are talking, suddenly hear ask about the immortal thing, they will look towards that person, but see that person has a big beard, tiger waist and bear waist, looks formidable, the heart is surprised when, then said: ‘This thing is not something rare, when ah ...’","A few people will be when the emperor ordered to look for the immortal traces of things, and then later the arrival of the immortal things with him.","Listening to the words of the several people, Guan Xi Rin frowned, and after chatting with them for a few moments and asking some side questions, he sat down and sipped his tea while contemplating.","This place is lacking in spirit energy, cultivators cultivating here is extremely difficult to advance, even if there are people who cultivate immortals, they should not come here, let alone ...","As he was thinking, he heard another person beside him say, ‘What rare thing is not here in the Imperial City? Didn’t the Young Master of the Pan Family conclude that he wouldn’t survive the night? In the end, he still survived?’","‘That’s right, when I heard that the Emperor also let the Imperial Doctor went to diagnose, the city’s doctors almost all went, one by one said that he is not alive, but did not think that one night later still alive, the doctors are saying that the Young Master of the Pan family must have some great fortune.’","Hearing these words, Guan Xi Rin was stunned and turned to look at the man who spoke, saying, ‘Did this Young Master of the Pan Family have some kind of disease? What person healed him later?’","‘Hahaha, I know that you are outsiders, that Young Master was on the way back to the ambush, carried back to the house on the remaining breath hanging, the city doctors do not dare to drug, the palace doctor also let the Pan family to prepare for the aftermath, where there is who to heal him? It was he himself who survived after one night.’","The man said, laughed, and lowered his voice said: ‘I tell you ah, this city privately in the rumour, that the Pan family Young Master brought back the three children are estimated to be immortal children, you did not see the three children’s appearance look how good, and that the body of the temperament, tsk, have seen the people say, the palace of the prince can not compare.’","Guan Xi Rin’s eyes flickered, his heart lifted: ‘Three children? What kind of children? Are they still around now?’","‘Two boys and a girl, but one boy is slightly older, the other two are twins, I’ve seen them follow the two Young Masters of the Pan family out shopping, the Pan family said that they were their distant relatives, but ah, when the Immortal’s matter was spread not long after that, those three children disappeared.’","‘The twins! Where is the Pan family? Where?’ Guan Xi Rin was so excited that he grabbed the man who spoke and asked straight out.","‘What are you doing this man? Quickly let go, hiss ... ‘ The man was held by Guan Xi Rin’s wrist, for a moment his face was crooked with pain, he couldn’t struggle away, he was busy pointing, ‘The Pan family is almost unknown in the Imperial City, if you go along this road and find someone to ask around, you’ll know. ‘","As soon as his voice fell, he saw the man let go of his hand, and in the next moment, he had already disappeared.","‘Huh? Where is the man?’ The man said in a daze, only to see, on the table, a gold coin, as well as a cup of tea that was still steaming ..."]},{"number":4596,"title":"Chapter 4596: Inquiring for Information","paragraphs":["Chapter 4596: Inquiring for Information","Guan Xilin stood in front of a mansion, looking at the plaque in front of the door with the word Pan Manor written on it, after a pause, he walked forward and knocked on the door.","The housekeeper came to open the door, see is an unseen man, originally opened the side of the room door can not help but half cover back, some vigilant look at the visitor: ‘Your Excellency looking for what person?’ Indeed, in front of this person a handful of moustache half cover the face, and grow tiger waist and bear back, the aura and is very scary.","‘I’m looking for the Young Master of your house, Pan Ning.’ Guan Xilin said, while touching the beard growing out of his chin, in fact, he just didn’t shave for ten days and half a month, could it be that it was already scary?","‘I wonder if Your Excellency is?’ The butler inquired again.","‘Just tell your family’s Young Master that I’m the uncle of those three children and have come to inquire about them.’ Guan Xilin spoke in a deep voice.","Upon hearing this, the butler was stunned, so he said, ‘Your Excellency, please take a seat.’ With that, he closed the door behind him and hurried in to report again.","Pan Ning was talking to his Big Brother when he heard the butler hurriedly come in, ‘Big Master, Young Master, there’s a man with a tiger’s waist and a bear’s back outside, saying that he’s Young Master Hao’s and their Uncle, and that he’s come over to inquire about news.’","Hearing this, the two in the courtyard were slightly surprised, Pan Ning frowned and said, ‘Could it not be some kind of crook?’","Pan Hong, who was sitting next to him, then said, ‘Let’s go take a look! Whether it’s a fraud or not, we’ll know once we ask.’ With that, he said to the butler, ‘You invite the person to the front hall, we’ll be there in a moment.’","‘Yes.’ The butler responded, before retreating.","‘Go!’ Pan Hong signalled, pushing the wheelchair to the front courtyard.","Seeing this, Pan Ning followed suit, when the two arrived at the front hall, there was already a person sitting there sipping tea, seeing them come in, the other person’s measuring gaze fell on them, as the person’s gaze fell on the two, the two had a chill in their hearts, looked at each other, and hit the ground running.","Before speaking, but the other party’s aura was already on display, and that gaze even carried majesty and oppression, definitely not something a liar would have.","‘My name is Pan Ning, this is my elder brother Pan Hong, I don’t know who your honour is?’ Pan Ning performed a salute and asked.","‘Guan Xilin.’","He spoke in a deep voice, his gaze tracing over Pan Hong’s legs without a trace, then landing his eyes on Pan Ning’s body, saying, ‘I heard that you had three children living here some time ago?’","‘Not bad, those are distant relatives of my family.’ As Pan Ning spoke, his gaze also fell on Guan Xilin’s body, secretly sizing it up.","Next to him, Pan Hong just looked at Guan Xilin and did not speak.","Although this man had a beard on his chin, half covering his face, but he could also see that the lines of those facial features were outstanding, only, saying that he was the Uncle of Hao’er’s three children was half-believable, which could not help but make him a bit sceptical.","Hearing him say that the three children are their distant relatives, Guan Xilin did not say anything, but only asked: ‘Is the big one ten years old? The two younger ones are three or four years old? And are they twins, looking exactly the same and very delicate?’","‘Not bad.’ Pan Ning responded. It wasn’t a secret, they had taken a few children out, and many people in the city had seen their faces.","‘They are my nephews, please tell me, where are they now?’ Guan Xilin spoke directly, a heart slightly excited, finally, there was news of the three children."]},{"number":4597,"title":"Chapter 4597: Getting to Know","paragraphs":["Chapter 4597: Getting to Know","‘Your honour said that they are your nephews, I wonder, how can your honour prove it?’ Pan Hong, who hadn’t said anything, opened his mouth to enquire, his voice faint and with a calmness.","Upon hearing this, Guan Xilin smiled in the sun, and was somewhat favourably disposed towards their carefulness and vigilance. After all, there wasn’t anyone who informed them of the three children as soon as they arrived, which was obviously also protecting the three children’s safety.","Thus, the breath on his body slowed down as he picked up his tea and took a sip, saying, ‘How do you guys want me to prove it? What I know, you may not know.’","The two Pan brothers looked at each other, only to hear Pan Hong say, ‘Then your honour will tell us, and we will listen.’","Seeing this, Guan Xilin glanced at him and said, ‘Three children, the older one is called Xuanyuan Hao, the younger two males are the older brother, called Xuanyuan Muyhen, and the younger sister is called Xuanyuan Muyue, they were accidentally stranded out in the world after something happened, they, are not from your mortal realm.’","His gaze fell on Pan Hong, saying, ‘You are now in a wheelchair, however, the injuries on your body should have been fatal in the first place, to be able to survive, I guess it was because they took their Mother’s medicinal pills to save you, right?’","Guan Xilin said, his voice gave a beat and laughed, ‘To be able to let them take out medicinal pills to save your life, it seems that you guys are still treating them well.’","Hearing these words, the hearts of the two men shook, and they were almost certain that this man was indeed the Uncle of Hao’er’s several people. Just as they were about to speak, they heard, once again, his voice.","‘It’s that I wonder if they have told you that their Mother is a ghost doctor?’","Upon hearing this, the two Pan brothers looked at each other before saying, ‘We believed what your honour said, only, the three of them are no longer with us.’","Guan Xilin frowned and asked, ‘Then where did they go? Could it be that someone took them? Is there anything physically wrong with them being here?’","‘At first it was that they didn’t tell us in detail, then one time I asked them, it’s just that the two younger ones seem to be unable to remember their parents, their memories seem to be somewhat forgotten, but Hao’er won’t be, Hao’er is very protective of his siblings, and also takes good care of them, there is no problem with their bodies, there’s no need to worry about that.’","Pan Ning said, then added: ‘No one took them away, but the thing is, when ...’","He will at first how to meet the three children, and how to bring them back to the Pan family, as well as some of the circumstances when they lived in the Pan family, to the end into the palace out of those things, as well as how to leave in the end, all of them together with him carefully said clearly.","Hearing the experiences of the three children, Guan Xilin’s heart sank. They were still so young, but they had to face all this alone, and it was fortunate that Hao’er was by Muchen and Muyue’s side, otherwise, I don’t know how much suffering they had to endure.","‘So, you don’t know where the island they are going to is?’ Guan Xilin looked at the two and asked.","‘I don’t know, he only told us that it was called Floating Edge Immortal Island, saying that he wanted to go there to see if he could find a way back.’ Pan Ning spoke.","Hearing this, Guan Xilin didn’t say anything for a long time, he thought that he could find their whereabouts, but he didn’t want to think that this Pan family didn’t know that the place was here, however, the only thing worth being happy about was that at least he knew that they were in this mortal realm.","‘Good, I see, since they aren’t here, I won’t stay long.’ He said as he stood up, and after giving them a fist salute, he stepped outside."]},{"number":4598,"title":"Chapter 4598: Training","paragraphs":["Chapter 4598: Training","After leaving, Guan Xilin informed Du Fan and Wanyan Qianhua and the others of the news he had inquired about with a summoning jade, asking them to come over here to help look for them. As for Feng Jiu, they didn’t want to let her have a good time, so they didn’t inform her, intending to wait until they found the child, and after they had ascertained where they were located, they would only tell her.","Meanwhile, on the other side, in the sect, as the news spread, almost every day, there were cultivators coming from all over, wanting to meet Hao’er and Muchen and Muyue, as well as the Super Sacred Beast.","There was no other reason but because they had heard that the three children were the children of Ghost Doctor Feng Jiu, so they were inevitably curious. However, very quickly, news came out that it was only the three children and a Super Sacred Beast that were here, other than that, there were no more strong people around them.","Once this news spread, it almost made the strongest people from all sides a bit intrigued. Only, even if they had any thoughts, they only dared to think about it and did not dare to put their thoughts into action.","However, there were still some people who fought with the idea, wanting to put up a fight, after all, there are only three children here, but there is no strong person to protect them, if they hold the three children, and then try to find a way to uncontract them with that Super Sacred Beast, and then contract that Super Sacred Beast themselves ...","Just thinking about it, it already made their hearts excited and difficult for them to admire themselves.","The people who have these thoughts are only those who don’t have a family, and they are always out training and adventuring, they don’t have the so-called worries, and they only think about themselves, and they only have one life, so even if there is only one line of opportunity, they want to put up a good fight and try it out.","As for those who have a family, but never dare to have that thought, even if not afraid of that Super Sacred Beast, they are also afraid of the parents behind the three children, those two can be a legend, even if it is not in the same heavenly realm, they have heard of their great name, and how would they dare to offend?","What’s more, there are still people from the clan protecting them, to go against those kids is purely asking for trouble.","On this day, Hao’er watched Muchen and Muyue practicing martial arts in the courtyard. Suddenly, he jumped to the big tree in the courtyard and sat on the tree, he picked a few leaves and attacked the two small figures below.","Muchen and Muyue saw their Big Brother go up the tree, and were about to stop when they saw a concealed weapon coming, the two of them instantly dodged to avoid it, but who knows, another concealed weapon also came, and while they rolled over and leapt to dodge it, they realised that the so-called concealed weapon was in fact just two leaves, and it was also shot out by their Big Brother.","Before they had the chance to ask, the leaves came at them again, each one carrying a spirit energy aura, as sharp as a knife.","However, the leaves were originally only three or five, but the more leaves that came from the back, the more they came, which made the two little ones a little anxious to avoid them, and their breath was also a little short of breath.","Hao’er took the leaves to practice their agility, after about a column of incense, he saw a leaf towards Yue’er, Yue’er didn’t have time to dodge, and saw that it was going to cross her arm, at that moment, he reached out his hand and flicked, a stream of air came out and flicked away the leaf, dissolving the possibility of Yue’er being injured.","‘Yah!’ Yue’er backed up at the same time, her feet mixed a bit, the whole person fell down and sat down with a low cry, she looked at Big Brother who was sitting on the tree, slightly gasping for breath, ‘Big Brother, Yue’er is tired, Yue’er rest for a while.’"]},{"number":4599,"title":"Chapter 4599: Trouble","paragraphs":["Chapter 4599: Trouble","Upon hearing this, Hao’er then nodded, ‘Well, that’s it for today! You guys read a book or practice your calligraphy, Big Brother is going out for a bit and will be back later.’","‘Big Brother is going out? Not taking us with him?’ Muchen asked.","‘I’m not going out of the clan, I’ll just quietly go and check on the situation for a while and come back later, you guys don’t want the door, I’ll leave Silver Wolf here with you.’ Hao’er said, looking towards the silver wolf resting on the corner of the wall, he gave a word of explanation, then he went out of the courtyard by himself.","There in the Patriarch’s main hall, the other Venerable Masters and Peak Masters who did not know that Hao’er had promised the Patriarch and several Elders their advancement pills were at that moment in a state of disbelief and anger.","‘Patriarch, those three children cannot stay in our clan, they have to be expelled.’","‘Not bad, it was just that we didn’t know that they were that ghost doctor’s children earlier, but now that we know and the news has spread, if we keep them here, it will only cause endless trouble for our sect, since we can’t make a move against those three children, it’s not too much to drive them out, right?’","‘Yes Patriarch, we don’t need to hitch our clan for three unrelated children, not to mention, they have a Super Sacred Beast protecting them, even if we let them leave, the average person outside won’t be able to get close to them, since that’s the case, why bother keeping them in our clan?’","‘Patriarch, let them leave!’","‘Elders, you guys persuade the Patriarch! We are not related to those three children, why should we take our sect’s elite disciples for them? In the past two days, disciples have guarded the mountain gate to prevent those people from sneaking into the sect, and a dozen or so disciples have already died, if this continues, when will it end?’","Listening to the Venerables and Peak Masters sitting in the hall, the Patriarch was a bit distracted, he frowned and swept them away, saying, ‘That Ghost Doctor Feng Jiu is the Monarch of Heaven and Earth, and his reputation has spread far and wide! Now that their children have come here and there is no one to protect them, since we have stumbled upon them and it so happens that the people are here in our sect, how can we push them out? What’s more, it’s still three children that young.’","He glanced at the crowd and said in a deep voice, ‘If it’s really as you all said, pushing the three children outwards, if they were to encounter danger out there, would you all be able to have peace of mind? What’s more, at this point, even if we push them out and let them leave our sect, could it be true that they have nothing to do with our sect?’","‘This matter is already one that we have chosen to protect, then we have to protect it to the end! Today, I’ll put my words here, no matter what kind of things happen, we have to protect them!’ The Patriarch said, his voice lulled as he looked towards the seated Elder and said, ‘Grand Elder, how is the enquiry about that inquiring news going?’","The Grand Elder shook his head and said, ‘During this half a month’s time, there were a hundred and ten people who came up to our clan, I have also asked and probed them one by one, most of them are people with wrong intentions, wanting to take the three children away straight away, but there is a travelling cultivator who has an unfathomable strength and is said to come from elsewhere as well, and now he has already been settled in the guest house. ‘","‘Patriarch, those people at the bottom of the mountain, let me lead the people to expel them!’ The Third Elder stood up and spoke, ‘I will be able to guard the mountain gate and not allow a single one of them to come up!’","‘Good!’ The Patriarch said, slapped his thigh and said, ‘I’m very relieved that you’ll be the one to do this, if there’s any need to mobilise the disciples, you’ll mobilise them directly!’ Saying that, he handed him a token.","Seeing the Patriarch even handing over the token to the third elder, the look sitting underneath moved slightly, wanting to speak but asking nothing."]},{"number":4600,"title":"Chapter 4600: Old Mountain Demon","paragraphs":["Chapter 4600: Old Mountain Demon","‘All disperse!’ The Patriarch said, stood up and looked at the crowd, ‘Put away your petty thoughts, right now, the people are in our Patriarch, protecting their safety is the most important thing, don’t think about anything else.’ As soon as his voice fell, he took a step outside.","On the other side, Hao’er avoided people walking in the sect, inquiring about the current news, and after learning that the third elder had brought his disciples to guard the mountain gate, he went around for a while, and returned to the courtyard first after probably figuring out the current situation.","However, two days later, a huge team of people surrounded the sect gate, looking at the incoming people, the third elder guarding the mountain gate’s face changed, and immediately instructed the disciple beside him to quickly go and report to the sect master.","‘Quickly! Quickly go and invite the Patriarch! Just say that the Black Mountain Sect’s Old Predecessor has come in person!’","Hearing that, that disciple immediately turned around and swept towards the sect’s gate, quickly going to inform. As for those scattered cultivators who were originally at the mountain gate, once they saw that the team that came was the famous Black Mountain Sect, their faces changed slightly and they immediately retreated.","‘Look guys, that one is the Old Predecessor of the Black Mountain Sect, Old Mountain Demon, I heard that he has already reached the Heavenly God level, his strength is extraordinary, it seems that this time, when he came here, he also came for that Super Sacred Beast.’","‘If it’s him, the others should be hopeless, this Old Mountain Demon is notorious, he’s not a good person to deal with, he won’t care if that’s the Ghost Doctor Feng Jiu’s child or not, what’s more, the mountain is high and the emperor is far away, it’s said that the Ghost Doctor Feng Jiu and the others aren’t here either.’","‘That’s not true, if it’s with the strength of this Old Mountain Predecessor, he might actually be able to subdue that Super Sacred Beast, moreover, even if it’s this sect master, his strength is not as good as the Mountain Predecessor who has been famous for a long time.’","‘It seems that this time, this sect will either hand over those children and that Super Sacred Beast, or else, this sect will have to be saved.’","The surrounding casual cultivators were talking, their words tinged with sighs, as well as the excitement of watching. They wanted to know, in the face of such a strong enemy, would this sect still be strong enough to protect those three children and that Super Sacred Beast?","In the sect, the patriarch who heard the news changed his face and immediately stood up, ‘What? Who did you say is coming?’ His eyes widened in shock, his usual composure lost, and instead, a shocked look appeared in his eyes.","‘It’s the Black Mountain Sect’s Old Mountain Demon in person, the Third Elder ordered the disciple to come and quickly invite the Patriarch to go.’ That disciple said, and hurriedly reported as the Third Elder had said.","The Grand Elder beside him had a grave expression on his face, ‘This Black Mountain Sect’s Old Mountain Demon has been in seclusion for many years, I didn’t expect that he would come out of seclusion at this time, if he comes, Patriarch, what should we do?’","There is no one in their sect who has that strength to deal with Old Mountain Demon Demon, if it is a hard fight, I am only afraid ...","‘Let me think, let me think.’ The Patriarch walked in the courtyard with his hand in his hand, the look of anxiety on his face was that obvious.","The Grand Elder’s few people stood by the side, their hearts also somewhat uneasy and hesitant.","They knew that once the identities of those three children were spread, they would surely attract powerful enemies, however, they didn’t expect that even that Old Mountain Predecessor, who had been in seclusion for many years, would come.","This person had become famous in his early years, his methods were cruel, and his fighting strength was extraordinary, if they went up against him, I was afraid that they would only end up dead.","If that was the case, even if that Xuanyuan Hao promised them that he would give them a medicinal pill to advance in the future, it would be of little use."]}]);
